(1211437, 153364, 15381, '<td valign="top">its a very flat image...some dodging and burning on the darker parts of the rock would''ve given much needed depth and added a higher score to a nice photo</td>', 'its a very flat image...some dodging and burning on the darker parts of the rock would''ve given much needed depth and added a higher score to a nice photo', '2005-03-07 00:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211439, 153018, 15381, '<td valign="top">the horizon tilts left...otherwise this is strong</td>', 'the horizon tilts left...otherwise this is strong', '2005-03-07 00:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211440, 152443, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view! Contact me sometime, because I need images of Greek and Roman theatres for my online theatre class!<br/> <br/>In this image, the lines lead my eye nicely up into the photo, right to the temple up on that hill. You have a lot of middle ranges here, some of which may be better had they been darker. You might simply try to add a bit more contrast to whiten up your whites and darken your darks. Nice work. 7</td>', 'Nice point of view! Contact me sometime, because I need images of Greek and Roman theatres for my online theatre class! In this image, the lines lead my eye nicely up into the photo, right to the temple up on that hill. You have a lot of middle ranges here, some of which may be better had they been darker. You might simply try to add a bit more contrast to whiten up your whites and darken your darks. Nice work. 7', '2005-03-07 00:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211441, 153148, 15381, '<td valign="top">now this is sweet...nice job</td>', 'now this is sweet...nice job', '2005-03-07 00:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211443, 153150, 15381, '<td valign="top">cool shot</td>', 'cool shot', '2005-03-07 00:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211448, 152363, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very engaging, dramatic image. Your leading lines take my eye right in and around. The burning of the sky bugs me just a bit, as I can see the line where it ends above the trees. Still, an exciting photo! 8</td>', 'Very engaging, dramatic image. Your leading lines take my eye right in and around. The burning of the sky bugs me just a bit, as I can see the line where it ends above the trees. Still, an exciting photo! 8', '2005-03-07 00:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211449, 153169, 15381, '<td valign="top">would''ve been a higher score if it was in focus</td>', 'would''ve been a higher score if it was in focus', '2005-03-07 00:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211451, 152880, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun, interesting subject. Well conceived and well done. 8</td>', 'Fun, interesting subject. Well conceived and well done. 8', '2005-03-07 00:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211452, 152984, 15381, '<td valign="top">without color flowers tend to lose their photographic power...at least thats me...but the photo is well taken and composed well sharp and clear...thats gotta be worth a 6</td>', 'without color flowers tend to lose their photographic power...at least thats me...but the photo is well taken and composed well sharp and clear...thats gotta be worth a 6', '2005-03-07 00:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
