(1211466, 152484, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, and does a good job, I feel, at capturing the syle of AA. Nice tonal range, though some of your highlights are blown. Reflection is a wonderful idea. Mind if I copy sometime? 9</td>', 'This is lovely, and does a good job, I feel, at capturing the syle of AA. Nice tonal range, though some of your highlights are blown. Reflection is a wonderful idea. Mind if I copy sometime? 9', '2005-03-07 00:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
