(1211683, 152992, 20330, '<td valign="top">wow, this would have ROCKED the bridge challenge. this is stunning.</td>', 'wow, this would have ROCKED the bridge challenge. this is stunning.', '2005-03-07 02:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211686, 151251, 31214, '<td valign="top">Incredible...best I''ve seen so far!  I love the texture!</td>', 'Incredible...best I''ve seen so far!  I love the texture!', '2005-03-07 02:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211688, 153392, 17613, '<td valign="top">More of a surreal feel than Adams but I still thought this was the best image in the challenge.<br/></td>', 'More of a surreal feel than Adams but I still thought this was the best image in the challenge.', '2005-03-07 02:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211695, 151432, 30861, '<td valign="top">Absilutely pure Adams skyscape. Extremely well done.</td>', 'Absilutely pure Adams skyscape. Extremely well done.', '2005-03-07 02:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211697, 152500, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice. Very much in the Weston/Adams mode, and you''re to be commended for not exagerrating the contrast. It''s a little lacking in critical sharpness, and the DOF is falling off upper left; an AA picxture would have both those under control. 9</td>', 'Very, very nice. Very much in the Weston/Adams mode, and you''re to be commended for not exagerrating the contrast. It''s a little lacking in critical sharpness, and the DOF is falling off upper left; an AA picxture would have both those under control. 9', '2005-03-07 02:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211699, 153148, 30861, '<td valign="top">Rich and serene. there''s much to admire here. a couple comments: The POV would be better if placed so the large boat and the end of the pier don''t dovetail so precisely; a little to the left and a little lower, with the camera, ought to do it. Also, the pier''s been leveled but the horizon is falling off and the the structures on the pier are leaning over likewise. a quarter or hald degree ccq rotation would help immensely.<br/> <br/>The sky could be contained better upper right and upper left both, also. <br/> <br/>A strong entry.</td>', 'Rich and serene. there''s much to admire here. a couple comments: The POV would be better if placed so the large boat and the end of the pier don''t dovetail so precisely; a little to the left and a little lower, with the camera, ought to do it. Also, the pier''s been leveled but the horizon is falling off and the the structures on the pier are leaning over likewise. a quarter or hald degree ccq rotation would help immensely. The sky could be contained better upper right and upper left both, also.  A strong entry.', '2005-03-07 02:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211700, 153255, 30861, '<td valign="top">Your tonal range here is rich and plapable, virtually perfect for the image. It''s a little too soft for an AA emulation, he was the antithesis of soft focuse, pictorialist-type images. Nevertheless, a strong entry.</td>', 'Your tonal range here is rich and plapable, virtually perfect for the image. It''s a little too soft for an AA emulation, he was the antithesis of soft focuse, pictorialist-type images. Nevertheless, a strong entry.', '2005-03-07 02:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211701, 152858, 30861, '<td valign="top">In many ways I love this picture. The boat''s wake is starlingly effective. My 2 main beegs are that it is leaning over to the right, needs ccw rotation, and that the sky has been softened where it wants to be crystal sharp. A strong entry.</td>', 'In many ways I love this picture. The boat''s wake is starlingly effective. My 2 main beegs are that it is leaning over to the right, needs ccw rotation, and that the sky has been softened where it wants to be crystal sharp. A strong entry.', '2005-03-07 02:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211704, 152756, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful subject for this challenge. I think it could use more contrast, especially on the darker end, but it''s still a nice shot as-is.</td>', 'This is a beautiful subject for this challenge. I think it could use more contrast, especially on the darker end, but it''s still a nice shot as-is.', '2005-03-07 02:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211705, 153465, 30861, '<td valign="top">This could be SO nice, but there''s alittle too much sky with nothing happening; a full third of the image is empty space. And the critical dark areas, on the shaded sides of the cars, are crying out for a little detail in the shadow. Otherwise the tonalities are rich &amp; palpable.</td>', 'This could be SO nice, but there''s alittle too much sky with nothing happening; a full third of the image is empty space. And the critical dark areas, on the shaded sides of the cars, are crying out for a little detail in the shadow. Otherwise the tonalities are rich & palpable.', '2005-03-07 02:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211708, 152916, 30861, '<td valign="top">The tonal range and the treatment of the skyhere are uber-ansel, congratulations. The composition itself, with the lack of breathing room on all sides, is distinctly lackluster. In particular, we really need more foreground, quite a bit more.</td>', 'The tonal range and the treatment of the skyhere are uber-ansel, congratulations. The composition itself, with the lack of breathing room on all sides, is distinctly lackluster. In particular, we really need more foreground, quite a bit more.', '2005-03-07 02:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211710, 153109, 31637, '<td valign="top">stunning !   10</td>', 'stunning !   10', '2005-03-07 02:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211711, 152623, 30861, '<td valign="top">The composition is a little too centered, and you''re about one zone shy of true "pop" here, but there''s much to like in this image. Good score from me.</td>', 'The composition is a little too centered, and you''re about one zone shy of true "pop" here, but there''s much to like in this image. Good score from me.', '2005-03-07 02:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211713, 153168, 31637, '<td valign="top">stunning !! 10</td>', 'stunning !! 10', '2005-03-07 02:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211714, 153469, 30861, '<td valign="top">About as pure an Ansel as we have in this challenge. Wonderful sky work. The bit of tee on the right is a definite negative. Very strong entry.</td>', 'About as pure an Ansel as we have in this challenge. Wonderful sky work. The bit of tee on the right is a definite negative. Very strong entry.', '2005-03-07 02:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211715, 151982, 31637, '<td valign="top">not very good lighting here</td>', 'not very good lighting here', '2005-03-07 02:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211717, 153502, 30861, '<td valign="top">A bit too silhouetted to feel spot-on, but great sky work and a strong entry.</td>', 'A bit too silhouetted to feel spot-on, but great sky work and a strong entry.', '2005-03-07 02:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211719, 152858, 22459, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know that Sydney could look so good in b/w. You have captured the Adams feel in a cityscape, not an easy task and you have done it very well .<br/>I''m sure some will vote it down as it is not a traditional Adams landscape but  think it is superb. (10)<br/></td>', 'I didn''t know that Sydney could look so good in b/w. You have captured the Adams feel in a cityscape, not an easy task and you have done it very well .I''m sure some will vote it down as it is not a traditional Adams landscape but  think it is superb. (10)', '2005-03-07 02:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211722, 153333, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very rich, compositionally a bit pat. There''s essentially nothing happening in the bottom half of the picture. The rendring of the rocks is exquiste, and you have dealt very well with the backlit sky.</td>', 'Very rich, compositionally a bit pat. There''s essentially nothing happening in the bottom half of the picture. The rendring of the rocks is exquiste, and you have dealt very well with the backlit sky.', '2005-03-07 02:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211723, 153257, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is remarkably nice, and a brave entry given the topic. The image looks very much like something AA would have done. It is unfortunate that the face is not in focus. A strong entry in my eyes, nevertheless.</td>', 'This is remarkably nice, and a brave entry given the topic. The image looks very much like something AA would have done. It is unfortunate that the face is not in focus. A strong entry in my eyes, nevertheless.', '2005-03-07 02:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211727, 152992, 30861, '<td valign="top">I really, really wisdh this had been rotated ccw a degree or so, it has such a strong sense of leaning over. The tonalities are a bit muted, but it''s an effective composition and a drmamtic scene.</td>', 'I really, really wisdh this had been rotated ccw a degree or so, it has such a strong sense of leaning over. The tonalities are a bit muted, but it''s an effective composition and a drmamtic scene.', '2005-03-07 02:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211731, 153404, 30861, '<td valign="top">A little too contrasty, it cries out for more detailin the major dark areas, especially where the bridge footing are lost in the shadows. Nicely composed, except that the rocks on the lft are so flatly-lit and detailed that they are distracting.</td>', 'A little too contrasty, it cries out for more detailin the major dark areas, especially where the bridge footing are lost in the shadows. Nicely composed, except that the rocks on the lft are so flatly-lit and detailed that they are distracting.', '2005-03-07 02:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211736, 152330, 31440, '<td valign="top">Color was a risk, but I think you pulled it off.  Great shot!</td>', 'Color was a risk, but I think you pulled it off.  Great shot!', '2005-03-07 02:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211738, 153392, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a strong and eerie image, but it''s really hard to figure out what''s happening under that arch. Almost has an underwater feel. Much study leads me to believe that''s a landscape of hills and trees under there, but I have to reach roo deep for it. If you had worked to separate the distant landscape from both the sky and the foreground rocks, by lightening it and adding contrast at same time in that area, this would be much more coherent. As it is, ALL the elements of the photo are so close in value that it''s hard to perceive the depth that is obviously there. Also, the truncation of the arch at the top is most unfortunate... Still, a strong and evocative image.</td>', 'This is a strong and eerie image, but it''s really hard to figure out what''s happening under that arch. Almost has an underwater feel. Much study leads me to believe that''s a landscape of hills and trees under there, but I have to reach roo deep for it. If you had worked to separate the distant landscape from both the sky and the foreground rocks, by lightening it and adding contrast at same time in that area, this would be much more coherent. As it is, ALL the elements of the photo are so close in value that it''s hard to perceive the depth that is obviously there. Also, the truncation of the arch at the top is most unfortunate... Still, a strong and evocative image.', '2005-03-07 02:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211740, 152320, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The central clouds are a little TOO bright...</td>', 'Nicely done. The central clouds are a little TOO bright...', '2005-03-07 02:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211741, 151251, 20168, '<td valign="top">Creative use of "negative" space, though doesn''t express A.A''s style.  I like it though.</td>', 'Creative use of "negative" space, though doesn''t express A.A''s style.  I like it though.', '2005-03-07 02:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211742, 152212, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition marred by the4 not-level horizon and an overall sense of flatness in the foreground. I suspect, though, that this was a really tough one to print. Stron entry.</td>', 'Beautiful composition marred by the4 not-level horizon and an overall sense of flatness in the foreground. I suspect, though, that this was a really tough one to print. Stron entry.', '2005-03-07 02:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211743, 151299, 30861, '<td valign="top">So close to spot on. It needs to be sharper, and the flank of the moutnain is a tad blown out. a little more contrast in the clouds and on the shadowed folank of the mnountain would help also. Strong entry.</td>', 'So close to spot on. It needs to be sharper, and the flank of the moutnain is a tad blown out. a little more contrast in the clouds and on the shadowed folank of the mnountain would help also. Strong entry.', '2005-03-07 02:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211758, 152330, 7473, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but it is in Color!  =)  Great shot   I really like it.  The moon is a great addition.  I don''t know how to rate it because normally if the rules of the challenge are not followed I rate down for that...---6</td>', 'Great photo, but it is in Color!  =)  Great shot   I really like it.  The moon is a great addition.  I don''t know how to rate it because normally if the rules of the challenge are not followed I rate down for that...---6', '2005-03-07 03:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211781, 153030, 2798, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge just beautifully. I would have liked to see something more in the foreground, however. 8</td>', 'Fits the challenge just beautifully. I would have liked to see something more in the foreground, however. 8', '2005-03-07 03:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211786, 153441, 2798, '<td valign="top">A lovely view but I feel like some detail in the valley is missing. Perhaps a little soft there. Lovely light on the hills. Shame the clouds weren''t cooperating. 7</td>', 'A lovely view but I feel like some detail in the valley is missing. Perhaps a little soft there. Lovely light on the hills. Shame the clouds weren''t cooperating. 7', '2005-03-07 03:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211789, 153068, 2798, '<td valign="top">This could almost be entered in the surreal challenge. I like what you''ve done but it feels a little too "zoomed in". That half tree on the left and whatever that is in the bottom left corner tend to lead my eye out of the frame and are distracting. Also the aparrent horizon and the lines above slope in a way that is unsettling. Perhaps this scene is level but without more context (ie less zoomed in) it''s difficult to tell. 7</td>', 'This could almost be entered in the surreal challenge. I like what you''ve done but it feels a little too "zoomed in". That half tree on the left and whatever that is in the bottom left corner tend to lead my eye out of the frame and are distracting. Also the aparrent horizon and the lines above slope in a way that is unsettling. Perhaps this scene is level but without more context (ie less zoomed in) it''s difficult to tell. 7', '2005-03-07 04:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211793, 152081, 2798, '<td valign="top">One of the more "Ansel Adams" style challenge submissions. Great job with composition and choice of subject. My only comment is that I would have liked to see it a little sharper. The edges of the trees are just a shade too soft for my tastes and don''t match the pin sharp, high contrast of Adams'' work. Lovely shot, though. A strong 8</td>', 'One of the more "Ansel Adams" style challenge submissions. Great job with composition and choice of subject. My only comment is that I would have liked to see it a little sharper. The edges of the trees are just a shade too soft for my tastes and don''t match the pin sharp, high contrast of Adams'' work. Lovely shot, though. A strong 8', '2005-03-07 04:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211794, 153167, 2798, '<td valign="top">Good work with the black and white but post processing has made some grain visible. I like your choice of subject but that branch sticking out of shot leads the eye out of shot too. 7</td>', 'Good work with the black and white but post processing has made some grain visible. I like your choice of subject but that branch sticking out of shot leads the eye out of shot too. 7', '2005-03-07 04:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211795, 153366, 32872, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting for such a magnificant tree.<br/>So pretty.<br/></td>', 'Beautiful lighting for such a magnificant tree.So pretty.', '2005-03-07 04:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211796, 153146, 2798, '<td valign="top">I can''t help thinking Adams would have included a lot more sky with this image. Also I would have pushed the contrast up so that the darkest areas were much closer to black. Otherwise a well observed and composed image of a visually appealing subject. Well done 7</td>', 'I can''t help thinking Adams would have included a lot more sky with this image. Also I would have pushed the contrast up so that the darkest areas were much closer to black. Otherwise a well observed and composed image of a visually appealing subject. Well done 7', '2005-03-07 04:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211801, 153363, 2798, '<td valign="top">Wonderful work. An excellent choice of subject and very Adamsy black and white processing. Your sky looks a little false since you appear to have burned it by hand and left quite a halo around the trees and edges of the frame. Quite an attractive effect but not especially faithful to the scene. The sky might have been brought up with a coloured filter in shooting or a hue shift layer in post processing. Either way, one of the strongest entries I''ve seen so far. 9</td>', 'Wonderful work. An excellent choice of subject and very Adamsy black and white processing. Your sky looks a little false since you appear to have burned it by hand and left quite a halo around the trees and edges of the frame. Quite an attractive effect but not especially faithful to the scene. The sky might have been brought up with a coloured filter in shooting or a hue shift layer in post processing. Either way, one of the strongest entries I''ve seen so far. 9', '2005-03-07 04:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211803, 153329, 16046, '<td valign="top">this pops, well done</td>', 'this pops, well done', '2005-03-07 04:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211804, 152605, 32872, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot for such a homely bird!  Look how gorgous the feathers are!  The water is pretty and the reflections add the touch.  Nice,<br/></td>', 'Excellent shot for such a homely bird!  Look how gorgous the feathers are!  The water is pretty and the reflections add the touch.  Nice,', '2005-03-07 04:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211805, 153255, 2798, '<td valign="top">A beautiful capture (if a tiny bit soft) that is well composed and lit. It''s not a particularly Adamsy scene, though. 8</td>', 'A beautiful capture (if a tiny bit soft) that is well composed and lit. It''s not a particularly Adamsy scene, though. 8', '2005-03-07 04:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211807, 153448, 2798, '<td valign="top">I think I know which Adams shot this is reflective of. If I''m right I think I would have flipped it horizontally. Still a very suitable scene for the challenge. The fence in the scene isn''t terribly picturesque, however. 7</td>', 'I think I know which Adams shot this is reflective of. If I''m right I think I would have flipped it horizontally. Still a very suitable scene for the challenge. The fence in the scene isn''t terribly picturesque, however. 7', '2005-03-07 04:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211808, 151362, 32872, '<td valign="top">Cool shot...wow, good idea!<br/></td>', 'Cool shot...wow, good idea!', '2005-03-07 04:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211812, 152315, 2798, '<td valign="top">An excellent choice of subject for this challenge and very characteristic B&amp;W processing. Fits the challenge well. 8</td>', 'An excellent choice of subject for this challenge and very characteristic B&W processing. Fits the challenge well. 8', '2005-03-07 04:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211813, 152880, 32872, '<td valign="top">Nice...I love the darks and lights.<br/></td>', 'Nice...I love the darks and lights.', '2005-03-07 04:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211814, 152754, 2798, '<td valign="top">Excellent scene for this challenge with excellent B&amp;W processing. Your foreground is pin sharp but the mountains and trees look a little soft. A strong 9 from me still.</td>', 'Excellent scene for this challenge with excellent B&W processing. Your foreground is pin sharp but the mountains and trees look a little soft. A strong 9 from me still.', '2005-03-07 04:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211815, 152880, 2798, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject choice and strong Adamsy light. Very appropriate for the challenge. 9</td>', 'Excellent subject choice and strong Adamsy light. Very appropriate for the challenge. 9', '2005-03-07 04:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211816, 153109, 2798, '<td valign="top">Strong sky. Strong light. Strong subject. All the right elements for a great Ansel Adams challenge entry. Love it. 9</td>', 'Strong sky. Strong light. Strong subject. All the right elements for a great Ansel Adams challenge entry. Love it. 9', '2005-03-07 04:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211817, 152213, 32872, '<td valign="top">Nice composition...hmmm, I like the way you darkened the top right sky to balance the bottom left.  It brings my eye back into the photo and it stays there.  I think I''ll try that technique sometime!<br/></td>', 'Nice composition...hmmm, I like the way you darkened the top right sky to balance the bottom left.  It brings my eye back into the photo and it stays there.  I think I''ll try that technique sometime!', '2005-03-07 04:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211819, 153439, 32872, '<td valign="top">I like the heavy, dark shadows on your mountains!<br/>Brooding.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like the heavy, dark shadows on your mountains!Brooding. ', '2005-03-07 04:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211820, 152614, 2798, '<td valign="top">Your title sure sucks. Show a little confidence. Your image is far from being bad. I''m not sure about your composition and your post processing has left the darker areas too dark but you''re zeroing in on an excellent shot. It''s a good choice of subject and location and that''s more than half the battle won.</td>', 'Your title sure sucks. Show a little confidence. Your image is far from being bad. I''m not sure about your composition and your post processing has left the darker areas too dark but you''re zeroing in on an excellent shot. It''s a good choice of subject and location and that''s more than half the battle won.', '2005-03-07 04:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211821, 152614, 32602, '<td valign="top">This does not suck!!!! <br/>I can take the apology to Ansel Adams, but please don'' t don''t put negative thoughts into voters'' minds. You do yourself a disservice.</td>', 'This does not suck!!!! I can take the apology to Ansel Adams, but please don'' t don''t put negative thoughts into voters'' minds. You do yourself a disservice.', '2005-03-07 04:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211822, 152326, 32872, '<td valign="top">Hauntingly beautiful.  This shot is so pretty!<br/></td>', 'Hauntingly beautiful.  This shot is so pretty!', '2005-03-07 04:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211824, 152350, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene with good (if a little straight-on) light. To make it more Adamsy I would have liked a little more sky and just a tiny bit blacker blacks. Excellent work, though. One for the wall. 8</td>', 'Lovely scene with good (if a little straight-on) light. To make it more Adamsy I would have liked a little more sky and just a tiny bit blacker blacks. Excellent work, though. One for the wall. 8', '2005-03-07 04:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211826, 153118, 2798, '<td valign="top">Avening? Is that a place or a typo? Not really a great choice of subject for this challenge. A good sky but your processing of the sky has left the ground portion of the picture overly dark. 6</td>', 'Avening? Is that a place or a typo? Not really a great choice of subject for this challenge. A good sky but your processing of the sky has left the ground portion of the picture overly dark. 6', '2005-03-07 04:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211827, 153016, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene but a little grainy in the sky (presumably down to the processing) and a little soft in the focus. A touch of USM would work wonders. 7</td>', 'Lovely scene but a little grainy in the sky (presumably down to the processing) and a little soft in the focus. A touch of USM would work wonders. 7', '2005-03-07 04:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211828, 152824, 2798, '<td valign="top">A view of the bay that I''ve not seen before. Lovely sky almost a good framing of the scene with the landscape. Needs something on the right to bring the eye back in. 8</td>', 'A view of the bay that I''ve not seen before. Lovely sky almost a good framing of the scene with the landscape. Needs something on the right to bring the eye back in. 8', '2005-03-07 04:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211832, 152671, 2798, '<td valign="top">A polarising filter would have helped you keep those reflections under control. I can see why you wanted to keep the forground rocks in shot but it''s meant that we lost the horizon out of the top of the shot. Turning the camera portrait might have allowed you to get both in the scene. 6</td>', 'A polarising filter would have helped you keep those reflections under control. I can see why you wanted to keep the forground rocks in shot but it''s meant that we lost the horizon out of the top of the shot. Turning the camera portrait might have allowed you to get both in the scene. 6', '2005-03-07 04:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211833, 153225, 2798, '<td valign="top">Your sheep have become lost in the grass. A coloured filter or a hue shift layer in post processing might have helped them stand out more.7</td>', 'Your sheep have become lost in the grass. A coloured filter or a hue shift layer in post processing might have helped them stand out more.7', '2005-03-07 04:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211835, 153236, 2798, '<td valign="top">A good scene but very dark. 6</td>', 'A good scene but very dark. 6', '2005-03-07 04:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211837, 153364, 2798, '<td valign="top">Your scene is in shadow. Re-shooting this when the sun was in a better location would have helped hugely. Good choice of subject, though. 6</td>', 'Your scene is in shadow. Re-shooting this when the sun was in a better location would have helped hugely. Good choice of subject, though. 6', '2005-03-07 04:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211839, 152989, 2798, '<td valign="top">Another where''s waldo entry? Great shot of a dramatic scene. But it feels like a few more moments and that large central cloud might roll out of scene and improve the light immesurably. 8</td>', 'Another where''s waldo entry? Great shot of a dramatic scene. But it feels like a few more moments and that large central cloud might roll out of scene and improve the light immesurably. 8', '2005-03-07 04:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211840, 153252, 18505, '<td valign="top">I love it!!  10.</td>', 'I love it!!  10.', '2005-03-07 04:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211846, 152916, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good selection of subject.  Nice lighting, good viewpoint and cropping.  There seems to be some problems with wide angle lens distortion and that the image has been altered in post processing causing strange vertical lines near the edges.  -6</td>', 'Good selection of subject.  Nice lighting, good viewpoint and cropping.  There seems to be some problems with wide angle lens distortion and that the image has been altered in post processing causing strange vertical lines near the edges.  -6', '2005-03-07 04:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211848, 153493, 24642, '<td valign="top">A scene that is very beautiful but somehow does not become as interesting when photographed.  A typical problem with landscape where there are rocks with high detail and some plants shot when the sun is high in the sky and the light is harsh.  Perhaps this scene would become more interesting if it was photographed at a different time of the day.  -6</td>', 'A scene that is very beautiful but somehow does not become as interesting when photographed.  A typical problem with landscape where there are rocks with high detail and some plants shot when the sun is high in the sky and the light is harsh.  Perhaps this scene would become more interesting if it was photographed at a different time of the day.  -6', '2005-03-07 05:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211849, 153329, 19952, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject for this challenge and you did a great job capturing the lines and depth, as well as with the processing. Very nice!</td>', 'Excellent subject for this challenge and you did a great job capturing the lines and depth, as well as with the processing. Very nice!', '2005-03-07 05:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211852, 153109, 19952, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous subject and excellent processing. The rock itself seems a bit soft, but that''s a minor critique of a beautiful photo.</td>', 'Gorgeous subject and excellent processing. The rock itself seems a bit soft, but that''s a minor critique of a beautiful photo.', '2005-03-07 05:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211855, 152044, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is an outstanding black and white image and the headstones in the foreground give a great sense of depth, just like Ansel used to do. :-) There''s a bit of noise in the sky, but that''s easy to deal with after the challenge. Very nice job!</td>', 'This is an outstanding black and white image and the headstones in the foreground give a great sense of depth, just like Ansel used to do. :-) There''s a bit of noise in the sky, but that''s easy to deal with after the challenge. Very nice job!', '2005-03-07 05:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211860, 152484, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool image that works really well for this challenge. My only critiques are that hot spot on the bottom left petals and that I wish the background were a bit brighter so that it could participate in the image more. But other than that, I really love this photo - great job!</td>', 'This is such a cool image that works really well for this challenge. My only critiques are that hot spot on the bottom left petals and that I wish the background were a bit brighter so that it could participate in the image more. But other than that, I really love this photo - great job!', '2005-03-07 05:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211863, 152981, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a great black and white landscape and the foreground creek gives a nice sense of depth. Very well done!</td>', 'This is a great black and white landscape and the foreground creek gives a nice sense of depth. Very well done!', '2005-03-07 05:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211868, 153392, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool subject and a nice composition. The image seems a bit soft and would probably benefit from some more dodging to provide contrast against the dark areas, but I still really like this photo as it is. Great job!</td>', 'This is such a cool subject and a nice composition. The image seems a bit soft and would probably benefit from some more dodging to provide contrast against the dark areas, but I still really like this photo as it is. Great job!', '2005-03-07 05:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211877, 153297, 33334, '<td valign="top">I really like the sky</td>', 'I really like the sky', '2005-03-07 05:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211880, 153252, 33334, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2005-03-07 05:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211885, 152305, 15919, '<td valign="top">Composition very good.  Also like the editing.</td>', 'Composition very good.  Also like the editing.', '2005-03-07 05:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211887, 153157, 15919, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image.  Why so small?</td>', 'This is a very nice image.  Why so small?', '2005-03-07 05:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211888, 153352, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good editing and nice image.</td>', 'Good editing and nice image.', '2005-03-07 05:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211891, 152866, 15919, '<td valign="top">The reflection of the sunlight on the water and the bird does very much for this image.  Other parts needs more contrast for my opinion.  Needs some curves or dodge/burn editing.  Nice image though.</td>', 'The reflection of the sunlight on the water and the bird does very much for this image.  Other parts needs more contrast for my opinion.  Needs some curves or dodge/burn editing.  Nice image though.', '2005-03-07 05:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211892, 153309, 23456, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo good luck !</td>', 'This is a really nice photo good luck !', '2005-03-07 05:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211893, 152824, 15919, '<td valign="top">The sky and the clouds are very nice.  Not sure about other parts of the image.</td>', 'The sky and the clouds are very nice.  Not sure about other parts of the image.', '2005-03-07 05:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211895, 153246, 15919, '<td valign="top">This may be intentional to make the image look old but I would have prefer a litle more sharpness.  Represents the texture well but I can´t say I find the image very original or interestin.</td>', 'This may be intentional to make the image look old but I would have prefer a litle more sharpness.  Represents the texture well but I can´t say I find the image very original or interestin.', '2005-03-07 05:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211896, 152471, 33819, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and silhouette effect!</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and silhouette effect!', '2005-03-07 05:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211897, 153181, 15919, '<td valign="top">Very good.  To put in some critique then I find it litle too smooth and sharp to be AA style.</td>', 'Very good.  To put in some critique then I find it litle too smooth and sharp to be AA style.', '2005-03-07 06:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211899, 152038, 15919, '<td valign="top">The subject and composition works fine for me.  Like the editing.</td>', 'The subject and composition works fine for me.  Like the editing.', '2005-03-07 06:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211902, 153014, 5792, '<td valign="top">Like Adam''s image, "Mount Williamson, The Sierra Nevada, from Manzanar, California", except better! This should be one of the top finishing images for this challenge.</td>', 'Like Adam''s image, "Mount Williamson, The Sierra Nevada, from Manzanar, California", except better! This should be one of the top finishing images for this challenge.', '2005-03-07 06:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211908, 153254, 15919, '<td valign="top">Most of the picture aeria seems to be in the shadow.  This would have to be shot from the other side or at another time of the day.  Subject and compostion alright though.</td>', 'Most of the picture aeria seems to be in the shadow.  This would have to be shot from the other side or at another time of the day.  Subject and compostion alright though.', '2005-03-07 06:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211916, 152330, 26450, '<td valign="top">this is in color. it should be in b/w..... nice shot though</td>', 'this is in color. it should be in b/w..... nice shot though', '2005-03-07 06:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211950, 152992, 15919, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Smooth, contrast, composition and subject and editing.</td>', 'Very nice.  Smooth, contrast, composition and subject and editing.', '2005-03-07 06:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211952, 152614, 5792, '<td valign="top">Captures the Ansel Adams style perfectly!</td>', 'Captures the Ansel Adams style perfectly!', '2005-03-07 06:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211953, 152326, 15919, '<td valign="top">Cool editing.  Maybe litle bit to much but I like it.</td>', 'Cool editing.  Maybe litle bit to much but I like it.', '2005-03-07 06:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211957, 153352, 33520, '<td valign="top">This is so lovely, definitely AA style 10</td>', 'This is so lovely, definitely AA style 10', '2005-03-07 06:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211958, 153231, 15919, '<td valign="top">I´ve no doubt that he did but they must have been better than this one.  The composition is fine but the expression of the face seems strange and the image would have needed much better editing.</td>', 'I´ve no doubt that he did but they must have been better than this one.  The composition is fine but the expression of the face seems strange and the image would have needed much better editing.', '2005-03-07 06:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211963, 153369, 15919, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast and better editing.  Also I can´t find the subject or composition very exciting.  Sorry but that´s just my opinion.</td>', 'Needs more contrast and better editing.  Also I can´t find the subject or composition very exciting.  Sorry but that´s just my opinion.', '2005-03-07 06:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211964, 152366, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good composition and nice editing.  Very good.</td>', 'Good composition and nice editing.  Very good.', '2005-03-07 06:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211965, 152614, 33520, '<td valign="top">Love the sky and the buildings..and the tree.. and the snow 10</td>', 'Love the sky and the buildings..and the tree.. and the snow 10', '2005-03-07 06:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211968, 153272, 15919, '<td valign="top">I find the sky and the clouds a litle strange but other parts of the image are very good.  The ground is great and nice editing and the position of the tree is very good (good composition).</td>', 'I find the sky and the clouds a litle strange but other parts of the image are very good.  The ground is great and nice editing and the position of the tree is very good (good composition).', '2005-03-07 06:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211973, 153183, 15919, '<td valign="top">Subject and composition is fine but I think this image would have tolerated more contrast and better editing.</td>', 'Subject and composition is fine but I think this image would have tolerated more contrast and better editing.', '2005-03-07 06:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211980, 153030, 33520, '<td valign="top">Amazing sky</td>', 'Amazing sky', '2005-03-07 06:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211986, 153005, 33520, '<td valign="top">Maybe a greater DOF could have been better for this image,but nice colours</td>', 'Maybe a greater DOF could have been better for this image,but nice colours', '2005-03-07 06:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211990, 152472, 33520, '<td valign="top">interesting and nice at the same time, maybe more shades of B&amp;W could have helped, but still great photo</td>', 'interesting and nice at the same time, maybe more shades of B&W could have helped, but still great photo', '2005-03-07 06:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211991, 153469, 5792, '<td valign="top">Incredible image. Great sky, well detailed wide DOF shot and sharpened in the Adams style. Even the name fits the Adams style. Ribbon territory for this shot.</td>', 'Incredible image. Great sky, well detailed wide DOF shot and sharpened in the Adams style. Even the name fits the Adams style. Ribbon territory for this shot.', '2005-03-07 06:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211994, 153109, 5792, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful shot! Very well done technically, incredible detail and great tones. Ansel himself would be proud of this shot. This should win a ribbon.</td>', 'What a wonderful shot! Very well done technically, incredible detail and great tones. Ansel himself would be proud of this shot. This should win a ribbon.', '2005-03-07 06:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211995, 152754, 5792, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot in the Adams tradition.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot in the Adams tradition.', '2005-03-07 06:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211998, 153432, 5792, '<td valign="top">On the surrealistic side for adams, probably because of NeatImage, but a wonderfully toned image. This should finish very high in voting.</td>', 'On the surrealistic side for adams, probably because of NeatImage, but a wonderfully toned image. This should finish very high in voting.', '2005-03-07 06:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212000, 152802, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great technical shot, good tones covering the full range from black to white and has great midtones.</td>', 'Great technical shot, good tones covering the full range from black to white and has great midtones.', '2005-03-07 06:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212007, 153148, 29462, '<td valign="top">Oh me I know it, I know it Weston-super-mare, nice shot</td>', 'Oh me I know it, I know it Weston-super-mare, nice shot', '2005-03-07 06:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212016, 153246, 30018, '<td valign="top">At first glance I liked this, but with closer inspection, my eyes seem to go blurry looking at this.  I''m trying very hard to find a part of this image that is in clear focus.  There is a great deal of loss of detail in the highlights as well. &lt;4&gt;</td>', 'At first glance I liked this, but with closer inspection, my eyes seem to go blurry looking at this.  I''m trying very hard to find a part of this image that is in clear focus.  There is a great deal of loss of detail in the highlights as well. <4>', '2005-03-07 07:05:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1212017, 151764, 33520, '<td valign="top">Nice, this image is just like one of his.</td>', 'Nice, this image is just like one of his.', '2005-03-07 07:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212021, 152315, 17033, '<td valign="top">Should have cropped the right hand side off to focus on the bushes which have nice lower branches</td>', 'Should have cropped the right hand side off to focus on the bushes which have nice lower branches', '2005-03-07 07:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212023, 152754, 33520, '<td valign="top">Very nice (interesting crop too)</td>', 'Very nice (interesting crop too)', '2005-03-07 07:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212025, 153309, 33520, '<td valign="top">Beautiful 10</td>', 'Beautiful 10', '2005-03-07 07:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212028, 153168, 33520, '<td valign="top">Great photo ,lovely sky</td>', 'Great photo ,lovely sky', '2005-03-07 07:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212031, 152350, 18191, '<td valign="top">For an AA composition, more diagonals would have made this shot pop. Still a good study with good tones. 7.</td>', 'For an AA composition, more diagonals would have made this shot pop. Still a good study with good tones. 7.', '2005-03-07 07:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212033, 153232, 33520, '<td valign="top">Very A A style well done!!! (not so sure about the car and the truck) 9</td>', 'Very A A style well done!!! (not so sure about the car and the truck) 9', '2005-03-07 07:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212034, 153404, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great tones here. The composition isn''t ticking... I''m not sure what it is.... there seem to be too many elements fighting to be the focal point. But a good image in his style 8.</td>', 'Great tones here. The composition isn''t ticking... I''m not sure what it is.... there seem to be too many elements fighting to be the focal point. But a good image in his style 8.', '2005-03-07 07:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212036, 153225, 18191, '<td valign="top">The foreground seems a little soft for Ansel Adams. I dont know if this was NeatImage or an effect of dodging but it is evident to me. Otherwise, the tones are rich and full throughout with a good composition leading from the foregrounf sheep to the buildings along the road. Good job.</td>', 'The foreground seems a little soft for Ansel Adams. I dont know if this was NeatImage or an effect of dodging but it is evident to me. Otherwise, the tones are rich and full throughout with a good composition leading from the foregrounf sheep to the buildings along the road. Good job.', '2005-03-07 07:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212037, 153121, 33520, '<td valign="top">Lovely details,good use of the zone</td>', 'Lovely details,good use of the zone', '2005-03-07 07:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212038, 152916, 18191, '<td valign="top">Come back on a day with some clouds and you''ve got a killer shot. With what you have, there are great tones and good lighting. Nice job!</td>', 'Come back on a day with some clouds and you''ve got a killer shot. With what you have, there are great tones and good lighting. Nice job!', '2005-03-07 07:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212039, 153109, 16241, '<td valign="top">thats cool, looks like one of those pics from iceland? :)</td>', 'thats cool, looks like one of those pics from iceland? :)', '2005-03-07 07:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212041, 153338, 14614, '<td valign="top">you''re lighting is a bit flat - more light would help focus the composition as well</td>', 'you''re lighting is a bit flat - more light would help focus the composition as well', '2005-03-07 07:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212044, 153292, 31167, '<td valign="top">The depth of field seems limited.  I''m trying to follow the river, but the lack of detail in the background makes it difficult.  Great composition though.</td>', 'The depth of field seems limited.  I''m trying to follow the river, but the lack of detail in the background makes it difficult.  Great composition though.', '2005-03-07 07:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212045, 153254, 33846, '<td valign="top">Creative</td>', 'Creative', '2005-03-07 07:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212046, 152824, 33520, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky and colurs( B&amp;W shades)</td>', 'Lovely sky and colurs( B&W shades)', '2005-03-07 07:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212047, 153303, 33379, '<td valign="top">great photo!</td>', 'great photo!', '2005-03-07 07:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212048, 153388, 3569, '<td valign="top">Horn peak at its best. Nice shot.</td>', 'Horn peak at its best. Nice shot.', '2005-03-07 07:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212049, 153504, 33982, '<td valign="top">nice but over sharpened</td>', 'nice but over sharpened', '2005-03-07 07:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212050, 153245, 3569, '<td valign="top">focus appears off to me</td>', 'focus appears off to me', '2005-03-07 07:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212051, 153364, 31167, '<td valign="top">Great composition, and good sharpness.  One thing I notice is, there are no true whites in this image.  If you pushed the peak on the right to white, you would get a much more contrasty image.</td>', 'Great composition, and good sharpness.  One thing I notice is, there are no true whites in this image.  If you pushed the peak on the right to white, you would get a much more contrasty image.', '2005-03-07 07:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212053, 152660, 14614, '<td valign="top">the composition is a bit busy for me -- it draws my attention to the letters and their not necessarily the most interesting part of your frame.  the play on the title and the bright spot works.</td>', 'the composition is a bit busy for me -- it draws my attention to the letters and their not necessarily the most interesting part of your frame.  the play on the title and the bright spot works.', '2005-03-07 07:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212054, 153296, 33520, '<td valign="top">The sky and the tree are amazing 9</td>', 'The sky and the tree are amazing 9', '2005-03-07 07:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212055, 152471, 16636, '<td valign="top">I wish the composition was better framed, missing the top of the tree is a problem, I think this really could have worked well.</td>', 'I wish the composition was better framed, missing the top of the tree is a problem, I think this really could have worked well.', '2005-03-07 07:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212056, 152916, 16636, '<td valign="top">great contrast, well executed</td>', 'great contrast, well executed', '2005-03-07 07:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212057, 153005, 31167, '<td valign="top">Good contrast, but I''m looking for more detail in the clouds.</td>', 'Good contrast, but I''m looking for more detail in the clouds.', '2005-03-07 07:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212059, 152754, 31167, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field and sharpness. True whites and blacks are present.</td>', 'Good depth of field and sharpness. True whites and blacks are present.', '2005-03-07 07:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212061, 153292, 33520, '<td valign="top">I do get the A A feel here,but the overall image is dark a bit,so cannot see all the details.still nice</td>', 'I do get the A A feel here,but the overall image is dark a bit,so cannot see all the details.still nice', '2005-03-07 07:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212064, 153182, 33520, '<td valign="top">Lovely image (lucky to get such scenery)</td>', 'Lovely image (lucky to get such scenery)', '2005-03-07 07:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212066, 152777, 33520, '<td valign="top">Nice A A style close-up</td>', 'Nice A A style close-up', '2005-03-07 07:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212070, 153504, 33361, '<td valign="top">very AA- like but I would have worked on the sky a bit more..</td>', 'very AA- like but I would have worked on the sky a bit more..', '2005-03-07 08:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212072, 152852, 2490, '<td valign="top">Caughtcha, Ansel :)  You go back and rest in peace, now.</td>', 'Caughtcha, Ansel :)  You go back and rest in peace, now.', '2005-03-07 08:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212073, 153397, 33361, '<td valign="top">this looks sepia...and seems to be missing some tones..nice try though</td>', 'this looks sepia...and seems to be missing some tones..nice try though', '2005-03-07 08:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212074, 153303, 29894, '<td valign="top">one of my top three, love it!</td>', 'one of my top three, love it!', '2005-03-07 08:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212076, 152610, 29894, '<td valign="top">best of the challenge, I love it!</td>', 'best of the challenge, I love it!', '2005-03-07 08:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
