(1212718, 153369, 20168, '<td valign="top">Composition is flat.  Sky needs clouds,  foreground needs more interest.  Zone range in reflections on lake is minimal.  Trees are the most interesting part for my eye.  Great idea in a lovely location.  Best of luck.</td>', 'Composition is flat.  Sky needs clouds,  foreground needs more interest.  Zone range in reflections on lake is minimal.  Trees are the most interesting part for my eye.  Great idea in a lovely location.  Best of luck.', '2005-03-07 12:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
