(1212733, 151299, 20168, '<td valign="top">Seems lacking in sharpness for that A.A. style.  What an incredible location and I love the white/black wideness in this photo.</td>', 'Seems lacking in sharpness for that A.A. style.  What an incredible location and I love the white/black wideness in this photo.', '2005-03-07 12:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
