(1212758, 153291, 20168, '<td valign="top">The most interesting portion of this photo is the whiteness/darkness of the mountain.  Cropped closer, removing the building, and dodging/burning the clouds and snow below in the field would have given this photo some great Ansel style.  Still, I love the feel of the photo.</td>', 'The most interesting portion of this photo is the whiteness/darkness of the mountain.  Cropped closer, removing the building, and dodging/burning the clouds and snow below in the field would have given this photo some great Ansel style.  Still, I love the feel of the photo.', '2005-03-07 13:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1212765, 152212, 17613, '<td valign="top">I was torn between this and  "a photograph is made, not taken." in the end I rated them the same. Personally I am not sure if the dark gray sky helps the image or not, I suspect it would have had more impact without.</td>', 'I was torn between this and  "a photograph is made, not taken." in the end I rated them the same. Personally I am not sure if the dark gray sky helps the image or not, I suspect it would have had more impact without.', '2005-03-07 13:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
