(1212776, 152623, 19503, '<td valign="top">And what a tribute it is, I think Ansel would very much approve of this. The tones are represented with amazing detail, not too soft or sharp. The tree is standing out proud in the center. If there is anything I would try different here is making the tree stand out a little more, maybe just a tad more contrast at and around the tree. I hope this will ribbon, GJ.</td>', 'And what a tribute it is, I think Ansel would very much approve of this. The tones are represented with amazing detail, not too soft or sharp. The tree is standing out proud in the center. If there is anything I would try different here is making the tree stand out a little more, maybe just a tad more contrast at and around the tree. I hope this will ribbon, GJ.', '2005-03-07 13:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
