(1212999, 152880, 31917, '<td valign="top">very simple and very clean.  alot of times i wish i could get a shot without the road in it, but it actually ads to this photo and gives it a good foreground base.  This is what makes a good photographer.  it wasn''t a beuatiful area that you took a picture of.  it was just an area that you made into a beautiful picture. I like it alot.</td>', 'very simple and very clean.  alot of times i wish i could get a shot without the road in it, but it actually ads to this photo and gives it a good foreground base.  This is what makes a good photographer.  it wasn''t a beuatiful area that you took a picture of.  it was just an area that you made into a beautiful picture. I like it alot.', '2005-03-07 15:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
