(1213031, 153330, 30392, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and "zone system" effect  (what I understood from the threads, anyway). Not too keen on the thicket of trees in the background, though. Great sky! 8</td>', 'Nice contrast and "zone system" effect  (what I understood from the threads, anyway). Not too keen on the thicket of trees in the background, though. Great sky! 8', '2005-03-07 15:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213034, 152894, 30392, '<td valign="top">Nice details and contrast on the hill, the sky could have been made more dramatic maybe, although I''m clueless about the PS wizardry myself! 7</td>', 'Nice details and contrast on the hill, the sky could have been made more dramatic maybe, although I''m clueless about the PS wizardry myself! 7', '2005-03-07 15:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213036, 152061, 23614, '<td valign="top">I usually prefer seeing tall, strong trees in middle of an empty field, but this little one trying to grow surrounded by taller trees inspires a lot of courage and strength also. Good depth of field. I would have cropped a little more on the right and maybe show a bit more on top of the small tree. I am not very credible on judging and comparing to Ansel Adams work since I do not know him very well, but it sure is very contrasty, but lacking a bit of the "landscape" aspect. Good job.</td>', 'I usually prefer seeing tall, strong trees in middle of an empty field, but this little one trying to grow surrounded by taller trees inspires a lot of courage and strength also. Good depth of field. I would have cropped a little more on the right and maybe show a bit more on top of the small tree. I am not very credible on judging and comparing to Ansel Adams work since I do not know him very well, but it sure is very contrasty, but lacking a bit of the "landscape" aspect. Good job.', '2005-03-07 15:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213038, 153219, 30392, '<td valign="top">LOL!</td>', 'LOL!', '2005-03-07 15:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213045, 153257, 13305, '<td valign="top">Pay attention to your levels before desaturating.  The face in the foreground needs to show up more.    Thanks for a unique image in this challenge.</td>', 'Pay attention to your levels before desaturating.  The face in the foreground needs to show up more.    Thanks for a unique image in this challenge.', '2005-03-07 15:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213048, 152866, 13305, '<td valign="top">Like the sunbeam on the water, I''d like to see a little more detail on the left side near the shore.</td>', 'Like the sunbeam on the water, I''d like to see a little more detail on the left side near the shore.', '2005-03-07 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213051, 153077, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice greys but not really in the Adams style which cover the full range of tones to solid black that usually occupies a significant part of the frame. Very soft focused.</td>', 'Nice greys but not really in the Adams style which cover the full range of tones to solid black that usually occupies a significant part of the frame. Very soft focused.', '2005-03-07 15:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213052, 153028, 13305, '<td valign="top">Good effort.  The only thing I would change is get down closer to the level of the cattail heads and look across the ice.</td>', 'Good effort.  The only thing I would change is get down closer to the level of the cattail heads and look across the ice.', '2005-03-07 15:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213054, 152484, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is stunning. I keep coming back to it because teh flower is so powerful against the tree - the perspective is very unique. Beautiful highlights and shadows - just like an adams! 10</td>', 'This is stunning. I keep coming back to it because teh flower is so powerful against the tree - the perspective is very unique. Beautiful highlights and shadows - just like an adams! 10', '2005-03-07 15:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213057, 153257, 4767, '<td valign="top">Looks a little more like W. Eugene Smith than St. Ansel, but a FINE photograph!</td>', 'Looks a little more like W. Eugene Smith than St. Ansel, but a FINE photograph!', '2005-03-07 15:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213058, 152605, 15207, '<td valign="top">Wow! I can''t wait to read you comments to find otu what kind of mutant bird this is. Very cool looking!!</td>', 'Wow! I can''t wait to read you comments to find otu what kind of mutant bird this is. Very cool looking!!', '2005-03-07 15:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213073, 151154, 34660, '<td valign="top">very nice man.</td>', 'very nice man.', '2005-03-07 16:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213076, 153110, 31167, '<td valign="top">Great texture, but I would have liked to see more use of the tonal range. ie. push the small highlights in the pedals to white.</td>', 'Great texture, but I would have liked to see more use of the tonal range. ie. push the small highlights in the pedals to white.', '2005-03-07 16:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213077, 153201, 20168, '<td valign="top">Background is a little blurry and overexposed where light enters the photo.  The range of black to white is very powerful in this image.</td>', 'Background is a little blurry and overexposed where light enters the photo.  The range of black to white is very powerful in this image.', '2005-03-07 16:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213079, 152880, 20168, '<td valign="top">Excellent image.  The road surface in the foreground distracts from the overall quality of the photo.  I like the focus and sharpness of detail.</td>', 'Excellent image.  The road surface in the foreground distracts from the overall quality of the photo.  I like the focus and sharpness of detail.', '2005-03-07 16:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213084, 153195, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great location and detail. Imagine shooting this on a windless day to that the stones reflected would come to fuller clarity and sharpness!</td>', 'Great location and detail. Imagine shooting this on a windless day to that the stones reflected would come to fuller clarity and sharpness!', '2005-03-07 16:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213088, 153120, 20168, '<td valign="top">The snow looks grey in this image.  The clouds are spectacular, and the landscape scene a grand AA capture.</td>', 'The snow looks grey in this image.  The clouds are spectacular, and the landscape scene a grand AA capture.', '2005-03-07 16:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213091, 153226, 32595, '<td valign="top">i like it nice depth of field wish I could see a larger version</td>', 'i like it nice depth of field wish I could see a larger version', '2005-03-07 16:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213093, 153257, 20168, '<td valign="top">The background is blurred.  AA didn''t do a lot of portrait work.  All the same, here''s to those in the medical field, our local heroes!  best of luck</td>', 'The background is blurred.  AA didn''t do a lot of portrait work.  All the same, here''s to those in the medical field, our local heroes!  best of luck', '2005-03-07 16:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213097, 153246, 5792, '<td valign="top">Got the proper adams style high contrast image. The picture is not in good focus and there appears to be some strange type of noise on the left of the tree.</td>', 'Got the proper adams style high contrast image. The picture is not in good focus and there appears to be some strange type of noise on the left of the tree.', '2005-03-07 16:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213099, 153368, 20168, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of full range of tones/zones while capturing the details of the landscape.  Composition is a bit off, with the base of the tree cut off along with a right hand major branch and the small white weed/flowers making a corner impact without seeing where they are coming from.  I like it though.  Nice work.</td>', 'Excellent use of full range of tones/zones while capturing the details of the landscape.  Composition is a bit off, with the base of the tree cut off along with a right hand major branch and the small white weed/flowers making a corner impact without seeing where they are coming from.  I like it though.  Nice work.', '2005-03-07 16:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213102, 153365, 20168, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This photo has a lot going on.  Perhaps too much.  Where is the focal point. The mossy hangings also seem a bit blurred.  Perhaps they were moving in the wind?  I like the variety of tonal range found in the photo.</td>', 'Wow!  This photo has a lot going on.  Perhaps too much.  Where is the focal point. The mossy hangings also seem a bit blurred.  Perhaps they were moving in the wind?  I like the variety of tonal range found in the photo.', '2005-03-07 16:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213103, 151708, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nothing wrong with the choicse of subject and you have a good deep black. The tiny specks on the petals are distracting and should be cloned out. The stamine suffers from an oversharpened digital look that could also be cloned to remove.</td>', 'Nothing wrong with the choicse of subject and you have a good deep black. The tiny specks on the petals are distracting and should be cloned out. The stamine suffers from an oversharpened digital look that could also be cloned to remove.', '2005-03-07 16:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213104, 153282, 20168, '<td valign="top">The backlighting of the tree causes us to lose the clarity of detail of texture within the tree.  Apart from this small matter, the photo captures AA''s style well.</td>', 'The backlighting of the tree causes us to lose the clarity of detail of texture within the tree.  Apart from this small matter, the photo captures AA''s style well.', '2005-03-07 16:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213105, 153245, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good adams-like landscape shot selection and it has nice clouds in the sky. The image, however is very soft focused. Adams is known for his tack sharp images with very deep DOF.</td>', 'Good adams-like landscape shot selection and it has nice clouds in the sky. The image, however is very soft focused. Adams is known for his tack sharp images with very deep DOF.', '2005-03-07 16:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213107, 152633, 20168, '<td valign="top">Excellent seascape, with special emphasis upon the lighting on the water as it emerges into the ocean. Great lines.  Good clarity.  Perhaps lightening up the expanse of sand to bring greater tonal variety in that interesting texture would help.  Still, a great photo.</td>', 'Excellent seascape, with special emphasis upon the lighting on the water as it emerges into the ocean. Great lines.  Good clarity.  Perhaps lightening up the expanse of sand to bring greater tonal variety in that interesting texture would help.  Still, a great photo.', '2005-03-07 16:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213108, 153432, 20168, '<td valign="top">One of the best I''ve seen yet.  Great range of zones/tones, good detail in the copse of trees below and snowfields above.  The only part which lacks something is in the mid section dark forested area, where details of tree textures are a bit lost for over shadowing.  Great image.</td>', 'One of the best I''ve seen yet.  Great range of zones/tones, good detail in the copse of trees below and snowfields above.  The only part which lacks something is in the mid section dark forested area, where details of tree textures are a bit lost for over shadowing.  Great image.', '2005-03-07 16:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213109, 152081, 20168, '<td valign="top">Beautiful winter landscape photo.  In my newbie opinion, it lacks that AA sharpness in the details of the trees.  Best of luck.</td>', 'Beautiful winter landscape photo.  In my newbie opinion, it lacks that AA sharpness in the details of the trees.  Best of luck.', '2005-03-07 16:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213113, 153426, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good subject and composition. Image is not in the high contrast style of Adams, but it is really the overall focus of the image that is its main issue. It seems both oversharpened and out of focus at the same time. This is common with digital landscapes.  I know, I take landscapes all the time and all mine are like that. It is probably the camera''s internal processor doing it to you.</td>', 'Good subject and composition. Image is not in the high contrast style of Adams, but it is really the overall focus of the image that is its main issue. It seems both oversharpened and out of focus at the same time. This is common with digital landscapes.  I know, I take landscapes all the time and all mine are like that. It is probably the camera''s internal processor doing it to you.', '2005-03-07 16:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213114, 152042, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lacks confidence in sharpness.  Whites at top are overexposed.  Apart from these nitpicks, the subject is strong example of AA''s style.</td>', 'Lacks confidence in sharpness.  Whites at top are overexposed.  Apart from these nitpicks, the subject is strong example of AA''s style.', '2005-03-07 16:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213115, 152798, 5792, '<td valign="top">The soft focus of the water is fine, but the image lacks side detail to provide both interest and a setting for the flow.</td>', 'The soft focus of the water is fine, but the image lacks side detail to provide both interest and a setting for the flow.', '2005-03-07 16:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213117, 153262, 20168, '<td valign="top">Mountain is overly minimalized by the composition in this photo, and loses my interest by the silhouetted  backlighting of the sky.  I love the wonderful cloud patterns!</td>', 'Mountain is overly minimalized by the composition in this photo, and loses my interest by the silhouetted  backlighting of the sky.  I love the wonderful cloud patterns!', '2005-03-07 16:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213119, 152979, 20168, '<td valign="top">Good composition and range of tones.</td>', 'Good composition and range of tones.', '2005-03-07 16:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213120, 153253, 5792, '<td valign="top">Contrast is not as high as it migh be to make the trees and snow stand out more. The sky lacks detail and the overall focus is a little on the soft side. You will see that all of Adams'' work is focused to perfection.</td>', 'Contrast is not as high as it migh be to make the trees and snow stand out more. The sky lacks detail and the overall focus is a little on the soft side. You will see that all of Adams'' work is focused to perfection.', '2005-03-07 16:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213122, 153370, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, and use of full zone range of black to white.</td>', 'Lovely composition, and use of full zone range of black to white.', '2005-03-07 16:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213123, 151440, 20168, '<td valign="top">Foreground is overexposed, along with the brightest whites in the tree.  The black background is blurred, losing that AA sharpness in the full range of zones.  A beautiful image nonetheless.</td>', 'Foreground is overexposed, along with the brightest whites in the tree.  The black background is blurred, losing that AA sharpness in the full range of zones.  A beautiful image nonetheless.', '2005-03-07 16:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213125, 153006, 5792, '<td valign="top">You will see that in all Adams'' images they have high contrast, like yours, but also are perfectly focused. Yours is not. Yours looks to have digital sharpening yet does not seem in clear focus.</td>', 'You will see that in all Adams'' images they have high contrast, like yours, but also are perfectly focused. Yours is not. Yours looks to have digital sharpening yet does not seem in clear focus.', '2005-03-07 16:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213126, 151984, 20168, '<td valign="top">Less is more.  Thanks for this simple and powerful black and white.  Great composition.  Excellent clarity.  Hope this does well.</td>', 'Less is more.  Thanks for this simple and powerful black and white.  Great composition.  Excellent clarity.  Hope this does well.', '2005-03-07 16:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213128, 153387, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great framing and good contrast but just a touch soft in focus. Too bad there aren''t more interesting details to show in the sky.</td>', 'Great framing and good contrast but just a touch soft in focus. Too bad there aren''t more interesting details to show in the sky.', '2005-03-07 16:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213154, 151791, 30392, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast and details, well done! 9</td>', 'Very nice contrast and details, well done! 9', '2005-03-07 16:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213157, 152042, 32285, '<td valign="top">Very nice, Love your comp!:)</td>', 'Very nice, Love your comp!:)', '2005-03-07 16:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213158, 152749, 30392, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the birds but I''d like the horizon flat..</td>', 'Nice capture of the birds but I''d like the horizon flat..', '2005-03-07 16:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213160, 151251, 32285, '<td valign="top">Very cool, was this an inversion?</td>', 'Very cool, was this an inversion?', '2005-03-07 16:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213161, 152486, 30392, '<td valign="top">Hi Marbo, another great shot</td>', 'Hi Marbo, another great shot', '2005-03-07 16:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213163, 153499, 32285, '<td valign="top">Excellent comp and clarity here! Love htis! Gets a 9 from me!:)</td>', 'Excellent comp and clarity here! Love htis! Gets a 9 from me!:)', '2005-03-07 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213165, 152891, 32285, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Wonderful shot!', '2005-03-07 16:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213167, 152979, 32285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Love the textures!</td>', 'Beautiful image. Love the textures!', '2005-03-07 16:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213170, 152320, 32285, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I love the clarity and sharpness of the clouds!</td>', 'Cool shot. I love the clarity and sharpness of the clouds!', '2005-03-07 17:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213171, 153417, 32285, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  great composition.</td>', 'Nice shot.  great composition.', '2005-03-07 17:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213173, 153329, 32285, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity and composition! 9!</td>', 'Excellent clarity and composition! 9!', '2005-03-07 17:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213175, 151680, 32285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot... Excellent composition and lighting! I love this! 10!:)</td>', 'Beautiful shot... Excellent composition and lighting! I love this! 10!:)', '2005-03-07 17:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213177, 153147, 32285, '<td valign="top">Cool comp here.</td>', 'Cool comp here.', '2005-03-07 17:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213179, 152992, 13958, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top placings. I like the bridge, leading into the light and disapearing background. My only comment for improvement would be to explore the possibility the have the picture without the botom right tree. Good look.</td>', 'This is one of my top placings. I like the bridge, leading into the light and disapearing background. My only comment for improvement would be to explore the possibility the have the picture without the botom right tree. Good look.', '2005-03-07 17:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213180, 152835, 32285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflection shot.  Looks alittle blurry, but still a great capture. 8</td>', 'Beautiful reflection shot.  Looks alittle blurry, but still a great capture. 8', '2005-03-07 17:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213183, 153242, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good work with lighting although the hot spot in the sky is a bit too white.  The composition is good and has a nice flow.  The horizon could be rotated a little. -7</td>', 'Good work with lighting although the hot spot in the sky is a bit too white.  The composition is good and has a nice flow.  The horizon could be rotated a little. -7', '2005-03-07 17:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213185, 153295, 24642, '<td valign="top">Lacks foreground and crispness. -5</td>', 'Lacks foreground and crispness. -5', '2005-03-07 17:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213188, 152330, 13958, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top rated picture. Lovely colours good space work (even without the moon I would like the big sky. I am sure Ansel did lots of pictures in colours too. I just hope this will not pull you down, being the only one having the courage to submit in colour. Good look.</td>', 'This is one of my top rated picture. Lovely colours good space work (even without the moon I would like the big sky. I am sure Ansel did lots of pictures in colours too. I just hope this will not pull you down, being the only one having the courage to submit in colour. Good look.', '2005-03-07 17:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213190, 153115, 24642, '<td valign="top">Strong image, nice flow with the water.  Plenty of detail in all areas.  Somehow I find the trees to the left a bit to bright.</td>', 'Strong image, nice flow with the water.  Plenty of detail in all areas.  Somehow I find the trees to the left a bit to bright.', '2005-03-07 17:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213194, 153205, 28337, '<td valign="top">not very interesting</td>', 'not very interesting', '2005-03-07 17:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213195, 153369, 12792, '<td valign="top">Having troulbe finding subject...  If the framing had been just a little higher (more sky and less forground) it''d appealed to me much more.</td>', 'Having troulbe finding subject...  If the framing had been just a little higher (more sky and less forground) it''d appealed to me much more.', '2005-03-07 17:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213196, 153150, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very good subject and lighting.  The composition might be stronger with less water at the bottom. -7</td>', 'Very good subject and lighting.  The composition might be stronger with less water at the bottom. -7', '2005-03-07 17:14:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1213198, 152274, 12792, '<td valign="top">I''m having difficulty finding a subject.  sorry.</td>', 'I''m having difficulty finding a subject.  sorry.', '2005-03-07 17:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213199, 152699, 17033, '<td valign="top">High key, not Ansel?</td>', 'High key, not Ansel?', '2005-03-07 17:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213200, 153219, 12792, '<td valign="top">Original</td>', 'Original', '2005-03-07 17:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213201, 153172, 12792, '<td valign="top">Impressive vision</td>', 'Impressive vision', '2005-03-07 17:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213202, 152302, 33421, '<td valign="top">great photo 9</td>', 'great photo 9', '2005-03-07 17:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213207, 153242, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, but too dark for Ansel</td>', 'Nice sky, but too dark for Ansel', '2005-03-07 17:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213209, 152500, 24642, '<td valign="top">A nice flowing subject with a good tonal range.  Seems to lack sharpness in fore and background. -6</td>', 'A nice flowing subject with a good tonal range.  Seems to lack sharpness in fore and background. -6', '2005-03-07 17:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213212, 153027, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I would have prefered to see more detail in the highlights and less of the "burned out" areas.  I know how difficult this kind of shot can be (especially w/digital), but Ansel prided himself on the delicate and detailed highlights</td>', 'Nice, but I would have prefered to see more detail in the highlights and less of the "burned out" areas.  I know how difficult this kind of shot can be (especially w/digital), but Ansel prided himself on the delicate and detailed highlights', '2005-03-07 17:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213215, 153181, 12792, '<td valign="top">Very Anselesque</td>', 'Very Anselesque', '2005-03-07 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213216, 153074, 12792, '<td valign="top">I wish the sky could have been more brooding.</td>', 'I wish the sky could have been more brooding.', '2005-03-07 17:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213217, 153263, 12792, '<td valign="top">More depth of field would have been a big help for me here.  Nice entry.</td>', 'More depth of field would have been a big help for me here.  Nice entry.', '2005-03-07 17:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213220, 153109, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, exposure and translation to B&amp;W.  The position of the cloud over the upthrusting of rock is spot-on.  Congrats!</td>', 'Nice composition, exposure and translation to B&W.  The position of the cloud over the upthrusting of rock is spot-on.  Congrats!', '2005-03-07 17:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213225, 151696, 30737, '<td valign="top">too bad for the water spots (if that''s what they are).</td>', 'too bad for the water spots (if that''s what they are).', '2005-03-07 17:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213230, 152500, 32285, '<td valign="top">Wonderful textures !8</td>', 'Wonderful textures !8', '2005-03-07 17:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213232, 152363, 32285, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2005-03-07 17:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213233, 153256, 30737, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrast and fous</td>', 'Excellent contrast and fous', '2005-03-07 17:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213237, 152061, 32285, '<td valign="top">Nicley composed! 7</td>', 'Nicley composed! 7', '2005-03-07 17:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213241, 152623, 1759, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene and excellent B&amp;W conversion. That is, very good tonality. I like the visual leading from foreground to middle to background. My only niggle is wondering if there could have been a composition that would give more foreground (visual) motion. Overall a most excellent entry.</td>', 'Lovely scene and excellent B&W conversion. That is, very good tonality. I like the visual leading from foreground to middle to background. My only niggle is wondering if there could have been a composition that would give more foreground (visual) motion. Overall a most excellent entry.', '2005-03-07 17:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213243, 153246, 12792, '<td valign="top">The focus hear is very distracting and removes almost all interest in the patterns I think you were working to capture.  Sorry, but good luck.</td>', 'The focus hear is very distracting and removes almost all interest in the patterns I think you were working to capture.  Sorry, but good luck.', '2005-03-07 17:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213245, 152006, 12792, '<td valign="top">I''m having trouble finding a specific subject.</td>', 'I''m having trouble finding a specific subject.', '2005-03-07 17:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213248, 152623, 17033, '<td valign="top">One of only two 10s<br/>Composition:great central focus framed by the two peaks - a sense of isolation and three dimensions.<br/>Post-Proc.: Tonally very dark but detail maintained skillfully...just enough light to balance mood. Sharpening high but not too much. Exceptional burning on peaks.<br/>Overall, reminds me of a highly detailed lithograph. A gem. Added to favourites.</td>', 'One of only two 10sComposition:great central focus framed by the two peaks - a sense of isolation and three dimensions.Post-Proc.: Tonally very dark but detail maintained skillfully...just enough light to balance mood. Sharpening high but not too much. Exceptional burning on peaks.Overall, reminds me of a highly detailed lithograph. A gem. Added to favourites.', '2005-03-07 17:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213252, 152756, 15511, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. The detail of the town is intriguing, and would have liked to see it a bit brighter.</td>', 'I love this picture. The detail of the town is intriguing, and would have liked to see it a bit brighter.', '2005-03-07 17:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213254, 152486, 6064, '<td valign="top">What a coincidence!!!<br/>I was at the London GTG and we were talking about places to take an AA picture in the South-East.  I said that a good place would be on the beach at Birling Gap on the South Coast.<br/> <br/>And here it is :)<br/> <br/>Good luck<br/> <br/>Geo</td>', 'What a coincidence!!!I was at the London GTG and we were talking about places to take an AA picture in the South-East.  I said that a good place would be on the beach at Birling Gap on the South Coast. And here it is :) Good luck Geo', '2005-03-07 17:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213255, 152852, 7291, '<td valign="top">LOL!  That''s just simply not fair!  Besides actually being in Yosemity Park this is the best place to take a picture that is Ansel-ish huh?  Very nice.  The lighting is where it needs to be but I''m noticing some color cast in the sky portion of the photo.  You may want to consider recalibrating your monitor (unless you intended it that way but I doubt that).</td>', 'LOL!  That''s just simply not fair!  Besides actually being in Yosemity Park this is the best place to take a picture that is Ansel-ish huh?  Very nice.  The lighting is where it needs to be but I''m noticing some color cast in the sky portion of the photo.  You may want to consider recalibrating your monitor (unless you intended it that way but I doubt that).', '2005-03-07 17:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213263, 152610, 15207, '<td valign="top">If this doesn''t win the blue I''ll be surprised. It''s absolutely perfection 10</td>', 'If this doesn''t win the blue I''ll be surprised. It''s absolutely perfection 10', '2005-03-07 17:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213265, 152330, 19978, '<td valign="top">Superb image. The deep dof gives it a feeling of majesty and scope. The last quarter moon is a huge bonus. Given the tree branches in the foreground, that''s a quarter-million mile dof! I hope you don''t get hammered on your decision to keep the color. My first 8 of the challenge. I''ll be back later to adjust.</td>', 'Superb image. The deep dof gives it a feeling of majesty and scope. The last quarter moon is a huge bonus. Given the tree branches in the foreground, that''s a quarter-million mile dof! I hope you don''t get hammered on your decision to keep the color. My first 8 of the challenge. I''ll be back later to adjust.', '2005-03-07 17:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213267, 153303, 18191, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped out the sky. The trees in it are distracting and take away from the overall composition and mood. The sky is also blown out and it detracts from the image. With that crop, you have a rocking shot! Only a minor nitpick. 8.</td>', 'I would have cropped out the sky. The trees in it are distracting and take away from the overall composition and mood. The sky is also blown out and it detracts from the image. With that crop, you have a rocking shot! Only a minor nitpick. 8.', '2005-03-07 17:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213270, 153392, 17033, '<td valign="top">One of only two 10s<br/>Truly spooky in a Sleepy Hollow way. Fantastic detail on the bark. I really don''t find the lack of detail in the rolling landscape behind as it only enhances the mood. Burning has ben artistically done..especially the hill in the apex of the arch which makes an eye and pulls the eye in a clever fashion. I think, in truth, Ansel didn''t delve into melancholy like this, but that''s defintiely our gain here. Added to favourites.</td>', 'One of only two 10sTruly spooky in a Sleepy Hollow way. Fantastic detail on the bark. I really don''t find the lack of detail in the rolling landscape behind as it only enhances the mood. Burning has ben artistically done..especially the hill in the apex of the arch which makes an eye and pulls the eye in a clever fashion. I think, in truth, Ansel didn''t delve into melancholy like this, but that''s defintiely our gain here. Added to favourites.', '2005-03-07 17:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213271, 153287, 19978, '<td valign="top">Wow. Beautiful. Excellent use of lines. A dof tour de force.</td>', 'Wow. Beautiful. Excellent use of lines. A dof tour de force.', '2005-03-07 17:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213274, 152305, 19978, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful. Definitely has the look and feel of AA. Superb job on composition and processing.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful. Definitely has the look and feel of AA. Superb job on composition and processing.', '2005-03-07 17:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213277, 153329, 15511, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite memories. I''ve moved away. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'One of my favorite memories. I''ve moved away. Thanks for sharing.', '2005-03-07 17:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213278, 151432, 17033, '<td valign="top">Looks like a macro of a pint of Guinness! Fantastic detail and skillfull processing. Ansel n the 21st Century.</td>', 'Looks like a macro of a pint of Guinness! Fantastic detail and skillfull processing. Ansel n the 21st Century.', '2005-03-07 17:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213282, 152852, 17033, '<td valign="top">Zonally, this runs counter to most images in the challenge as light is the key here although you have skillfully included the other end of the spectrum to balance the image. Excellent composition here which sets it apart from much of he competition. Top 5</td>', 'Zonally, this runs counter to most images in the challenge as light is the key here although you have skillfully included the other end of the spectrum to balance the image. Excellent composition here which sets it apart from much of he competition. Top 5', '2005-03-07 17:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213285, 153292, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lacks AA''s sharp clarity in near and far aspects.  Great composition.</td>', 'Lacks AA''s sharp clarity in near and far aspects.  Great composition.', '2005-03-07 17:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213286, 152958, 20168, '<td valign="top">The slight wind on the lake  and the weeds in the nearest foreground distract from the clarity of the image above.  Excellent AA style landscape.</td>', 'The slight wind on the lake  and the weeds in the nearest foreground distract from the clarity of the image above.  Excellent AA style landscape.', '2005-03-07 17:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213290, 152736, 20168, '<td valign="top">The landscape lacks clarity and the sea is dull compared with the extraordinary skies.</td>', 'The landscape lacks clarity and the sea is dull compared with the extraordinary skies.', '2005-03-07 17:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213291, 153366, 15511, '<td valign="top">I wanted to shoot that tree, too, but since the sky was clear on Sunday, I went elsewhere. Could be sharpened a bit more, I think.</td>', 'I wanted to shoot that tree, too, but since the sky was clear on Sunday, I went elsewhere. Could be sharpened a bit more, I think.', '2005-03-07 17:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213293, 152366, 20168, '<td valign="top">Unlike so many of the photos in this challenge this photo does not have problems with blurring.  If anything the nearest foreground is oversharpened.  I love the detail in the grain of the tombstones and the wide range of tones.  Great shot.</td>', 'Unlike so many of the photos in this challenge this photo does not have problems with blurring.  If anything the nearest foreground is oversharpened.  I love the detail in the grain of the tombstones and the wide range of tones.  Great shot.', '2005-03-07 17:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213294, 153015, 29440, '<td valign="top">Great tonal values from black to white.</td>', 'Great tonal values from black to white.', '2005-03-07 17:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213304, 153426, 20168, '<td valign="top">Try adding more of the trees and shrubs into the foreground to highlight the contrasting cliffs in the main focal point of the scene.  The photo is a touch out of sharpest focus.  Great landscape image in AA style!</td>', 'Try adding more of the trees and shrubs into the foreground to highlight the contrasting cliffs in the main focal point of the scene.  The photo is a touch out of sharpest focus.  Great landscape image in AA style!', '2005-03-07 17:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213308, 151251, 15511, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I like the inverse also.</td>', 'Interesting idea. I like the inverse also.', '2005-03-07 17:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213310, 151251, 30818, '<td valign="top">This is too over exposed for Ansel Adams</td>', 'This is too over exposed for Ansel Adams', '2005-03-07 18:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213312, 152916, 20168, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity in this image.  My mind wants to see more of the setting around the outside of the church building, including the bottome of the steps.  I love the photo.</td>', 'Excellent clarity in this image.  My mind wants to see more of the setting around the outside of the church building, including the bottome of the steps.  I love the photo.', '2005-03-07 18:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213318, 152770, 20168, '<td valign="top">Superb AA style photo with full range of zones in play.  Great shot!</td>', 'Superb AA style photo with full range of zones in play.  Great shot!', '2005-03-07 18:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213319, 152363, 20168, '<td valign="top">Too much blue, though the clarity of the image is grand.</td>', 'Too much blue, though the clarity of the image is grand.', '2005-03-07 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213326, 152861, 20168, '<td valign="top">Creative subject choice!  I would love to see the facing of some of these fiddles rather than just the sideviews, highlighting the range of tones in the woodgrain on their surfaces.</td>', 'Creative subject choice!  I would love to see the facing of some of these fiddles rather than just the sideviews, highlighting the range of tones in the woodgrain on their surfaces.', '2005-03-07 18:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213330, 153114, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great range of tones with a beautiful gradient of light to dark, left to right.</td>', 'Great range of tones with a beautiful gradient of light to dark, left to right.', '2005-03-07 18:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213338, 152623, 20168, '<td valign="top">One of the finest AA style photos in the challenge.  Congrats on a great shot.</td>', 'One of the finest AA style photos in the challenge.  Congrats on a great shot.', '2005-03-07 18:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213343, 153469, 20168, '<td valign="top">Excellent compositional choice with a grand sky overhead revealing the wide range of AA style zone B/W photography.  Thanks.</td>', 'Excellent compositional choice with a grand sky overhead revealing the wide range of AA style zone B/W photography.  Thanks.', '2005-03-07 18:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
