(1213360, 153014, 20168, '<td valign="top">What a shot! I love the contrasts of light and dark in the foreground boulders, the white sea mist and crashing wave before the dark serrated cliff face, leading our eyes up and beyond to the delicate cyrus clouds. Thanks for an extraordinary photo!</td>', 'What a shot! I love the contrasts of light and dark in the foreground boulders, the white sea mist and crashing wave before the dark serrated cliff face, leading our eyes up and beyond to the delicate cyrus clouds. Thanks for an extraordinary photo!', '2005-03-07 18:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
