(1213431, 152623, 32285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tribute! 9</td>', 'Beautiful tribute! 9', '2005-03-07 18:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213435, 152212, 21362, '<td valign="top">Shot on another day with more interesting clouds I this would have something. The contrast of the sharp prickly wood with a backdrop of fluffy clouds would be nice.<br/> <br/>Here the composure of the sky is distracting to me, with the band of dark and band of light -- the photo feels a bit top heavy with those upper dark clouds I guess. I know that''s not your fault, since you don''t control the weather. But it might be a nice photo to reshoot another day.<br/> <br/>I think the clarity and tonal range on the dead wood itself is great. Nice job.</td>', 'Shot on another day with more interesting clouds I this would have something. The contrast of the sharp prickly wood with a backdrop of fluffy clouds would be nice. Here the composure of the sky is distracting to me, with the band of dark and band of light -- the photo feels a bit top heavy with those upper dark clouds I guess. I know that''s not your fault, since you don''t control the weather. But it might be a nice photo to reshoot another day. I think the clarity and tonal range on the dead wood itself is great. Nice job.', '2005-03-07 18:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213445, 153269, 21362, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites so far -- a visual feast. Great DOF from the foreground rocks to the lovely crashing wave in the back. The light on the water is gorgeous.<br/> <br/>The only think I don''t like are those unnatural looking black clouds that pull my eyes away up to the corners.</td>', 'One of my favorites so far -- a visual feast. Great DOF from the foreground rocks to the lovely crashing wave in the back. The light on the water is gorgeous. The only think I don''t like are those unnatural looking black clouds that pull my eyes away up to the corners.', '2005-03-07 19:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
