(1213596, 153149, 33560, '<td valign="top">The sky is gorteous.  And though it'' a bit static, I like the composition. Is it just me, or does most of the stuff in the foreground look just a little unsharp?  In any other challenge this would be a quibble, but in this one it seems more important, especially since the photo is about textures.</td>', 'The sky is gorteous.  And though it'' a bit static, I like the composition. Is it just me, or does most of the stuff in the foreground look just a little unsharp?  In any other challenge this would be a quibble, but in this one it seems more important, especially since the photo is about textures.', '2005-03-07 20:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213600, 153229, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good idea and framed properly according to the rule of thirds. This image is more high key than it is Ansel Adams style but that did not bother me. It suffers from what most of my digital images suffer from... It looks both oversharpened and out of focus at the same time when there is a lot of fine detail like in the sand. It is made worse in a demanding challenge like this one.  The top of the frame is washed out and makes you wonder more what was missed than it does enhancing the main subject. (Score: 5)</td>', 'Good idea and framed properly according to the rule of thirds. This image is more high key than it is Ansel Adams style but that did not bother me. It suffers from what most of my digital images suffer from... It looks both oversharpened and out of focus at the same time when there is a lot of fine detail like in the sand. It is made worse in a demanding challenge like this one.  The top of the frame is washed out and makes you wonder more what was missed than it does enhancing the main subject. (Score: 5)', '2005-03-07 20:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213602, 152699, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a clever shot.  It may even deserve to win some competition; but perhaps due to my own limited exposure, it does not evoke AA''s work.</td>', 'It''s a clever shot.  It may even deserve to win some competition; but perhaps due to my own limited exposure, it does not evoke AA''s work.', '2005-03-07 20:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213604, 153138, 13305, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is what Adams would have done, but I do like the image.  Lots of great tonal differences.  Good composition, lighting, and focus.</td>', 'I don''t think this is what Adams would have done, but I do like the image.  Lots of great tonal differences.  Good composition, lighting, and focus.', '2005-03-07 20:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213607, 153427, 13305, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Correct the camera tilt to have a really smashing picture.</td>', 'Good photo.  Correct the camera tilt to have a really smashing picture.', '2005-03-07 20:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213609, 153254, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful, rugged place.  I love the way the snow cover accentuates the rugged edges.  It looks to me as if the photo is a little low in contrast for the challenge - it would be lovely to see some really punch blacks in some part of the photo.  And while it is growing more and more the standard thing to add people to outdoor scenes to ''add interest''  I find the person really distracting.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful, rugged place.  I love the way the snow cover accentuates the rugged edges.  It looks to me as if the photo is a little low in contrast for the challenge - it would be lovely to see some really punch blacks in some part of the photo.  And while it is growing more and more the standard thing to add people to outdoor scenes to ''add interest''  I find the person really distracting.', '2005-03-07 20:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213615, 151764, 33560, '<td valign="top">A photo Ansel himself might covet.  Nice job.</td>', 'A photo Ansel himself might covet.  Nice job.', '2005-03-07 20:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
