(1213761, 153074, 31214, '<td valign="top">Very nice...I might recommend adding a little shadow to the tree.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice...I might recommend adding a little shadow to the tree.  Good job.', '2005-03-07 21:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213769, 152802, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a remarkably successful shot in terms of evoking AA''s work, even though it does not have the dark sky with big puffy clouds, or snow-capped mountains, or streams, or barren trees, or blades of grass. There is a kind of brutish ugliness that this scene portrays that is the complete opposite of the pristine beauty AA photographed. I guess that''s the point.</td>', 'It''s a remarkably successful shot in terms of evoking AA''s work, even though it does not have the dark sky with big puffy clouds, or snow-capped mountains, or streams, or barren trees, or blades of grass. There is a kind of brutish ugliness that this scene portrays that is the complete opposite of the pristine beauty AA photographed. I guess that''s the point.', '2005-03-07 21:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213772, 152305, 31214, '<td valign="top">I like the way you create the Ansel path to follow and give depth to the image.  Great job!</td>', 'I like the way you create the Ansel path to follow and give depth to the image.  Great job!', '2005-03-07 21:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213778, 152984, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s quite gorgeous, but that gaussian blur seems a little out of place.</td>', 'It''s quite gorgeous, but that gaussian blur seems a little out of place.', '2005-03-07 21:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213780, 153404, 33560, '<td valign="top">Good location and nice strong contrast.  The blacks seem just a little too big and blotchy to me.</td>', 'Good location and nice strong contrast.  The blacks seem just a little too big and blotchy to me.', '2005-03-07 22:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213801, 152212, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity and interesting subject. Tones are nice, too. It may be interesting to add some contrast to those clouds overhead. Nice work. 8</td>', 'Nice clarity and interesting subject. Tones are nice, too. It may be interesting to add some contrast to those clouds overhead. Nice work. 8', '2005-03-07 22:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213802, 153026, 33560, '<td valign="top">Strong, directional light, texture in skin, simple and uncluttered image.  These match what little I know of Ansel Adam''s portrait work.  It''s a beautiful shot.  Thanks for going out on a limb.</td>', 'Strong, directional light, texture in skin, simple and uncluttered image.  These match what little I know of Ansel Adam''s portrait work.  It''s a beautiful shot.  Thanks for going out on a limb.', '2005-03-07 22:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213804, 152747, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple composition of this coot. Snow texture is very pleasing. 8</td>', 'Nice, simple composition of this coot. Snow texture is very pleasing. 8', '2005-03-07 22:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213807, 152992, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very lovely composition. The lines work nicely together here! 9</td>', 'Very lovely composition. The lines work nicely together here! 9', '2005-03-07 22:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213809, 153081, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lots of nice textures here. Tonal range is good, too. 8</td>', 'Lots of nice textures here. Tonal range is good, too. 8', '2005-03-07 22:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213812, 151420, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super handle of highlights here. Nice and bright without being blown. Cool point of view. 9</td>', 'Super handle of highlights here. Nice and bright without being blown. Cool point of view. 9', '2005-03-07 22:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213813, 153088, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting study of leaves and balanced composition. I like it. 8</td>', 'Interesting study of leaves and balanced composition. I like it. 8', '2005-03-07 22:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213814, 153227, 6870, '<td valign="top">Quirky composition, but it works for me. The trunk going up counterpointed by the tree reflection going down is weird, but effective. 8</td>', 'Quirky composition, but it works for me. The trunk going up counterpointed by the tree reflection going down is weird, but effective. 8', '2005-03-07 22:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213815, 153503, 6870, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. Your point of view works well for me. Nice tonal range in the sky and branches. 9</td>', 'Simple and effective. Your point of view works well for me. Nice tonal range in the sky and branches. 9', '2005-03-07 22:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213817, 153026, 6870, '<td valign="top">I feel you''ve captured AA''s style here nicely. The tonal range is very effective and very Adams. 8</td>', 'I feel you''ve captured AA''s style here nicely. The tonal range is very effective and very Adams. 8', '2005-03-07 22:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213820, 153181, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very lovely study of this plane tree (sycamore). The tonal range is very nice, and invites the eye to go around and see every bit of texture it can. 9</td>', 'Very lovely study of this plane tree (sycamore). The tonal range is very nice, and invites the eye to go around and see every bit of texture it can. 9', '2005-03-07 22:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213822, 153109, 14620, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful... great contrast between the sky and rock it''s almost 3-D looking.  Well Done!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful... great contrast between the sky and rock it''s almost 3-D looking.  Well Done!', '2005-03-07 22:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213827, 153329, 14620, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition, beautiful sky and excellent contrasts in this photo. Bumping to a 9</td>', 'Fantastic composition, beautiful sky and excellent contrasts in this photo. Bumping to a 9', '2005-03-07 22:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213828, 153117, 14620, '<td valign="top">Is this a color shot?  Almost can''t tell.  It''s quite beautiful, a lovely scene.</td>', 'Is this a color shot?  Almost can''t tell.  It''s quite beautiful, a lovely scene.', '2005-03-07 22:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213830, 153257, 33560, '<td valign="top">This is a competently exposed photo, and the lighting is good.  The apparatus held by the subject clutters and confuses.  And if this were not the case, it would still have no discernable link to the challenge.</td>', 'This is a competently exposed photo, and the lighting is good.  The apparatus held by the subject clutters and confuses.  And if this were not the case, it would still have no discernable link to the challenge.', '2005-03-07 22:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213832, 153233, 14620, '<td valign="top">Amazing clarity and contrasts.  I love, love, love the composition.</td>', 'Amazing clarity and contrasts.  I love, love, love the composition.', '2005-03-07 22:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213835, 152852, 14620, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous composition and wonderful subject matter.</td>', 'Gorgeous composition and wonderful subject matter.', '2005-03-07 22:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213852, 153231, 33560, '<td valign="top">And he used directional light and got us to see strong textures - both strong points of this photo.  I''m afraid most of my time looking at this phot has been in trying to figure out how the highlight behind the subject was made.  And in this sense I find it highly distracting.  I try to refocus on the subject, but I keep getting pulled away...</td>', 'And he used directional light and got us to see strong textures - both strong points of this photo.  I''m afraid most of my time looking at this phot has been in trying to figure out how the highlight behind the subject was made.  And in this sense I find it highly distracting.  I try to refocus on the subject, but I keep getting pulled away...', '2005-03-07 22:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1213864, 152610, 32285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! Love your angle and comp. 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot! Love your angle and comp. 10', '2005-03-07 22:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
