(1214281, 152330, 33145, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. You are probably going to get criticised for the color. The sky would have been very dramatic in black against the moon and the white mountain tops. It''s also a shame about the tree to the left encroaching into the shot. The horizon line seems about 1-2 degrees out of horizontal as well. 7.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. You are probably going to get criticised for the color. The sky would have been very dramatic in black against the moon and the white mountain tops. It''s also a shame about the tree to the left encroaching into the shot. The horizon line seems about 1-2 degrees out of horizontal as well. 7.', '2005-03-08 05:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1214282, 153309, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent.</td>', 'Excellent.', '2005-03-08 05:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1214284, 151792, 33145, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite for the challenge. Perfect composition. I love the falling snow. The only thing I marked it down for was the grey sky which could have been adjusted. 9.</td>', 'This is my favourite for the challenge. Perfect composition. I love the falling snow. The only thing I marked it down for was the grey sky which could have been adjusted. 9.', '2005-03-08 05:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
