(1214500, 152494, 15919, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Some burning and dodging of the sky could have made it better, I think.</td>', 'Nice image.  Some burning and dodging of the sky could have made it better, I think.', '2005-03-08 08:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
