(1216107, 152212, 19503, '<td valign="top">Gawd I love the texture, detail and tonal range of this picture, I only wish you would have done a slightly different angle, I think if you moved the camera slightly to the right, and lowered it just a bit, you would have a 10 from me. This angle doesn''t quite give the dramatic feeling of an AA. GL</td>', 'Gawd I love the texture, detail and tonal range of this picture, I only wish you would have done a slightly different angle, I think if you moved the camera slightly to the right, and lowered it just a bit, you would have a 10 from me. This angle doesn''t quite give the dramatic feeling of an AA. GL', '2005-03-08 23:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216109, 153245, 14986, '<td valign="top">You found a great spot for this...and made the most of it.  Great b/w tones IMO, with detail evident and nothing blown out.  Good composition and interest to this viewer anyway.  I''m not an Ansel expert, but I believe this is a great photo for the challenge and in its own right.</td>', 'You found a great spot for this...and made the most of it.  Great b/w tones IMO, with detail evident and nothing blown out.  Good composition and interest to this viewer anyway.  I''m not an Ansel expert, but I believe this is a great photo for the challenge and in its own right.', '2005-03-09 00:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216129, 153117, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful and the tones make the scene really have some impact on the viewer.  Very clean and clear with a wide range of the b/w scale.  One of my  top picks.</td>', 'This is really beautiful and the tones make the scene really have some impact on the viewer.  Very clean and clear with a wide range of the b/w scale.  One of my  top picks.', '2005-03-09 00:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216134, 153289, 19503, '<td valign="top">The silhouettes of the cows is very cool in this setting, cood composition and detail. I think AA would have approved of this :) I give it an 8. GL :)</td>', 'The silhouettes of the cows is very cool in this setting, cood composition and detail. I think AA would have approved of this :) I give it an 8. GL :)', '2005-03-09 00:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216139, 152770, 14986, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I wish the front portion of the hill wasn''t quite so dark.  Still, one of my top picks for the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice.  I wish the front portion of the hill wasn''t quite so dark.  Still, one of my top picks for the challenge.', '2005-03-09 00:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216142, 152852, 19503, '<td valign="top">Is this a copy of one of his?? :) j/k .. Really good imitation.. I love this type of shot. Perfect detail and tonal range. GL</td>', 'Is this a copy of one of his?? :) j/k .. Really good imitation.. I love this type of shot. Perfect detail and tonal range. GL', '2005-03-09 00:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216154, 153333, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I do wish the horse and rider were a bit more at an angle so it is more evident what it is.  The tones, composition and mood to this shot is just wonderful IMO.  Congratulations on a great job.   This will make a wonderful print.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I do wish the horse and rider were a bit more at an angle so it is more evident what it is.  The tones, composition and mood to this shot is just wonderful IMO.  Congratulations on a great job.   This will make a wonderful print.', '2005-03-09 00:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216161, 152610, 14986, '<td valign="top">Almost a sureal feel to the lighting here that make it look like a painting.  I like the effect.  I also like the sense of depth given with the other horse being in the background, and the fence being in the front.   This will make a splendid print and should do very well in this challenge.</td>', 'Almost a sureal feel to the lighting here that make it look like a painting.  I like the effect.  I also like the sense of depth given with the other horse being in the background, and the fence being in the front.   This will make a splendid print and should do very well in this challenge.', '2005-03-09 00:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216168, 152350, 14986, '<td valign="top">Really nice tones to this shot.   I think I would have liked a little less centered composition and more room at the top of the photo, above the hill.  As it is, though, it''s still one of my top 10 picks.</td>', 'Really nice tones to this shot.   I think I would have liked a little less centered composition and more room at the top of the photo, above the hill.  As it is, though, it''s still one of my top 10 picks.', '2005-03-09 00:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216169, 152232, 19503, '<td valign="top">Wow. The contrail hitting the tree top! <br/> <br/>Dramatic indeed. Amazing detail and composition.. This cut reminds me of several places I''ve been to like that, but I don''t think I would be able to make such a dramatic scene as this out of it.. <br/> <br/>Good Job.</td>', 'Wow. The contrail hitting the tree top!  Dramatic indeed. Amazing detail and composition.. This cut reminds me of several places I''ve been to like that, but I don''t think I would be able to make such a dramatic scene as this out of it..  Good Job.', '2005-03-09 00:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216173, 152320, 14986, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones and great composition.  I''m just not all that interested in the subject, but I don''t know how it could be improved on.   I think the shot itself is done very well.</td>', 'Very nice tones and great composition.  I''m just not all that interested in the subject, but I don''t know how it could be improved on.   I think the shot itself is done very well.', '2005-03-09 00:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216183, 151792, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is my highest rated "tree" shot for the challenge.   Pretty good tones and a nice choice of tree / location.</td>', 'This is my highest rated "tree" shot for the challenge.   Pretty good tones and a nice choice of tree / location.', '2005-03-09 00:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216203, 153262, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to comment on some of the photos I don''t think will do very well in this challenge.   I think this photo has very little depth to the tone range of black and white.  Only black at the bottom with no detail, and a sky filling the frame with no real drama and with blown out highlights.   There is nothing here that holds my interest and technically,  the exposure and photoshop work could be improved, I think.  I hope this is helpful.</td>', 'I''m trying to comment on some of the photos I don''t think will do very well in this challenge.   I think this photo has very little depth to the tone range of black and white.  Only black at the bottom with no detail, and a sky filling the frame with no real drama and with blown out highlights.   There is nothing here that holds my interest and technically,  the exposure and photoshop work could be improved, I think.  I hope this is helpful.', '2005-03-09 00:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
