(1217831, 153117, 16965, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull image.  Did you even desaturate it?  It almost looks like there is a hint of blue in the sky!  Great work...good luck!</td>', 'Wonderfull image.  Did you even desaturate it?  It almost looks like there is a hint of blue in the sky!  Great work...good luck!', '2005-03-09 14:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
