(1218546, 151791, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image should win the blue ribbon. Super shot! Great composition and capture of white cloud highlighting the mountain. By far, this is the best example of the Ansel Adams style. The tonal range is perfect and it''s super clarity is in the best tradition of Ansel Adams. Ansel himself would praise it.</td>', 'This image should win the blue ribbon. Super shot! Great composition and capture of white cloud highlighting the mountain. By far, this is the best example of the Ansel Adams style. The tonal range is perfect and it''s super clarity is in the best tradition of Ansel Adams. Ansel himself would praise it.', '2005-03-09 19:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
