(1218650, 153026, 19982, '<td valign="top">Hey, someone dared to try a people picture.  Good for you.  I like the skin tones and the detail in the eyes.  Lighting is good.  Depth of field is good.  Is it in the style of AA?  That''s the hard part to decide...  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Hey, someone dared to try a people picture.  Good for you.  I like the skin tones and the detail in the eyes.  Lighting is good.  Depth of field is good.  Is it in the style of AA?  That''s the hard part to decide...  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-03-09 20:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218652, 152603, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a top contender in the challenge.  Excellent composition.  Great depth of field.  One minor observation is the sharp line where the land meets the sky, I think this small area could be improved some.  This is one of my highest rated photographs for this challenge.  Beautiful in every way!</td>', 'This is definitely a top contender in the challenge.  Excellent composition.  Great depth of field.  One minor observation is the sharp line where the land meets the sky, I think this small area could be improved some.  This is one of my highest rated photographs for this challenge.  Beautiful in every way!', '2005-03-09 20:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
