(1218946, 153115, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo, the reflections and framing really grab my attention.  It just seems that the light on the trees in a bit overexposed.</td>', 'Excellent photo, the reflections and framing really grab my attention.  It just seems that the light on the trees in a bit overexposed.', '2005-03-09 23:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218948, 153361, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lighting and shadows.</td>', 'Nice use of lighting and shadows.', '2005-03-09 23:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218949, 153074, 31403, '<td valign="top">great shot, would love to see it with a brooding sky too, but I love this</td>', 'great shot, would love to see it with a brooding sky too, but I love this', '2005-03-09 23:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218950, 152866, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice capturing the bird in flight... well done.</td>', 'Nice capturing the bird in flight... well done.', '2005-03-09 23:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218953, 153168, 23478, '<td valign="top">Dramatic sky and angle.</td>', 'Dramatic sky and angle.', '2005-03-09 23:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218958, 153255, 31403, '<td valign="top">stunning, very very nice</td>', 'stunning, very very nice', '2005-03-09 23:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218962, 153382, 23478, '<td valign="top">Interesting study in shadows and lighting, just a tad too dark for my liking.</td>', 'Interesting study in shadows and lighting, just a tad too dark for my liking.', '2005-03-09 23:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218963, 153115, 31403, '<td valign="top">excellent, I love it.  If I could have just one thing, it would be to step to your left and leave the dead bush out.  Still beautiful.</td>', 'excellent, I love it.  If I could have just one thing, it would be to step to your left and leave the dead bush out.  Still beautiful.', '2005-03-09 23:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218967, 152605, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and motion capture... the movement of the water is stunning, as is the white on black.  Goes in my top 10.</td>', 'Excellent detail and motion capture... the movement of the water is stunning, as is the white on black.  Goes in my top 10.', '2005-03-09 23:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218969, 153367, 31403, '<td valign="top">amazing clouds, great shot and nice PP</td>', 'amazing clouds, great shot and nice PP', '2005-03-09 23:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218981, 153303, 23478, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.', '2005-03-09 23:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218998, 152363, 11895, '<td valign="top">I know this comment won''t help to make you a better photog, but... YES!    this is my idea of a great AA entry, I hope people don''t vote it down for not being totally B&amp;W.  The only flaw I can find is what looks like some ice floating near center bottom, maybe that could have been cloned out so the water''s surface was more consistent</td>', 'I know this comment won''t help to make you a better photog, but... YES!    this is my idea of a great AA entry, I hope people don''t vote it down for not being totally B&W.  The only flaw I can find is what looks like some ice floating near center bottom, maybe that could have been cloned out so the water''s surface was more consistent', '2005-03-09 23:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219006, 152868, 11895, '<td valign="top">the top crop is poor, either give us some sky or cut it below the top of the ice &amp; rocks</td>', 'the top crop is poor, either give us some sky or cut it below the top of the ice & rocks', '2005-03-10 00:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219009, 152901, 11895, '<td valign="top">cool tower, the shot looks a little washed out on the left side but on the whole a very pleasing entry</td>', 'cool tower, the shot looks a little washed out on the left side but on the whole a very pleasing entry', '2005-03-10 00:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219033, 153363, 11895, '<td valign="top">the way the D&amp;B was done makes this look unnatural to me, there seems to be a light outline around the trees interupting the clouds, and the light parts near the bottom are too light, however you found great subject matter and got the exposure, the depth of field, and the tonal range right; this might do well, GL</td>', 'the way the D&B was done makes this look unnatural to me, there seems to be a light outline around the trees interupting the clouds, and the light parts near the bottom are too light, however you found great subject matter and got the exposure, the depth of field, and the tonal range right; this might do well, GL', '2005-03-10 00:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219051, 152671, 11895, '<td valign="top">this is good, nice depth of field and contrast, but I wish the top wasn''t cropped so tight, you decapitated that mountail in the background</td>', 'this is good, nice depth of field and contrast, but I wish the top wasn''t cropped so tight, you decapitated that mountail in the background', '2005-03-10 00:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219094, 153109, 34798, '<td valign="top">Great shadow detail and tonality of the sky!</td>', 'Great shadow detail and tonality of the sky!', '2005-03-10 01:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219118, 152486, 30857, '<td valign="top">The only thing I don''t like about this picture is the white border, it kind of distracts instead of helping to enhance the picture ... other than that this is a beautiful image , one of my favorites ....<br/>Good luck!!!</td>', 'The only thing I don''t like about this picture is the white border, it kind of distracts instead of helping to enhance the picture ... other than that this is a beautiful image , one of my favorites ....Good luck!!!', '2005-03-10 02:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219121, 152989, 16046, '<td valign="top">Nice work</td>', 'Nice work', '2005-03-10 02:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219122, 153330, 16046, '<td valign="top">Very nice, amazing drifts</td>', 'Very nice, amazing drifts', '2005-03-10 02:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219124, 151299, 16046, '<td valign="top">wow, errie, great work</td>', 'wow, errie, great work', '2005-03-10 02:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219125, 152610, 16046, '<td valign="top">wonderful, nice job</td>', 'wonderful, nice job', '2005-03-10 02:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219128, 152614, 28742, '<td valign="top">The photo is pretty good, but I don''t think Ansel had the low self esteem thing. ;-)  Recommendation: Let the voters decide if you suck. ;-)</td>', 'The photo is pretty good, but I don''t think Ansel had the low self esteem thing. ;-)  Recommendation: Let the voters decide if you suck. ;-)', '2005-03-10 02:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219129, 153469, 16046, '<td valign="top">Excellent sky work, nice shot</td>', 'Excellent sky work, nice shot', '2005-03-10 02:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219136, 153333, 16046, '<td valign="top">Awesome tones, great composition 10</td>', 'Awesome tones, great composition 10', '2005-03-10 03:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219137, 153146, 16046, '<td valign="top">cool, looks like a giant finger print, nice</td>', 'cool, looks like a giant finger print, nice', '2005-03-10 03:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219150, 153117, 31637, '<td valign="top">looks like a model. Unbelievable photo....I would of never known it it wasnt for the sky.</td>', 'looks like a model. Unbelievable photo....I would of never known it it wasnt for the sky.', '2005-03-10 03:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219151, 153330, 31637, '<td valign="top">Yes...great contrast and depth on the sky.</td>', 'Yes...great contrast and depth on the sky.', '2005-03-10 03:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219182, 152852, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2005-03-10 04:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219186, 153362, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I like the full range of shades and how it goes from dark in the sky to light on the ground.</td>', 'Nice photo, I like the full range of shades and how it goes from dark in the sky to light on the ground.', '2005-03-10 05:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219190, 153299, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo of the houses and the Lighthouse.  Very cool.  For me, the grain is just a bit too much and maybe you could have photoshopped out the posts  Neat image could have helped with the grain.</td>', 'Excellent photo of the houses and the Lighthouse.  Very cool.  For me, the grain is just a bit too much and maybe you could have photoshopped out the posts  Neat image could have helped with the grain.', '2005-03-10 05:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219193, 153417, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great framing and good sky... I may be wrong, but the horizon seems slightly tilted.</td>', 'Great framing and good sky... I may be wrong, but the horizon seems slightly tilted.', '2005-03-10 05:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219199, 153342, 23478, '<td valign="top">This is excellent... The wood in various states of decay and the light and shadows are great.  Maybe it would have been more interesting to step to the left a few paces instead of a straight on shot.</td>', 'This is excellent... The wood in various states of decay and the light and shadows are great.  Maybe it would have been more interesting to step to the left a few paces instead of a straight on shot.', '2005-03-10 05:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219200, 153404, 34748, '<td valign="top">Wow... I''ve seen a lot of beautifull places</td>', 'Wow... I''ve seen a lot of beautifull places', '2005-03-10 05:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219201, 153327, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice photo.', '2005-03-10 05:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219228, 153274, 7473, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.  the cabin is a third in, the contrast is good.  7</td>', 'Very nice picture.  the cabin is a third in, the contrast is good.  7', '2005-03-10 06:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219230, 153118, 7473, '<td valign="top">I really like the cloud cover in this picture, Nice 6</td>', 'I really like the cloud cover in this picture, Nice 6', '2005-03-10 06:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219231, 153026, 7473, '<td valign="top">very nice.  I love the thought it looks like he is giving.  Nice aperature setting with the bluring of the background.  7</td>', 'very nice.  I love the thought it looks like he is giving.  Nice aperature setting with the bluring of the background.  7', '2005-03-10 06:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219233, 152979, 7473, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of snow (white) and foilage and building (darker)  6</td>', 'I like the contrast of snow (white) and foilage and building (darker)  6', '2005-03-10 06:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219234, 153481, 7473, '<td valign="top">I''m not into the layout of the photo.  I''m not sure what it is either.  Possibly to much cloud at the top and maybe a little more water at the bottom.  maybe the bridge a third up vs 70% - - 5</td>', 'I''m not into the layout of the photo.  I''m not sure what it is either.  Possibly to much cloud at the top and maybe a little more water at the bottom.  maybe the bridge a third up vs 70% - - 5', '2005-03-10 06:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219237, 152901, 7473, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  The detail and shadowing on the ice tower is great.  Was this shot in the evening?  8</td>', 'Very nice composition.  The detail and shadowing on the ice tower is great.  Was this shot in the evening?  8', '2005-03-10 06:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219240, 151696, 7473, '<td valign="top">did you use a flash with this shot?  If so I think a longer shutter time might have been better.  The foreground is really lit up but the background is much darker....4</td>', 'did you use a flash with this shot?  If so I think a longer shutter time might have been better.  The foreground is really lit up but the background is much darker....4', '2005-03-10 06:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219241, 152662, 11897, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the shadows are a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot, the shadows are a little distracting.', '2005-03-10 06:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219242, 153168, 7473, '<td valign="top">I like this image, the cloud cover seems to be carrying itself away to the right.  I like the contrast in the mountain also.  Acctually it is the contrast in the mountain that really makes this shot. 7</td>', 'I like this image, the cloud cover seems to be carrying itself away to the right.  I like the contrast in the mountain also.  Acctually it is the contrast in the mountain that really makes this shot. 7', '2005-03-10 06:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219243, 153381, 11897, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus, nice tones.</td>', 'A little out of focus, nice tones.', '2005-03-10 06:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219244, 153339, 7473, '<td valign="top">This photo does not do it for me.  The image looks jumbled, there are no leading lines to follow.  The contrast of the snow on top and branch on bottom is nice though 5</td>', 'This photo does not do it for me.  The image looks jumbled, there are no leading lines to follow.  The contrast of the snow on top and branch on bottom is nice though 5', '2005-03-10 06:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219246, 152770, 11897, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene, a little too dark in the foreground at the waterline.</td>', 'Beautiful scene, a little too dark in the foreground at the waterline.', '2005-03-10 06:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219248, 152984, 7473, '<td valign="top">Nice low key macro shot.  Was this lit with a spot light?  The flower almost seems to radiate of its own internal light source.    Possibly a little less of the smudging on the outside of the flower (little less glow) would have been nice too. 6</td>', 'Nice low key macro shot.  Was this lit with a spot light?  The flower almost seems to radiate of its own internal light source.    Possibly a little less of the smudging on the outside of the flower (little less glow) would have been nice too. 6', '2005-03-10 06:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219250, 153330, 11897, '<td valign="top">Excellent, just a tad blown out on the clouds.</td>', 'Excellent, just a tad blown out on the clouds.', '2005-03-10 06:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219252, 153109, 11897, '<td valign="top">I like this very much, nice tones.</td>', 'I like this very much, nice tones.', '2005-03-10 06:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219253, 152980, 7473, '<td valign="top">Classic Ansel Adams shot.  The contrast between the rock and the snow is nice.  The dark sky adds an interesting tone to the image.  The only thing I could say is possible a few more trees at the bottom (if they exist at this place) would be nice.  Something to lead you up the mountain.  7</td>', 'Classic Ansel Adams shot.  The contrast between the rock and the snow is nice.  The dark sky adds an interesting tone to the image.  The only thing I could say is possible a few more trees at the bottom (if they exist at this place) would be nice.  Something to lead you up the mountain.  7', '2005-03-10 06:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219254, 152500, 7473, '<td valign="top">The lines and curves on this image are very nice.  This photo looks very nice in BW  and I love the shadowing effect created by the bark.   6</td>', 'The lines and curves on this image are very nice.  This photo looks very nice in BW  and I love the shadowing effect created by the bark.   6', '2005-03-10 06:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219256, 152486, 7473, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture of Seven Sisters.  I like the contrasting effect that the white cliff face has with the sky and the top of the cliff.  Good activity in the Water......................What is the rock to the right side, did that fall off?  Nice --8</td>', 'Very nice picture of Seven Sisters.  I like the contrasting effect that the white cliff face has with the sky and the top of the cliff.  Good activity in the Water......................What is the rock to the right side, did that fall off?  Nice --8', '2005-03-10 06:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219257, 153005, 11897, '<td valign="top">A little over exposed.</td>', 'A little over exposed.', '2005-03-10 06:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219259, 153226, 7473, '<td valign="top">This photo does not do it for me.  There is not enough character in the snow to warrent putting that much of the picture as snow at the bottom, The trees are interesting, the valley below is interesting,   4</td>', 'This photo does not do it for me.  There is not enough character in the snow to warrent putting that much of the picture as snow at the bottom, The trees are interesting, the valley below is interesting,   4', '2005-03-10 06:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219260, 152548, 11897, '<td valign="top">A little over exposed.</td>', 'A little over exposed.', '2005-03-10 06:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219261, 153246, 11897, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus.</td>', 'A little out of focus.', '2005-03-10 06:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219262, 152350, 7473, '<td valign="top">Lot of character, The mountain face with all the pines or cyprses?  is very intrigueing.  The water below adds contrast.  I lilke the fact that there are very few clouds.  The sky does not distract from the rest of the picture. 7</td>', 'Lot of character, The mountain face with all the pines or cyprses?  is very intrigueing.  The water below adds contrast.  I lilke the fact that there are very few clouds.  The sky does not distract from the rest of the picture. 7', '2005-03-10 06:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219263, 152320, 11897, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones, if I were to criticise at all, I feel there is a little too much foreground but a great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful tones, if I were to criticise at all, I feel there is a little too much foreground but a great shot.', '2005-03-10 06:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219264, 152088, 7473, '<td valign="top">I like the strong line that is created by the pier on the right side.  Good activity on the left side with the waves.  Good detail on the ples that are close to the viewer.  Nice - 6</td>', 'I like the strong line that is created by the pier on the right side.  Good activity on the left side with the waves.  Good detail on the ples that are close to the viewer.  Nice - 6', '2005-03-10 06:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1219265, 152989, 7473, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed.  The cloud cover is nice with lots of light and dark areas.  The contrast on the mountain works well with the dark valley below.  nice - 8</td>', 'Very nice indeed.  The cloud cover is nice with lots of light and dark areas.  The contrast on the mountain works well with the dark valley below.  nice - 8', '2005-03-10 06:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
