(1220201, 153390, 7473, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the snow and the tree is nice.  However, this photo does not catch my attention.  5</td>', 'The contrast between the snow and the tree is nice.  However, this photo does not catch my attention.  5', '2005-03-10 15:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220203, 153253, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that this could be sharper and that more contrast in the sky would really help.</td>', 'I feel that this could be sharper and that more contrast in the sky would really help.', '2005-03-10 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220207, 153404, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, great view, great composition. If anything, I feel that the right-hand side may be a little too dark.</td>', 'Great contrast, great view, great composition. If anything, I feel that the right-hand side may be a little too dark.', '2005-03-10 15:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220208, 152305, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great feel here.</td>', 'Great feel here.', '2005-03-10 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220210, 152362, 24212, '<td valign="top">I quite like the composition, but feel that the sky is a little flat and the foreground a little too dark.</td>', 'I quite like the composition, but feel that the sky is a little flat and the foreground a little too dark.', '2005-03-10 15:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220211, 153289, 7473, '<td valign="top">I like dark trees, I like the velvety looking pasture with the cows dotted along the right hand side.  The sky has enough contrast and character to be interesting but not so much that it draws your attention away from the pasture.  Nice shot - 9</td>', 'I like dark trees, I like the velvety looking pasture with the cows dotted along the right hand side.  The sky has enough contrast and character to be interesting but not so much that it draws your attention away from the pasture.  Nice shot - 9', '2005-03-10 15:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220214, 152341, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the way that the grain of the wood disappears into blackness as one''s eye moves up the frame. It could be a little sharper as far as I''m concerned.</td>', 'I really like the way that the grain of the wood disappears into blackness as one''s eye moves up the frame. It could be a little sharper as far as I''m concerned.', '2005-03-10 15:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220215, 153427, 7473, '<td valign="top">This  image gives the impression that it is tilted.  is this correct or is it a play on the hills?  I like the strong line of the bridge and I like the bridge to the left.  Adds good character.  The truck in the middle I think should have been  left out.  5</td>', 'This  image gives the impression that it is tilted.  is this correct or is it a play on the hills?  I like the strong line of the bridge and I like the bridge to the left.  Adds good character.  The truck in the middle I think should have been  left out.  5', '2005-03-10 15:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220216, 152044, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the contrast here. If anything, I find the snow in the centre just a touch too bright.</td>', 'I really like the composition and the contrast here. If anything, I find the snow in the centre just a touch too bright.', '2005-03-10 15:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220219, 152465, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but feel that a little extra USM might bring out a bit of extra sharpness and contrast.</td>', 'I like the composition, but feel that a little extra USM might bring out a bit of extra sharpness and contrast.', '2005-03-10 15:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220222, 152366, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but it looks a little grainy to my tired eyes.</td>', 'I like the composition, but it looks a little grainy to my tired eyes.', '2005-03-10 15:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220224, 152660, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, the hull looks to be too dark.</td>', 'To me, the hull looks to be too dark.', '2005-03-10 15:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220225, 152890, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like this close-up, but I''d perhaps like to see it a bit sharper.</td>', 'I like this close-up, but I''d perhaps like to see it a bit sharper.', '2005-03-10 15:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220228, 152992, 24212, '<td valign="top">A lovely view with plenty of depth.</td>', 'A lovely view with plenty of depth.', '2005-03-10 15:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220231, 153269, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the view, but the wave at the back looks a little overprocessed to me and jars in comparison to the rest of the image.</td>', 'I really like the view, but the wave at the back looks a little overprocessed to me and jars in comparison to the rest of the image.', '2005-03-10 15:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220234, 152824, 7473, '<td valign="top">I think the bridge should have been a third up from the bottom with less water.  The water is nice but there is not enough life in it .  The clouds in this picture are farm more interesting then the water.  5</td>', 'I think the bridge should have been a third up from the bottom with less water.  The water is nice but there is not enough life in it .  The clouds in this picture are farm more interesting then the water.  5', '2005-03-10 15:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220235, 151440, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the subject you''ve chosen here, but feel that it could look a little sharper.</td>', 'I really like the subject you''ve chosen here, but feel that it could look a little sharper.', '2005-03-10 15:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220238, 152894, 7473, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the light and dark  areas in this image is nice.  The shadowy areas give great detail .  the sky could have been burned and dodged a little to give as much interest to them as the bottom 2/3rds.  6</td>', 'The contrast between the light and dark  areas in this image is nice.  The shadowy areas give great detail .  the sky could have been burned and dodged a little to give as much interest to them as the bottom 2/3rds.  6', '2005-03-10 15:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220239, 153205, 7473, '<td valign="top">It is not working for me.  perhaps you are seeing something that i don''t. 4</td>', 'It is not working for me.  perhaps you are seeing something that i don''t. 4', '2005-03-10 15:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220240, 152190, 7473, '<td valign="top">The snow cover on the woodpile is nice.  I also like how the foreground leads you into the main point of the picture.  6</td>', 'The snow cover on the woodpile is nice.  I also like how the foreground leads you into the main point of the picture.  6', '2005-03-10 15:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220243, 153201, 24212, '<td valign="top">A great study, I just feel that the backlighting is a little overpowering.</td>', 'A great study, I just feel that the backlighting is a little overpowering.', '2005-03-10 16:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220245, 153262, 7473, '<td valign="top">not doing it for me.  too much sky not enough of the ant hill - 2</td>', 'not doing it for me.  too much sky not enough of the ant hill - 2', '2005-03-10 16:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220247, 152465, 7473, '<td valign="top">I like the feathery look of the grass.  I like the contrast on the left hand tree between light and dark.  Was this a warm winters day. 5</td>', 'I like the feathery look of the grass.  I like the contrast on the left hand tree between light and dark.  Was this a warm winters day. 5', '2005-03-10 16:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220248, 153404, 13958, '<td valign="top">You did almost everythig right here. But unfortunatly only almost. Good foreground, great main feature the bridge and a fantastic sky. Composition ==&gt; first price. However in my oppinion you wasted a golden oppertunity to make a whow photo here. I think your hand was to heavy on the contrast button. The white on the water is competing to be the main feature, but clearly it is not. The trees at the right are to dark almost getting lost and the rocks in the water are just a dark spots. Go back there and re-shoot and think of the finished picture when pressing the trigger. You will see a difference.</td>', 'You did almost everythig right here. But unfortunatly only almost. Good foreground, great main feature the bridge and a fantastic sky. Composition ==> first price. However in my oppinion you wasted a golden oppertunity to make a whow photo here. I think your hand was to heavy on the contrast button. The white on the water is competing to be the main feature, but clearly it is not. The trees at the right are to dark almost getting lost and the rocks in the water are just a dark spots. Go back there and re-shoot and think of the finished picture when pressing the trigger. You will see a difference.', '2005-03-10 16:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220250, 153303, 13958, '<td valign="top">Falling water always a winner. Nice sharp surroundings. Excellent work. 2 ideas for possible improovements (only my oppinion). Off-setting the waterfall a fraction more to left. Obviously I don`t know whats on the right, but the ground seem to come down. This would open-up the picture. And maybe a slightly faster shutterspeed. Not much, just to make it a little bit less bubble-gummy.</td>', 'Falling water always a winner. Nice sharp surroundings. Excellent work. 2 ideas for possible improovements (only my oppinion). Off-setting the waterfall a fraction more to left. Obviously I don`t know whats on the right, but the ground seem to come down. This would open-up the picture. And maybe a slightly faster shutterspeed. Not much, just to make it a little bit less bubble-gummy.', '2005-03-10 16:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220251, 152680, 7473, '<td valign="top">striking, very nice 7</td>', 'striking, very nice 7', '2005-03-10 16:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220252, 153197, 13958, '<td valign="top">You obviously having problems to find rocky mountains in your part of the world. Very well done to catch my intrest with your composition. The road, the main feature the tree and the fantastic sky. What would happen if the front road would be slightly off-set ??  Try it</td>', 'You obviously having problems to find rocky mountains in your part of the world. Very well done to catch my intrest with your composition. The road, the main feature the tree and the fantastic sky. What would happen if the front road would be slightly off-set ??  Try it', '2005-03-10 16:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220255, 153074, 13958, '<td valign="top">I love winter trees. You made almost everthing perfect. Foreground, space above the tree, main object slightly off-set, nice clouds in the sky, but I am sure you will agree with me, your photo is not a whow photo. It`s beautifull but basically it`s boring. Sorry. I have done many like that. What would make it whow is a more dramatic light. Read any photobook and prof. photographers talk about waiting waiting and waiting for the right light or they will come back when perfect. Sometime we just don`t have the time for that. Go well</td>', 'I love winter trees. You made almost everthing perfect. Foreground, space above the tree, main object slightly off-set, nice clouds in the sky, but I am sure you will agree with me, your photo is not a whow photo. It`s beautifull but basically it`s boring. Sorry. I have done many like that. What would make it whow is a more dramatic light. Read any photobook and prof. photographers talk about waiting waiting and waiting for the right light or they will come back when perfect. Sometime we just don`t have the time for that. Go well', '2005-03-10 16:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220256, 153352, 7473, '<td valign="top">Nice long road mades a nice strong line in the photo.  Is that water or a field on the left.  Also the trees in the back (fruit?) are pretty.  6</td>', 'Nice long road mades a nice strong line in the photo.  Is that water or a field on the left.  Also the trees in the back (fruit?) are pretty.  6', '2005-03-10 16:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220258, 153428, 13958, '<td valign="top">I like pictures taken against the light, always a challenge to get it right. I don`t know what was behind you, but going further back and using a ZOOM would make this almost perfect. However it probabbly was not possible. I like the empy spaces in front and above the trees. Well done.</td>', 'I like pictures taken against the light, always a challenge to get it right. I don`t know what was behind you, but going further back and using a ZOOM would make this almost perfect. However it probabbly was not possible. I like the empy spaces in front and above the trees. Well done.', '2005-03-10 16:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220259, 153481, 13958, '<td valign="top">What a dramatic sky, but did you make the most of the foreground ? To me it seems almost to "frontal". No surprise angle and no leading lines to take the eye into the picture. Nevertheless a good effort. Keep it up.</td>', 'What a dramatic sky, but did you make the most of the foreground ? To me it seems almost to "frontal". No surprise angle and no leading lines to take the eye into the picture. Nevertheless a good effort. Keep it up.', '2005-03-10 16:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220263, 153382, 21362, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual POV on this. You don''t see a lot of photos looking down.</td>', 'I like the unusual POV on this. You don''t see a lot of photos looking down.', '2005-03-10 16:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220268, 153362, 13958, '<td valign="top">What a dramatic display of tree-power. Yet, did you not over do it a bit.? A great photo must be dramatic, but should still be realistic. The black sky with the pale foreground shouts "digital manipulation". Go and re-shoot this photo and wait for perfect light conditions.You will agree with me.</td>', 'What a dramatic display of tree-power. Yet, did you not over do it a bit.? A great photo must be dramatic, but should still be realistic. The black sky with the pale foreground shouts "digital manipulation". Go and re-shoot this photo and wait for perfect light conditions.You will agree with me.', '2005-03-10 16:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220278, 151420, 11895, '<td valign="top">my guess is that this is the mother of all mountains, Everest, from northwest of it in the late afternoon, beautiful</td>', 'my guess is that this is the mother of all mountains, Everest, from northwest of it in the late afternoon, beautiful', '2005-03-10 16:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220285, 153121, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like this but I think Ansel would have had more detaild showing in the dark part just under the cliff</td>', 'I like this but I think Ansel would have had more detaild showing in the dark part just under the cliff', '2005-03-10 16:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220299, 153329, 30861, '<td valign="top">This has SO much potential. The sky''s marvelous. It falls short for me, though, in that the shadows are too blocked up, especially on right center, and the "toppling" perspective on the largest saguaro is disturbing. A strong entry, regardless.</td>', 'This has SO much potential. The sky''s marvelous. It falls short for me, though, in that the shadows are too blocked up, especially on right center, and the "toppling" perspective on the largest saguaro is disturbing. A strong entry, regardless.', '2005-03-10 16:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220307, 152756, 13958, '<td valign="top">I assume you are relatively new to this site. You just discovered how to make frames and you love it. Go easy on it. It can spoil the photo. Your took this photo right into the sun, which is not easy to do and if you don`t get it perfect when taking the picture, it will be difficult the rectify on the computer. Look for some foreground and make it visible. The picture probbably shows your home town, but to me it fails to make an impact. What is the main feature in there. Think, what do you want to show. What should I feel when I see your picture. Keep going.</td>', 'I assume you are relatively new to this site. You just discovered how to make frames and you love it. Go easy on it. It can spoil the photo. Your took this photo right into the sun, which is not easy to do and if you don`t get it perfect when taking the picture, it will be difficult the rectify on the computer. Look for some foreground and make it visible. The picture probbably shows your home town, but to me it fails to make an impact. What is the main feature in there. Think, what do you want to show. What should I feel when I see your picture. Keep going.', '2005-03-10 16:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220309, 153499, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wonderful in many ways, great use of DOF, strong subject. Bur the whoile right side is too blocked up, no shadow detail and no separation to speak of in trees/sky.</td>', 'Wonderful in many ways, great use of DOF, strong subject. Bur the whoile right side is too blocked up, no shadow detail and no separation to speak of in trees/sky.', '2005-03-10 16:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220313, 152302, 30861, '<td valign="top">Sweet and strong. I wish the top of the sky had been burned slightly to contain it a bit. I wish the little "bumps" on the very left edge had been cloned out, they are disturbing. Perhaps a tad more luminance on the snow/ice patches int he foreground, for "pop".</td>', 'Sweet and strong. I wish the top of the sky had been burned slightly to contain it a bit. I wish the little "bumps" on the very left edge had been cloned out, they are disturbing. Perhaps a tad more luminance on the snow/ice patches int he foreground, for "pop".', '2005-03-10 16:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220317, 152866, 30861, '<td valign="top">Fascinating remake of the original, suffers from lack of luminosity, an overall sense of dullness.</td>', 'Fascinating remake of the original, suffers from lack of luminosity, an overall sense of dullness.', '2005-03-10 16:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220324, 152238, 30861, '<td valign="top">Lovely in many ways, but there''s a STRONG sense of foregroudn flash here that''s flattening the image badly. The background is murky, not as luminous as it could be,a nd this doesn''t help.</td>', 'Lovely in many ways, but there''s a STRONG sense of foregroudn flash here that''s flattening the image badly. The background is murky, not as luminous as it could be,a nd this doesn''t help.', '2005-03-10 16:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220328, 151680, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful "print" I bet. I wish you coudl have gotten a touch more luminosity out of the snow, it shoudl have been doable. Not much, just a tad.  An interesting take ont he challenge.</td>', 'This is a beautiful "print" I bet. I wish you coudl have gotten a touch more luminosity out of the snow, it shoudl have been doable. Not much, just a tad.  An interesting take ont he challenge.', '2005-03-10 16:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220332, 153146, 30861, '<td valign="top">Sweet and mellow. A little noisy in the sky. A hair more luminance in the foregroudn dune, not "contrast" exactly but a sense of light glowing int he ripples, woudl take this to the next level.</td>', 'Sweet and mellow. A little noisy in the sky. A hair more luminance in the foregroudn dune, not "contrast" exactly but a sense of light glowing int he ripples, woudl take this to the next level.', '2005-03-10 16:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220335, 153233, 30861, '<td valign="top">Unfortunate cropping of the boat and geenral messiness of compositionw ith the tangled tree limbs mar this otherwise serene and mellow image.</td>', 'Unfortunate cropping of the boat and geenral messiness of compositionw ith the tangled tree limbs mar this otherwise serene and mellow image.', '2005-03-10 16:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220337, 153296, 30608, '<td valign="top">This is one of those pictures that causes you to study it just a little more. Nice capture with the framing of the tree, and with the sun bringing out the details of the branches. Good Job!</td>', 'This is one of those pictures that causes you to study it just a little more. Nice capture with the framing of the tree, and with the sun bringing out the details of the branches. Good Job!', '2005-03-10 16:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220340, 151792, 30861, '<td valign="top">Easily the best of the "tree silhouette" interpretations, I think. A little corner burning of the skyw oudl do wonders here; feel hwo the energy''s dissipating off in both upper corners?</td>', 'Easily the best of the "tree silhouette" interpretations, I think. A little corner burning of the skyw oudl do wonders here; feel hwo the energy''s dissipating off in both upper corners?', '2005-03-10 16:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220342, 153005, 20168, '<td valign="top">Excellent textures and tones.  Clouds seem a bit over exposed, but could just be the way they were that day.  Good AA style.</td>', 'Excellent textures and tones.  Clouds seem a bit over exposed, but could just be the way they were that day.  Good AA style.', '2005-03-10 16:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220345, 153203, 20168, '<td valign="top">A beatuty.  Great AA style!</td>', 'A beatuty.  Great AA style!', '2005-03-10 16:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220347, 152880, 30861, '<td valign="top">Rich and strong minimalist image.  Bumbing up. On first pass I had it in my 4''s group, big move to 8.  I have a sense that a hair more luminance coudl easily have ben attained here, taking it to the top of the heap or near it.</td>', 'Rich and strong minimalist image.  Bumbing up. On first pass I had it in my 4''s group, big move to 8.  I have a sense that a hair more luminance coudl easily have ben attained here, taking it to the top of the heap or near it.', '2005-03-10 16:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220352, 153168, 20168, '<td valign="top">Grandeur of landscape!  Great shot.  I love the simplisity of composition.</td>', 'Grandeur of landscape!  Great shot.  I love the simplisity of composition.', '2005-03-10 16:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220353, 152891, 30861, '<td valign="top">Sky burn''s tooe xtreme, especially where you lose tree/sky separation, and the composition''s busy and unfocused to me, it doesn''t seem to be "of" anything. nice tonalities, a little dark in the shadows but nice.</td>', 'Sky burn''s tooe xtreme, especially where you lose tree/sky separation, and the composition''s busy and unfocused to me, it doesn''t seem to be "of" anything. nice tonalities, a little dark in the shadows but nice.', '2005-03-10 16:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220354, 152852, 33515, '<td valign="top">Very nice, very AA. A little more to the left and it is. This is my highest scoring photo.</td>', 'Very nice, very AA. A little more to the left and it is. This is my highest scoring photo.', '2005-03-10 16:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220360, 153219, 12571, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field</td>', 'Good depth of field', '2005-03-10 16:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
