(1220772, 152305, 10818, '<td valign="top">I love the bridge in this photo,  works great with the background and makes it stand out from some of the mountain only photos.</td>', 'I love the bridge in this photo,  works great with the background and makes it stand out from some of the mountain only photos.', '2005-03-10 19:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
