(1221938, 152852, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image is - "Church, Taos Pueblo" By Ansel Adams, New Mexico, 1942.<br/> <br/>If we want to see how an actual Adams image will do in a challenge we are going to find out with this one. I''m guessing not a top finisher. (Score: 7)</td>', 'This image is - "Church, Taos Pueblo" By Ansel Adams, New Mexico, 1942. If we want to see how an actual Adams image will do in a challenge we are going to find out with this one. I''m guessing not a top finisher. (Score: 7)', '2005-03-11 16:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1221948, 153246, 34192, '<td valign="top">Can''t get much closer than that!  Seems a little out of focus and there is no one place to draw your attention except the flat grey on the side.  I can tell the texture isn''t flat but the picture appears kind of flat.</td>', 'Can''t get much closer than that!  Seems a little out of focus and there is no one place to draw your attention except the flat grey on the side.  I can tell the texture isn''t flat but the picture appears kind of flat.', '2005-03-11 16:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1221950, 153226, 34192, '<td valign="top">A lower point of view might have worked better.  There is just so much white!  Its hard to get pictures with snow on the ground.  My focus is drawn to the white in the middle but its too far away to see.  Maybe zooming in would have worked.  A lot of potential...</td>', 'A lower point of view might have worked better.  There is just so much white!  Its hard to get pictures with snow on the ground.  My focus is drawn to the white in the middle but its too far away to see.  Maybe zooming in would have worked.  A lot of potential...', '2005-03-11 16:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1221954, 153387, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting point of view but the picture itself is static.  There is some tension in the picture though, you can see where the snow might fall on the viewer at the bottom.  Maybe if there was more of that.</td>', 'Interesting point of view but the picture itself is static.  There is some tension in the picture though, you can see where the snow might fall on the viewer at the bottom.  Maybe if there was more of that.', '2005-03-11 16:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1221957, 153028, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think a lower point of view would have been great.  I keep wanting to see what is beyond that grass at the top.  Great composition otherwise.</td>', 'I think a lower point of view would have been great.  I keep wanting to see what is beyond that grass at the top.  Great composition otherwise.', '2005-03-11 16:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1221962, 152952, 34192, '<td valign="top">For me, this photo would be better if you zoom in tighter on the tree, maybe lowered the point of view.  There would be less of the backgound.  I like the photo, I just don''t love it.</td>', 'For me, this photo would be better if you zoom in tighter on the tree, maybe lowered the point of view.  There would be less of the backgound.  I like the photo, I just don''t love it.', '2005-03-11 16:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1221965, 152835, 34192, '<td valign="top">This would be an absolutely beautiful picture if it was a little sharper.  In this case, the graininess detracts.  POV and Composition are excellent, in my opinion.</td>', 'This would be an absolutely beautiful picture if it was a little sharper.  In this case, the graininess detracts.  POV and Composition are excellent, in my opinion.', '2005-03-11 16:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
