(1222090, 153504, 3032, '<td valign="top">On my screen it is slightly oversharpened (halos around the hard edges like the barb wire) and there is a strange circular gradation in the sky.<br/> <br/>But apart from that;<br/>Interesting photo to look at, composition is good, sky is interesting, especially  that strange blur that makes the clouds so fluffy. I like the dark tone of your sky vs the brightness of the stuff in front. The subject does not really make a strong impact on me.<br/> <br/>Hope you do well Sher. ;)<br/> <br/>Sander (pbase lurker)</td>', 'On my screen it is slightly oversharpened (halos around the hard edges like the barb wire) and there is a strange circular gradation in the sky. But apart from that;Interesting photo to look at, composition is good, sky is interesting, especially  that strange blur that makes the clouds so fluffy. I like the dark tone of your sky vs the brightness of the stuff in front. The subject does not really make a strong impact on me. Hope you do well Sher. ;) Sander (pbase lurker)', '2005-03-11 17:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
