(1222154, 153109, 30392, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is good!</td>', 'Wow, this is good!', '2005-03-11 18:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222156, 153225, 30392, '<td valign="top">great DOF, lovely photo. 9</td>', 'great DOF, lovely photo. 9', '2005-03-11 18:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222157, 153218, 3032, '<td valign="top">The granite looks like snow with some texture, the way you''d like snow to contrast in your photo but it never does. Strong composition (I like the diagonal) and contrast, good.</td>', 'The granite looks like snow with some texture, the way you''d like snow to contrast in your photo but it never does. Strong composition (I like the diagonal) and contrast, good.', '2005-03-11 18:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222158, 153027, 30392, '<td valign="top">Scary sky!</td>', 'Scary sky!', '2005-03-11 18:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222160, 152858, 3032, '<td valign="top">The line the moving boat draws across the harbour or river (?) is what makes the image work fore me. The contrast is interesting, but a bit too balanced, too averaged out to make it AA quality.</td>', 'The line the moving boat draws across the harbour or river (?) is what makes the image work fore me. The contrast is interesting, but a bit too balanced, too averaged out to make it AA quality.', '2005-03-11 18:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222162, 153262, 30392, '<td valign="top">Brillant composition, well done!</td>', 'Brillant composition, well done!', '2005-03-11 18:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222165, 153147, 3032, '<td valign="top">O yes, the perspective is very interesting, love the way it vanishes into the distance. Sky is good too. The only flaw is the centered position of the horizon, but many of the other elements of this photo make up for that.</td>', 'O yes, the perspective is very interesting, love the way it vanishes into the distance. Sky is good too. The only flaw is the centered position of the horizon, but many of the other elements of this photo make up for that.', '2005-03-11 18:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222170, 152891, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like it how the vignetting effect in the sky mimicks the flow of the crown of the trees. That''s what makes the photo work for me. I''d personally have lost half of the foreground.</td>', 'I like it how the vignetting effect in the sky mimicks the flow of the crown of the trees. That''s what makes the photo work for me. I''d personally have lost half of the foreground.', '2005-03-11 18:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222172, 152861, 30392, '<td valign="top">A welcome change from the gloomy landscapes! 8</td>', 'A welcome change from the gloomy landscapes! 8', '2005-03-11 18:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222173, 151432, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great, great sky. The only thing missing is a god of choice coming out of it with his fist full of lighting screaming ''Judgement Day!''.</td>', 'Great, great sky. The only thing missing is a god of choice coming out of it with his fist full of lighting screaming ''Judgement Day!''.', '2005-03-11 18:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222181, 152486, 11843, '<td valign="top">Very good tonal range! Nice beach scene.</td>', 'Very good tonal range! Nice beach scene.', '2005-03-11 18:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222184, 152614, 11843, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t suck! It was a great idea, but this seems a bit dark to me, thats all. The scene itself is very nice. I''d go back and try it again, watch for over exposure in the clouds/sky.</td>', 'This doesn''t suck! It was a great idea, but this seems a bit dark to me, thats all. The scene itself is very nice. I''d go back and try it again, watch for over exposure in the clouds/sky.', '2005-03-11 18:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222187, 152625, 11843, '<td valign="top">Exposure seems to be good! I wonder what it would have looked like if you had gotten a reflection of the peak in that water there? It''s cool how the sun peeked through to light up the peak.</td>', 'Exposure seems to be good! I wonder what it would have looked like if you had gotten a reflection of the peak in that water there? It''s cool how the sun peeked through to light up the peak.', '2005-03-11 18:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222191, 152431, 11843, '<td valign="top">Good composition and cool looking tree! Seems a bit dark on my monitor though.</td>', 'Good composition and cool looking tree! Seems a bit dark on my monitor though.', '2005-03-11 18:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222193, 153350, 11843, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections and good exposure!</td>', 'Nice reflections and good exposure!', '2005-03-11 18:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222195, 153366, 11843, '<td valign="top">Awesome looking old tree! Exposure seems good. It seems to be missing that visual depth so inherent with AA.</td>', 'Awesome looking old tree! Exposure seems good. It seems to be missing that visual depth so inherent with AA.', '2005-03-11 18:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222197, 152891, 11843, '<td valign="top">Great view! Seems a bit dark on my monitor.</td>', 'Great view! Seems a bit dark on my monitor.', '2005-03-11 18:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222200, 153352, 11843, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure! It seems to be missing that something special to look at.</td>', 'Nice exposure! It seems to be missing that something special to look at.', '2005-03-11 18:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222201, 152702, 11843, '<td valign="top">Very nice mountain shot! It seems a little dark in places on my monitor.</td>', 'Very nice mountain shot! It seems a little dark in places on my monitor.', '2005-03-11 18:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222205, 153147, 11843, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure with good tonal range!</td>', 'Excellent exposure with good tonal range!', '2005-03-11 18:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222206, 152315, 11843, '<td valign="top">Very good exposure and details.</td>', 'Very good exposure and details.', '2005-03-11 18:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222209, 153074, 11843, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure with good tonal range! Good composition and a cool looking old tree!</td>', 'Excellent exposure with good tonal range! Good composition and a cool looking old tree!', '2005-03-11 19:00:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1222213, 153439, 11843, '<td valign="top">Cool looking hills! It looks like your clouds are missing the white they used to have. and the valleys seem a little too dark on my monitor. When working with Curves, try splitting the line in half first, then adjust the top portion and the bottom portion seperately. Small changes.</td>', 'Cool looking hills! It looks like your clouds are missing the white they used to have. and the valleys seem a little too dark on my monitor. When working with Curves, try splitting the line in half first, then adjust the top portion and the bottom portion seperately. Small changes.', '2005-03-11 19:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222214, 153026, 11843, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait with good focus on the eye and good detail. The forehead seem to be a bit blown out on my monitor, other wise a good exposure.</td>', 'Nice portrait with good focus on the eye and good detail. The forehead seem to be a bit blown out on my monitor, other wise a good exposure.', '2005-03-11 19:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222216, 152747, 11843, '<td valign="top">This old coot is going to freeze his tooter off! Excellent exposure and composition.</td>', 'This old coot is going to freeze his tooter off! Excellent exposure and composition.', '2005-03-11 19:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222218, 153150, 11843, '<td valign="top">Nice mountain scene! Exposure seems a bit extreme on my monitor, a little hot in the sky and a little dark on the bottom. The middle portion has some really good detail.</td>', 'Nice mountain scene! Exposure seems a bit extreme on my monitor, a little hot in the sky and a little dark on the bottom. The middle portion has some really good detail.', '2005-03-11 19:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222221, 153288, 11843, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure with good tonal range. Good use of the reflections, I like it.</td>', 'Excellent exposure with good tonal range. Good use of the reflections, I like it.', '2005-03-11 19:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222224, 151764, 32754, '<td valign="top">beautiful work. love the tramway lines and the clouds over the mountains. ..great shadows.</td>', 'beautiful work. love the tramway lines and the clouds over the mountains. ..great shadows.', '2005-03-11 19:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222225, 151791, 32754, '<td valign="top">great contrast, very effective...just like looking at an Adams print...9</td>', 'great contrast, very effective...just like looking at an Adams print...9', '2005-03-11 19:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222227, 153014, 32754, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work..I like the soft rocks in foreground, the misting against the cliffs and the total look of this composition...9</td>', 'Beautiful work..I like the soft rocks in foreground, the misting against the cliffs and the total look of this composition...9', '2005-03-11 19:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222230, 151420, 32754, '<td valign="top">beautiful detail..lovely shadow..great shot!</td>', 'beautiful detail..lovely shadow..great shot!', '2005-03-11 19:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222232, 152983, 32754, '<td valign="top">well done, true to the challenge, shadow and terrain of cliffs is very effective..8</td>', 'well done, true to the challenge, shadow and terrain of cliffs is very effective..8', '2005-03-11 19:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222235, 152989, 32754, '<td valign="top">Lovely lovely work..love the shadow on left and light on right..I can even see two little figures on the mountain..8</td>', 'Lovely lovely work..love the shadow on left and light on right..I can even see two little figures on the mountain..8', '2005-03-11 19:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222237, 153242, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like this but maybe my only problem is that the feeling is a little too muted..still a 7</td>', 'I like this but maybe my only problem is that the feeling is a little too muted..still a 7', '2005-03-11 19:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222240, 153504, 32754, '<td valign="top">beautiful clarity and contrast..not the typical shot either..well done</td>', 'beautiful clarity and contrast..not the typical shot either..well done', '2005-03-11 19:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222243, 153388, 32754, '<td valign="top">very striking composition</td>', 'very striking composition', '2005-03-11 19:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222244, 153181, 32754, '<td valign="top">lovely detail of sycamore tree; very interesting effect..good work</td>', 'lovely detail of sycamore tree; very interesting effect..good work', '2005-03-11 19:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222245, 152212, 32754, '<td valign="top">even Adams would think this was his shot..nice job</td>', 'even Adams would think this was his shot..nice job', '2005-03-11 19:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222250, 153263, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like this one, the only problem I can see is that there''s no definite subject here..is it the tree on left? love the details..maybe if that tree were a little closer to camera..7</td>', 'I like this one, the only problem I can see is that there''s no definite subject here..is it the tree on left? love the details..maybe if that tree were a little closer to camera..7', '2005-03-11 19:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222251, 151299, 32754, '<td valign="top">I love the composition but it seems blurred on my computer...is it me?</td>', 'I love the composition but it seems blurred on my computer...is it me?', '2005-03-11 19:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222259, 152500, 32754, '<td valign="top">I love the texture and detail, the curves are wonderful..8</td>', 'I love the texture and detail, the curves are wonderful..8', '2005-03-11 19:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222267, 152623, 27847, '<td valign="top">Well deserved tribute! This shot is just beautiful! What else can I say but nice high mark here, hope you place at the top.</td>', 'Well deserved tribute! This shot is just beautiful! What else can I say but nice high mark here, hope you place at the top.', '2005-03-11 19:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222290, 153183, 33542, '<td valign="top">I think the picture would have been better w/o the boat</td>', 'I think the picture would have been better w/o the boat', '2005-03-11 20:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222317, 153240, 31403, '<td valign="top">dodging a burning to add lots more contrast would make this stunning.</td>', 'dodging a burning to add lots more contrast would make this stunning.', '2005-03-11 20:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222369, 152802, 25779, '<td valign="top">somebody said Ansel didn''t do urban scenes...i say so what 10</td>', 'somebody said Ansel didn''t do urban scenes...i say so what 10', '2005-03-11 21:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222418, 152044, 33924, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous photograph-my favorite of the challenge! The contrasts of b + w and the shades of grey in between are beautiful. The darkness of the clouds, the way the white of the church stands out, the textures of the graves, as well as the walls of the church - these are all things that stand out to me.<br/></td>', 'This is a gorgeous photograph-my favorite of the challenge! The contrasts of b + w and the shades of grey in between are beautiful. The darkness of the clouds, the way the white of the church stands out, the textures of the graves, as well as the walls of the church - these are all things that stand out to me.', '2005-03-11 22:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222425, 153443, 33924, '<td valign="top">This photo communicates a sense of mystery and a bit of a feeling of dread, too, with it''s locked doors and gate, the dark foreboding sky, the stark tree and the black points on the building. The contrast of darks and lights is very nice and the photo includes a large palette of grays too. A couple things that I think could have made your photo stronger would have been to somehow eliminate the 2 trees that you just see a bit of, on the left and on the right. This would have been especially nice on the left, as it would have made the shape of the church stand out a bit more. The texture of the roadway in the foreground is very nice too, but perhaps cropping it a bit too would make the whole composition stronger. All in all, it''s one of my top pics.</td>', 'This photo communicates a sense of mystery and a bit of a feeling of dread, too, with it''s locked doors and gate, the dark foreboding sky, the stark tree and the black points on the building. The contrast of darks and lights is very nice and the photo includes a large palette of grays too. A couple things that I think could have made your photo stronger would have been to somehow eliminate the 2 trees that you just see a bit of, on the left and on the right. This would have been especially nice on the left, as it would have made the shape of the church stand out a bit more. The texture of the roadway in the foreground is very nice too, but perhaps cropping it a bit too would make the whole composition stronger. All in all, it''s one of my top pics.', '2005-03-11 23:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222430, 153168, 33924, '<td valign="top">The mountain in this photo is absolutely gorgeous - the contrasts of b+w are so powerful. For me, that dark part of the sky is so large, though, that it competes with the mountain in this composition. Perhaps cropping the top 1/4 of the way down would have strengthened it. All in all, your pic is one of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'The mountain in this photo is absolutely gorgeous - the contrasts of b+w are so powerful. For me, that dark part of the sky is so large, though, that it competes with the mountain in this composition. Perhaps cropping the top 1/4 of the way down would have strengthened it. All in all, your pic is one of my favorites of the challenge.', '2005-03-11 23:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222463, 153171, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice photo</td>', 'Nice photo', '2005-03-11 23:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222465, 153132, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice tonal range</td>', 'Nice tonal range', '2005-03-11 23:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222469, 152614, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  You''ve lost your low zones though (too dark)...<br/>TC</td>', 'Interesting composition.  You''ve lost your low zones though (too dark)...TC', '2005-03-11 23:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222472, 153274, 9906, '<td valign="top">Compositionally it''s a little busy and the house just doesn''t seem like it''s placed right.  Maybe  if the front door opened into the frame?  Also looks like you lost some of your highlite detail.<br/>TC</td>', 'Compositionally it''s a little busy and the house just doesn''t seem like it''s placed right.  Maybe  if the front door opened into the frame?  Also looks like you lost some of your highlite detail.TC', '2005-03-11 23:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222474, 153321, 9906, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t seem to be a subject...<br/>TC</td>', 'There doesn''t seem to be a subject...TC', '2005-03-11 23:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222476, 153169, 9906, '<td valign="top">Your sky doesn''t seem to match your lighting on the tree....  Also your subject seems a touch soft and too centered.<br/>TC</td>', 'Your sky doesn''t seem to match your lighting on the tree....  Also your subject seems a touch soft and too centered.TC', '2005-03-11 23:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222479, 152981, 9906, '<td valign="top">IMHO this is overprocessed.  You have lost your dark detail in the background and your highlites in the snow.  Your sky doesn''t look natural.  Kinda like there was too much playing around with the levels...<br/>TC</td>', 'IMHO this is overprocessed.  You have lost your dark detail in the background and your highlites in the snow.  Your sky doesn''t look natural.  Kinda like there was too much playing around with the levels...TC', '2005-03-11 23:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222480, 153172, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely processed if a touch soft.  I can''t seem to find a subject though...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely processed if a touch soft.  I can''t seem to find a subject though...TC', '2005-03-11 23:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222484, 152486, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Your leading lines almost take the place of a subject.  I say almost because I keep following the lines into the background to find...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely done.  Your leading lines almost take the place of a subject.  I say almost because I keep following the lines into the background to find...TC', '2005-03-11 23:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222486, 153493, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great tonality and detail (sharpness) but it looks a little busy with no real subject to let your eye rest upon...<br/>TC</td>', 'Great tonality and detail (sharpness) but it looks a little busy with no real subject to let your eye rest upon...TC', '2005-03-11 23:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222489, 153388, 12045, '<td valign="top">This is very on Topic!  Good Work!</td>', 'This is very on Topic!  Good Work!', '2005-03-11 23:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222490, 153255, 12045, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2005-03-11 23:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222526, 152500, 33924, '<td valign="top">The light that helped capture this texture is just right. Great contrasts and lines!</td>', 'The light that helped capture this texture is just right. Great contrasts and lines!', '2005-03-12 00:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222529, 152942, 27735, '<td valign="top">Hey, I''ve been there!</td>', 'Hey, I''ve been there!', '2005-03-12 00:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222542, 151984, 9906, '<td valign="top">AWESOME composition.  there is not enough detail in the background though to make this a shot that is truly effective or truly AA like as I understand the works of the master.  The detail that IS there is actually a little distracting from the simple elegance of the flowers.  In other words, you need either more detail in the background or less.  I''m not an expert in Ansels work, but this doesn''t feel quite right to me for this challenge.<br/>TC</td>', 'AWESOME composition.  there is not enough detail in the background though to make this a shot that is truly effective or truly AA like as I understand the works of the master.  The detail that IS there is actually a little distracting from the simple elegance of the flowers.  In other words, you need either more detail in the background or less.  I''m not an expert in Ansels work, but this doesn''t feel quite right to me for this challenge.TC', '2005-03-12 00:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222547, 153148, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  My only complaint (and it''s a small one) is that there are too many boats IMHO.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely done.  My only complaint (and it''s a small one) is that there are too many boats IMHO.TC', '2005-03-12 00:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222555, 153362, 9906, '<td valign="top">IMHO your sky doesn''t match the rest of the picture.  This makes the shot look unnatural and forced into a niche...<br/>TC</td>', 'IMHO your sky doesn''t match the rest of the picture.  This makes the shot look unnatural and forced into a niche...TC', '2005-03-12 00:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222561, 153469, 9906, '<td valign="top">Confusion sets in.  Your title says the subject should be the dafodils, but your shot says that the subject should be the sky.  Discarding the title, the sky alone is not enough to create a lasting impression.<br/>TC</td>', 'Confusion sets in.  Your title says the subject should be the dafodils, but your shot says that the subject should be the sky.  Discarding the title, the sky alone is not enough to create a lasting impression.TC', '2005-03-12 00:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222563, 153018, 9906, '<td valign="top">As far as the eye can see there is no subject for this shot.  You don''t have leading lines taking you into the shot either.  There is some texture, but it is muted by the lack of contrast.  There is nothing here to hold the interest of the viewer.  An awesome landscape without some kind of subject is just (in this case) a couple of hills...<br/>TC</td>', 'As far as the eye can see there is no subject for this shot.  You don''t have leading lines taking you into the shot either.  There is some texture, but it is muted by the lack of contrast.  There is nothing here to hold the interest of the viewer.  An awesome landscape without some kind of subject is just (in this case) a couple of hills...TC', '2005-03-12 01:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222566, 153109, 9906, '<td valign="top">Burn the top corners of the sky into near black and this would be an almost perfect faux AA!<br/>TC</td>', 'Burn the top corners of the sky into near black and this would be an almost perfect faux AA!TC', '2005-03-12 01:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222574, 153232, 18194, '<td valign="top">The dodging is pretty obvious in this photo but still pleasing.  Whether this is in Adams style I cant really say but I like it8</td>', 'The dodging is pretty obvious in this photo but still pleasing.  Whether this is in Adams style I cant really say but I like it8', '2005-03-12 01:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222577, 152614, 18194, '<td valign="top">Maybe not the best title. The shadow areas have not detail, but I would not say it sucks.</td>', 'Maybe not the best title. The shadow areas have not detail, but I would not say it sucks.', '2005-03-12 01:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222578, 153183, 18194, '<td valign="top">Very nice tonal range..9</td>', 'Very nice tonal range..9', '2005-03-12 01:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222579, 152756, 18194, '<td valign="top">This has a very narrow range of tones, mostly gray. There are not real dark areas. The sky does have high lights but much of these are blown out.</td>', 'This has a very narrow range of tones, mostly gray. There are not real dark areas. The sky does have high lights but much of these are blown out.', '2005-03-12 01:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222580, 152145, 18194, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-03-12 01:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222582, 153299, 18194, '<td valign="top">I have to assume that you put the gain in?  Adams worked pretty hard not to have grain using large format cameras, this look more like it would be from a 35mm camera shooting fast film.</td>', 'I have to assume that you put the gain in?  Adams worked pretty hard not to have grain using large format cameras, this look more like it would be from a 35mm camera shooting fast film.', '2005-03-12 01:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222584, 152238, 18194, '<td valign="top">very good range of tonality.  I like the subject if the forground...8</td>', 'very good range of tonality.  I like the subject if the forground...8', '2005-03-12 01:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222586, 152852, 18194, '<td valign="top">The lower part of this photo is very good, but the sky has ended up looking blotchy</td>', 'The lower part of this photo is very good, but the sky has ended up looking blotchy', '2005-03-12 01:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222588, 153381, 18194, '<td valign="top">Very soft focus and not enough DOF.</td>', 'Very soft focus and not enough DOF.', '2005-03-12 01:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222589, 152605, 18194, '<td valign="top">Great control of the highlights.</td>', 'Great control of the highlights.', '2005-03-12 01:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222590, 153394, 18194, '<td valign="top">Very soft focus</td>', 'Very soft focus', '2005-03-12 01:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222591, 151696, 18194, '<td valign="top">This kind of looks like it was taken with the headlight from a car, I assume the effects from dodging?</td>', 'This kind of looks like it was taken with the headlight from a car, I assume the effects from dodging?', '2005-03-12 01:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222624, 152500, 27767, '<td valign="top">Composition: 10, smooth and flowing lines are quite nice<br/>Technical: 9, good tone range<br/>Appeal: 9<br/>Challenge: 10<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 10</td>', 'Composition: 10, smooth and flowing lines are quite niceTechnical: 9, good tone rangeAppeal: 9Challenge: 10Overall Calculated Average Score: 10', '2005-03-12 03:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
