(1222896, 153115, 19978, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image and a great entry to this challenge. The reflections on the water are superb. The contrast range seems just right and is very Adamsish. The lightness of the trees is awkward though but I''m sure a result of the way you processed the image. This is the look I was going for in my entry as well. You achieved it much better than I, and your final score will show it. I give you an 8. Very well done.</td>', 'A beautiful image and a great entry to this challenge. The reflections on the water are superb. The contrast range seems just right and is very Adamsish. The lightness of the trees is awkward though but I''m sure a result of the way you processed the image. This is the look I was going for in my entry as well. You achieved it much better than I, and your final score will show it. I give you an 8. Very well done.', '2005-03-12 08:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222898, 153333, 19978, '<td valign="top">You nailed it. This image has everything going for it. Great look and feel.</td>', 'You nailed it. This image has everything going for it. Great look and feel.', '2005-03-12 08:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222905, 153443, 3724, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Spanish mission elevation - Skillfull crop and composition bring out this narrative.  Interesting gated door offset and complement the ancient/distressed  butress wall and foreground cobbstone street.  Obvious care taken with exposure and superior processing.  A quality of drama is sustained by sky and trees which contrast  in a subtle but realistic way w/ lighting on the facade.  It is interesting the way the tree and tower are parallel on the horizon.</td>', 'Beautiful Spanish mission elevation - Skillfull crop and composition bring out this narrative.  Interesting gated door offset and complement the ancient/distressed  butress wall and foreground cobbstone street.  Obvious care taken with exposure and superior processing.  A quality of drama is sustained by sky and trees which contrast  in a subtle but realistic way w/ lighting on the facade.  It is interesting the way the tree and tower are parallel on the horizon.', '2005-03-12 08:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222909, 152044, 19943, '<td valign="top">Wow, great shadows, perspective, and subject.</td>', 'Wow, great shadows, perspective, and subject.', '2005-03-12 08:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222913, 153014, 19943, '<td valign="top">What a great shot.  The details of the boulders and cliff are fantastic.  The mood of the mist/fog makes this especially great. (10)</td>', 'What a great shot.  The details of the boulders and cliff are fantastic.  The mood of the mist/fog makes this especially great. (10)', '2005-03-12 08:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222915, 152367, 19943, '<td valign="top">Great use of symmetry, texture, and title.  (9)</td>', 'Great use of symmetry, texture, and title.  (9)', '2005-03-12 09:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222918, 152858, 19943, '<td valign="top">The best urban shot.  The sky is incredible.  The moving boat is a great feature to what would have been too static of a shot.  Nice job.</td>', 'The best urban shot.  The sky is incredible.  The moving boat is a great feature to what would have been too static of a shot.  Nice job.', '2005-03-12 09:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
