(1223068, 151651, 26679, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here, I just wish you had managed to use more of the tonal range, There is plenty of light and dark, but little mid range tones....</td>', 'I like the composition here, I just wish you had managed to use more of the tonal range, There is plenty of light and dark, but little mid range tones....', '2005-03-12 11:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223071, 153233, 26679, '<td valign="top">You have a great image here which beautifully uses the full range of tones. I feel the border is a little too large and becomes a little overbearing..... but I do like the picture</td>', 'You have a great image here which beautifully uses the full range of tones. I feel the border is a little too large and becomes a little overbearing..... but I do like the picture', '2005-03-12 11:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223072, 152006, 26679, '<td valign="top">Ansel Adams style involved using the full tonal range from light to dark. This image tends to stay in the mid to dark tonal range, I feel that there is opportunity to introduce some lighter tones in the water..</td>', 'Ansel Adams style involved using the full tonal range from light to dark. This image tends to stay in the mid to dark tonal range, I feel that there is opportunity to introduce some lighter tones in the water..', '2005-03-12 11:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223074, 152861, 26679, '<td valign="top">I would expect to see a greater use of the tonal range between light and dark. This image tends to have light and dark tones, but is missing much of the mid tone range..</td>', 'I would expect to see a greater use of the tonal range between light and dark. This image tends to have light and dark tones, but is missing much of the mid tone range..', '2005-03-12 11:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223075, 153258, 34909, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-03-12 11:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223076, 152292, 26679, '<td valign="top">The tracks have an interesting shape and structure to them. However as am Ansel Adams picture I would expect to see a greater use of all the tones between light and dark</td>', 'The tracks have an interesting shape and structure to them. However as am Ansel Adams picture I would expect to see a greater use of all the tones between light and dark', '2005-03-12 11:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223081, 152747, 26679, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image, however for it to score well in an Ansel Adams challenge I feel it needs to shower more of the tonal range between light and dark</td>', 'This is a lovely image, however for it to score well in an Ansel Adams challenge I feel it needs to shower more of the tonal range between light and dark', '2005-03-12 11:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223084, 151696, 26679, '<td valign="top">the basic image has a night time glow.feel to it, and you have managed to use all tonal range. Its a shame that there is evedence of the water/snow drops on the lens when you took this</td>', 'the basic image has a night time glow.feel to it, and you have managed to use all tonal range. Its a shame that there is evedence of the water/snow drops on the lens when you took this', '2005-03-12 11:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223091, 153441, 20168, '<td valign="top">Grand depth of field in this landscape photo.  I miss the Zone X whites which would have nicely offset the deep blacks in the lower left corner.  Still beautiful shot.</td>', 'Grand depth of field in this landscape photo.  I miss the Zone X whites which would have nicely offset the deep blacks in the lower left corner.  Still beautiful shot.', '2005-03-12 11:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223092, 152341, 26679, '<td valign="top">I tend to find that placing the main subject in the centre of a picture makes it feel isolated and satic.<br/>The stalk on the diagonal sould add some strength to the composition, however this is slightly lost in the background as it has the same colour tones.</td>', 'I tend to find that placing the main subject in the centre of a picture makes it feel isolated and satic.The stalk on the diagonal sould add some strength to the composition, however this is slightly lost in the background as it has the same colour tones.', '2005-03-12 11:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223095, 153197, 20168, '<td valign="top">The half sun is distracting as is the human structure between the trees.  That nitpick out of the way, I love the details along the dirt road, the clarity of the tree, the wonder of the clouds giving this a distinctive AA style.  Good photo!</td>', 'The half sun is distracting as is the human structure between the trees.  That nitpick out of the way, I love the details along the dirt road, the clarity of the tree, the wonder of the clouds giving this a distinctive AA style.  Good photo!', '2005-03-12 11:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223099, 153121, 20168, '<td valign="top">Good tonal range.  Perhaps a slower exposure would have given the falls some more fluid shape to add to the composition.  I like the contrast of bright and dark among the rocks and trees.</td>', 'Good tonal range.  Perhaps a slower exposure would have given the falls some more fluid shape to add to the composition.  I like the contrast of bright and dark among the rocks and trees.', '2005-03-12 11:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223109, 153258, 20168, '<td valign="top">Cool shot of a rustic setting, with brightness and shadows nicely handled.  The structure in the lower left foreground seems out of place to my eye, not in context.  I also miss clouds.  Thanks for a great AA style American rural scene.</td>', 'Cool shot of a rustic setting, with brightness and shadows nicely handled.  The structure in the lower left foreground seems out of place to my eye, not in context.  I also miss clouds.  Thanks for a great AA style American rural scene.', '2005-03-12 11:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
