(1223626, 152366, 6870, '<td valign="top">Well, I can''t say it looks like Ansel Adams, but I LOVE this shot. The tones are marvelous and capture texture well: darks and lights have lots of interesting texture. Composition and point of view are unique and effective. I also love the gritty feel to this. Not Ansel, but wonderful. 9</td>', 'Well, I can''t say it looks like Ansel Adams, but I LOVE this shot. The tones are marvelous and capture texture well: darks and lights have lots of interesting texture. Composition and point of view are unique and effective. I also love the gritty feel to this. Not Ansel, but wonderful. 9', '2005-03-12 21:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
