(1224151, 153389, 13381, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would be served by higher contrast.  You might try the channel mixer method of changing to black and white, if you have access to photoshop, and setting the red channel to some negative number to make the brick blacker than it is for starker contrast.</td>', 'I think this photo would be served by higher contrast.  You might try the channel mixer method of changing to black and white, if you have access to photoshop, and setting the red channel to some negative number to make the brick blacker than it is for starker contrast.', '2005-03-13 09:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224154, 152088, 13381, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field, and I like the waves in the background.  It appears to be an overcast day, which makes it hard to achieve an Ansel Adams sky.  I had the same problem on my photo.</td>', 'Nice depth of field, and I like the waves in the background.  It appears to be an overcast day, which makes it hard to achieve an Ansel Adams sky.  I had the same problem on my photo.', '2005-03-13 09:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224155, 153363, 13381, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines and shapes -- what great trees up there at the top of the ravine.  I wish there were starker contrast, though, especially in the foreground.</td>', 'Beautiful lines and shapes -- what great trees up there at the top of the ravine.  I wish there were starker contrast, though, especially in the foreground.', '2005-03-13 09:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224158, 153226, 13381, '<td valign="top">I like the bands that make up this image.  It''s a bit like a flag... mid-gray band at the top, darker gray band at the middle, and whitish at the bottom.  The snow looks blown out to me, which is unfortunate.</td>', 'I like the bands that make up this image.  It''s a bit like a flag... mid-gray band at the top, darker gray band at the middle, and whitish at the bottom.  The snow looks blown out to me, which is unfortunate.', '2005-03-13 09:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224160, 153225, 13381, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.  The landscape is very dramatic, and the composition sends my eye sweeping through the shot.</td>', 'Very beautiful.  The landscape is very dramatic, and the composition sends my eye sweeping through the shot.', '2005-03-13 09:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224164, 152614, 13381, '<td valign="top">Dear photographer,<br/> <br/>We all suck, and you less than some. I like the dark dark blacks in contrast with the whites.  I don''t like the tracks going through the little village of cabins.</td>', 'Dear photographer, We all suck, and you less than some. I like the dark dark blacks in contrast with the whites.  I don''t like the tracks going through the little village of cabins.', '2005-03-13 09:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224165, 151656, 13381, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Beautiful composition, and lovely skies.</td>', 'Very nice. Beautiful composition, and lovely skies.', '2005-03-13 09:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224168, 153303, 13381, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Beautiful silky waterfall.  It''s not very big, but the angle gives it a sense of exaggerated scale.</td>', 'Very nice.  Beautiful silky waterfall.  It''s not very big, but the angle gives it a sense of exaggerated scale.', '2005-03-13 09:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224170, 153139, 13381, '<td valign="top">I don''t begrudge you your limited scenery, but I think Ansel would''ve tried to find a less prohibitive angle to shoot from.  The background isn''t very compelling here, scenery aside.</td>', 'I don''t begrudge you your limited scenery, but I think Ansel would''ve tried to find a less prohibitive angle to shoot from.  The background isn''t very compelling here, scenery aside.', '2005-03-13 09:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224171, 152326, 13381, '<td valign="top">Very lovely.  It has an infrared quality to it.  I wish the left part of the tree didn''t fade into the white of the sky, but my monitor blows out whites to some extent, so I won''t worry about it much.</td>', 'Very lovely.  It has an infrared quality to it.  I wish the left part of the tree didn''t fade into the white of the sky, but my monitor blows out whites to some extent, so I won''t worry about it much.', '2005-03-13 09:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224173, 152362, 13381, '<td valign="top">I think Ansel would''ve scooted forward a bit, to make it easier to crop out those drainage pipes.</td>', 'I think Ansel would''ve scooted forward a bit, to make it easier to crop out those drainage pipes.', '2005-03-13 09:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224174, 153115, 13381, '<td valign="top">The whites seem blown out, but the effect is very nice.</td>', 'The whites seem blown out, but the effect is very nice.', '2005-03-13 09:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224175, 153190, 13381, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more tone contrast, and maybe some more sharpening, as well.</td>', 'I''d like to see more tone contrast, and maybe some more sharpening, as well.', '2005-03-13 09:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224184, 152330, 31443, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, pity about the misunderstanding, hope they treat you well in here...I''m going to give you 5 for entering the competition :)</td>', 'Beautiful photo, pity about the misunderstanding, hope they treat you well in here...I''m going to give you 5 for entering the competition :)', '2005-03-13 09:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
