(1224271, 153492, 12571, '<td valign="top">Very nice area. Would have liked to see focus be on one fall or the other. Getting them both in the shot makes me feel like I am missing out on what is best and special about each of them. The rock wall of the first one feels too straight on, cutting off the fall behind it. It actually makes it look like two separate pictures. However, I am totally in love with the location you chose to capture and would love to see more pics of this wonderful place.</td>', 'Very nice area. Would have liked to see focus be on one fall or the other. Getting them both in the shot makes me feel like I am missing out on what is best and special about each of them. The rock wall of the first one feels too straight on, cutting off the fall behind it. It actually makes it look like two separate pictures. However, I am totally in love with the location you chose to capture and would love to see more pics of this wonderful place.', '2005-03-13 10:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
