(1224539, 152366, 28141, '<td valign="top">Good composition but something about the coloring doesn''t feel right.  I think perhaps the highlights are too overblown.</td>', 'Good composition but something about the coloring doesn''t feel right.  I think perhaps the highlights are too overblown.', '2005-03-13 14:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224543, 153439, 28141, '<td valign="top">The border is distracting.</td>', 'The border is distracting.', '2005-03-13 14:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224546, 153205, 1031, '<td valign="top">Abstract ... macro ... not quite sure what to call this but it''s definitely well-done "in the style of ..."</td>', 'Abstract ... macro ... not quite sure what to call this but it''s definitely well-done "in the style of ..."', '2005-03-13 14:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224547, 153167, 28141, '<td valign="top">Would benefit from an uncentered composition.  Perhaps a landscape orientation with the snarled branches on one side and more sand shown.</td>', 'Would benefit from an uncentered composition.  Perhaps a landscape orientation with the snarled branches on one side and more sand shown.', '2005-03-13 14:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224555, 152671, 28141, '<td valign="top">You have some nice textures here, but the glare on the water is too distracting.</td>', 'You have some nice textures here, but the glare on the water is too distracting.', '2005-03-13 14:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224558, 151982, 28141, '<td valign="top">Yes, he did take some portraits and color shots, but in my opinion they are not what define his style.  Everyone experiments, but one''s style is what is common and familiar.  If every type of photo someone ever took were included in a description of their style, then every photographer would have essentially the same style.  In my opion, what defines Ansel Adams'' STYLE is high contrast outdoor black and whites, not every photo he ever took.  This doesn''t appear black and white to me.</td>', 'Yes, he did take some portraits and color shots, but in my opinion they are not what define his style.  Everyone experiments, but one''s style is what is common and familiar.  If every type of photo someone ever took were included in a description of their style, then every photographer would have essentially the same style.  In my opion, what defines Ansel Adams'' STYLE is high contrast outdoor black and whites, not every photo he ever took.  This doesn''t appear black and white to me.', '2005-03-13 14:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224560, 153394, 28141, '<td valign="top">Yes, he did take some portraits and color shots, but in my opinion they are not what define his style.  Everyone experiments, but one''s style is what is common and familiar.  If every type of photo someone ever took were included in a description of their style, then every photographer would have essentially the same style.  In my opion, what defines Ansel Adams'' STYLE is high contrast outdoor black and whites, not every photo he ever took.  This looks pink to me...</td>', 'Yes, he did take some portraits and color shots, but in my opinion they are not what define his style.  Everyone experiments, but one''s style is what is common and familiar.  If every type of photo someone ever took were included in a description of their style, then every photographer would have essentially the same style.  In my opion, what defines Ansel Adams'' STYLE is high contrast outdoor black and whites, not every photo he ever took.  This looks pink to me...', '2005-03-13 14:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224566, 151432, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like shooting highly-textured clouds -- you found a nice batch here.</td>', 'I like shooting highly-textured clouds -- you found a nice batch here.', '2005-03-13 14:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224570, 152852, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan of photos which have a repeating pattern like this</td>', 'I''m a fan of photos which have a repeating pattern like this', '2005-03-13 14:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224573, 153117, 1031, '<td valign="top">Not for this challenge, but the composition makes me want to run a "painting" filter on it and use it as a Christmas card : )</td>', 'Not for this challenge, but the composition makes me want to run a "painting" filter on it and use it as a Christmas card : )', '2005-03-13 14:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224574, 152177, 1031, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks a little stark to me, but I''m not sure I could adjust it any better and keep all the detail. I think what I want is a slightly more gradual transition from the mid-tones to the shadows. Texture and detail in the mids and highlights look great.</td>', 'The lighting looks a little stark to me, but I''m not sure I could adjust it any better and keep all the detail. I think what I want is a slightly more gradual transition from the mid-tones to the shadows. Texture and detail in the mids and highlights look great.', '2005-03-13 14:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224665, 152901, 7291, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  Too bad about the blown out sky.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  Too bad about the blown out sky.', '2005-03-13 16:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224667, 153115, 7291, '<td valign="top">This may have a little too much contrast but the composition is excellent.  I like the dark sky as well.</td>', 'This may have a little too much contrast but the composition is excellent.  I like the dark sky as well.', '2005-03-13 16:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224737, 152989, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene with well chosen vantage point and subject. Without those human reference points the scale of this would have been largely lost. The light is almost perfect, but lacks defintion on the nearest portion of foreground. Horizon is lightly skewed, but the ''Adams factor'' is relatively strong, despite some over-weighting of dark areas on the left of shot.</td>', 'Beautiful scene with well chosen vantage point and subject. Without those human reference points the scale of this would have been largely lost. The light is almost perfect, but lacks defintion on the nearest portion of foreground. Horizon is lightly skewed, but the ''Adams factor'' is relatively strong, despite some over-weighting of dark areas on the left of shot.', '2005-03-13 18:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224740, 153297, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice observation. Well chosen angle and it''s a pleasant scene. I particularly like the icicle that has fallen, and the meshed window. It''s not a perfect shot but has plenty of charm and there is definitely an ''Adams vibe'' in this, thanks mainly to the DOF and detail in the foreground.</td>', 'Nice observation. Well chosen angle and it''s a pleasant scene. I particularly like the icicle that has fallen, and the meshed window. It''s not a perfect shot but has plenty of charm and there is definitely an ''Adams vibe'' in this, thanks mainly to the DOF and detail in the foreground.', '2005-03-13 18:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224741, 153169, 8860, '<td valign="top">A more dynamic angle with additional features would bring some intrigue to this. You have some rich tones there, but AA''s style normally included some foreground interest and long DOF. Therefore it may have been more striking to feature some of your subject''s textures and detail rather than simply placing the entire thing in centre frame. At least shooting with light any direction other than behind you would aid contrast and definition so mving left would have brought more clarity. Image looks somewhat noisy or compressed.<br/> <br/>Your tree is pretty though with some delicate branches and a nice sky.</td>', 'A more dynamic angle with additional features would bring some intrigue to this. You have some rich tones there, but AA''s style normally included some foreground interest and long DOF. Therefore it may have been more striking to feature some of your subject''s textures and detail rather than simply placing the entire thing in centre frame. At least shooting with light any direction other than behind you would aid contrast and definition so mving left would have brought more clarity. Image looks somewhat noisy or compressed. Your tree is pretty though with some delicate branches and a nice sky.', '2005-03-13 18:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224742, 153242, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very austere, moody shot which evokes that Adams vibe quite well. Shame about the blow-out of the sun, but otherwise, it''s well composed. It does perhaps lack a key focal point though, despite a strong, well treated sky.</td>', 'Very austere, moody shot which evokes that Adams vibe quite well. Shame about the blow-out of the sun, but otherwise, it''s well composed. It does perhaps lack a key focal point though, despite a strong, well treated sky.', '2005-03-13 18:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224744, 152992, 29404, '<td valign="top">very very nice ....super nice</td>', 'very very nice ....super nice', '2005-03-13 18:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224745, 153394, 8860, '<td valign="top">An intriguing subject with some nice detail, which is marred only by a super-dense, busy background. The moonlight is almost irrelevant due to a lack of context to demonstrate time of day. Main subject is a little washed out in the foreground, so it may have been better to move round and use some directional light to pick up the form and texture better.</td>', 'An intriguing subject with some nice detail, which is marred only by a super-dense, busy background. The moonlight is almost irrelevant due to a lack of context to demonstrate time of day. Main subject is a little washed out in the foreground, so it may have been better to move round and use some directional light to pick up the form and texture better.', '2005-03-13 18:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224746, 152699, 29404, '<td valign="top">very very well done</td>', 'very very well done', '2005-03-13 18:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224751, 153246, 8860, '<td valign="top">This absolutely had to be well focused to be successful and, unfortunately it isn''t. You had a powerful, well defined subject here, so it''s a shame that you weren''t able to improve on the result here - unless you''ve cropped into a very large shot?</td>', 'This absolutely had to be well focused to be successful and, unfortunately it isn''t. You had a powerful, well defined subject here, so it''s a shame that you weren''t able to improve on the result here - unless you''ve cropped into a very large shot?', '2005-03-13 18:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224755, 151680, 8860, '<td valign="top">What a beautifully presented scene of the ''ordinary''. It has that serene, tangible silence about it that I love when snow falls and dampens sound, while delivering an uplifting sense of abandonment of rules &amp; regulations. Rare snow (as here in London) is one of those rare instant changes that society experiences which can so often change everything in a short space of time. I love it - and this could pass for an Adams due to it''s good tonal range and excellent exposure. Good luck.</td>', 'What a beautifully presented scene of the ''ordinary''. It has that serene, tangible silence about it that I love when snow falls and dampens sound, while delivering an uplifting sense of abandonment of rules & regulations. Rare snow (as here in London) is one of those rare instant changes that society experiences which can so often change everything in a short space of time. I love it - and this could pass for an Adams due to it''s good tonal range and excellent exposure. Good luck.', '2005-03-13 18:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224759, 152363, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely foreground texture and exposure. Some areas look a little to treated to me though, making it seem a bit forced, which I don''t think was necessary. I really do love the snow here - very detailed and well toned.</td>', 'Lovely foreground texture and exposure. Some areas look a little to treated to me though, making it seem a bit forced, which I don''t think was necessary. I really do love the snow here - very detailed and well toned.', '2005-03-13 18:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224760, 151791, 8860, '<td valign="top">Love the recurring patterns around the ''knob'' in this - which really makes your shot I think. Good detail and a well toned photo.</td>', 'Love the recurring patterns around the ''knob'' in this - which really makes your shot I think. Good detail and a well toned photo.', '2005-03-13 18:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224762, 152852, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject and excellent light. Detail is strong and repetition of shapes is good. There appears to be some vertical striation in the sky area - quite odd. Tones are very AA.</td>', 'Great choice of subject and excellent light. Detail is strong and repetition of shapes is good. There appears to be some vertical striation in the sky area - quite odd. Tones are very AA.', '2005-03-13 18:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224765, 153014, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great comp andexcellent deatials. An evocative shot, well suited to AA''s style. The only point I can raise is that some parts of the distant cliff look slightly too dodged in the mid-tones. Lovely sea spray and the birds make a good contextual touch.</td>', 'Great comp andexcellent deatials. An evocative shot, well suited to AA''s style. The only point I can raise is that some parts of the distant cliff look slightly too dodged in the mid-tones. Lovely sea spray and the birds make a good contextual touch.', '2005-03-13 18:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224776, 153382, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great movement through the frame, lovely subject and a very evocative time of day. Cropping out the bottoms of those distant trees makes this very powerful . I really like this.</td>', 'Great movement through the frame, lovely subject and a very evocative time of day. Cropping out the bottoms of those distant trees makes this very powerful . I really like this.', '2005-03-13 18:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224789, 153366, 8860, '<td valign="top">A touch noisy and contrasty but a great subject. Just simple enough to tip the hat towards the great man''s work.</td>', 'A touch noisy and contrasty but a great subject. Just simple enough to tip the hat towards the great man''s work.', '2005-03-13 19:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224800, 152992, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very strong, evocative photo. Love the tones and what an excellent composition.</td>', 'Very strong, evocative photo. Love the tones and what an excellent composition.', '2005-03-13 19:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224805, 152835, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very well chosen subject - one of my faves. Love the heavy silhouettes and the soft edges. A timeless vibe to this indeed.</td>', 'Very well chosen subject - one of my faves. Love the heavy silhouettes and the soft edges. A timeless vibe to this indeed.', '2005-03-13 19:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224833, 153168, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good tonal work, powerful sky.  Seems a bit oversharpened where the mountains meet the sky.</td>', 'Good tonal work, powerful sky.  Seems a bit oversharpened where the mountains meet the sky.', '2005-03-13 19:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
