(1224924, 152894, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones though this image could have allowe a touch more of the 9th zone. Still, very impressive. Bumping up.</td>', 'Very nice tones though this image could have allowe a touch more of the 9th zone. Still, very impressive. Bumping up.', '2005-03-13 20:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224926, 153240, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very good but could use a tad more contrast. Good enough for another bump.</td>', 'Very good but could use a tad more contrast. Good enough for another bump.', '2005-03-13 20:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224930, 152770, 22734, '<td valign="top">While this is good, the center is too close to zone 1 and 2. However, its beauty can not be denied as the cluds blend in with the upper mountains. Bumping up.</td>', 'While this is good, the center is too close to zone 1 and 2. However, its beauty can not be denied as the cluds blend in with the upper mountains. Bumping up.', '2005-03-13 20:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224932, 153109, 7291, '<td valign="top">Outstanding.  The sky has a strange tint to it but it doesn''t take away from the overall appeal. - 10</td>', 'Outstanding.  The sky has a strange tint to it but it doesn''t take away from the overall appeal. - 10', '2005-03-13 20:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224933, 153392, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very interesting study which would have faied much higher with a simpler background. The homogenous tones interfere with the spatial distance. It is good to sharpen a branch but care should be taken not to give it a metallic look. After all these comments, the image remains impressive because of its sheer display of strength. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very interesting study which would have faied much higher with a simpler background. The homogenous tones interfere with the spatial distance. It is good to sharpen a branch but care should be taken not to give it a metallic look. After all these comments, the image remains impressive because of its sheer display of strength. Bumping up.', '2005-03-13 20:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224938, 152890, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting natural assemblage. With these studies it is best to expose image for the 4th zone to avoid the loss of tonal stretch as the shadows area reach the 1 zone. However, interesting enough to earn a bump.</td>', 'This is a very interesting natural assemblage. With these studies it is best to expose image for the 4th zone to avoid the loss of tonal stretch as the shadows area reach the 1 zone. However, interesting enough to earn a bump.', '2005-03-13 20:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224940, 153081, 22734, '<td valign="top">An image like this is rated on the tonal expanse of the background. The more, the better. As is the silhoutte, very well framed, is not shown to its full advantage. All in all, the image has enough virtue to earn another bump.</td>', 'An image like this is rated on the tonal expanse of the background. The more, the better. As is the silhoutte, very well framed, is not shown to its full advantage. All in all, the image has enough virtue to earn another bump.', '2005-03-13 20:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224941, 152350, 7291, '<td valign="top">Excellent scene. The trees on the edge of the horizon seem wqy oversharpnened but that''s what makes this challenge so difficult. AA was the master of total DOF without looking artificial. - 8</td>', 'Excellent scene. The trees on the edge of the horizon seem wqy oversharpnened but that''s what makes this challenge so difficult. AA was the master of total DOF without looking artificial. - 8', '2005-03-13 20:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224943, 152330, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very bold with the color.  I hope you didn''t get too beat up for it.</td>', 'Very bold with the color.  I hope you didn''t get too beat up for it.', '2005-03-13 20:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224944, 152302, 4388, '<td valign="top">excellent photo, i would have moved the vanishing point higher in the photo, that is, maybe shoot from a little higher point of view and keep the near posts like they are but the far posts a lot higher in the photo. again, great shot.</td>', 'excellent photo, i would have moved the vanishing point higher in the photo, that is, maybe shoot from a little higher point of view and keep the near posts like they are but the far posts a lot higher in the photo. again, great shot.', '2005-03-13 20:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224945, 153366, 7291, '<td valign="top">I would have likes to see more of the horizon but this is a great photo anyway.</td>', 'I would have likes to see more of the horizon but this is a great photo anyway.', '2005-03-13 20:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224946, 151440, 22734, '<td valign="top">This could have been made stronger by exposing more for the 7th zone. As is, a lot of high values are lost. Regardless, it is an interesting study. Bumping up.</td>', 'This could have been made stronger by exposing more for the 7th zone. As is, a lot of high values are lost. Regardless, it is an interesting study. Bumping up.', '2005-03-13 20:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224948, 153169, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very difficult image to capture. less noise would have been better. Bumping up on good composition and great sky.</td>', 'A very difficult image to capture. less noise would have been better. Bumping up on good composition and great sky.', '2005-03-13 20:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224955, 153370, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice and neat but the tonal values appear compressed. The image begins to attract as the eyes rise. The water has a listless look. However, there is beauty because of its expanse. Bumping up.</td>', 'Very nice and neat but the tonal values appear compressed. The image begins to attract as the eyes rise. The water has a listless look. However, there is beauty because of its expanse. Bumping up.', '2005-03-13 20:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224965, 153503, 22734, '<td valign="top">Sheer simplicity in presentation. An image that that disappears onto the first zone without reason.  The highlights appear pushed. Then, there is the artistic way of looking at it and here lies the big improvement. from an artistic point of view  the image has charm and holds great interest. However, under this judgement we do not care if it was shot at 4 or 7 O''clock. Gets a bump on good composition.</td>', 'Sheer simplicity in presentation. An image that that disappears onto the first zone without reason.  The highlights appear pushed. Then, there is the artistic way of looking at it and here lies the big improvement. from an artistic point of view  the image has charm and holds great interest. However, under this judgement we do not care if it was shot at 4 or 7 O''clock. Gets a bump on good composition.', '2005-03-13 20:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224970, 152992, 22734, '<td valign="top">While this image inhibits many of the zonal tones it does it with great style and flair We see zone 1 in the darkest and closest mountains along with branches, then the 2 and 3rd zones in the greenery following immediayely and then it fades into the 9+zone as the distance is covered. The water fills in the 3,4 5 and a kiss of the 8 as it approaches towards the viewer. A comfortable image to look at Bumping to 8</td>', 'While this image inhibits many of the zonal tones it does it with great style and flair We see zone 1 in the darkest and closest mountains along with branches, then the 2 and 3rd zones in the greenery following immediayely and then it fades into the 9+zone as the distance is covered. The water fills in the 3,4 5 and a kiss of the 8 as it approaches towards the viewer. A comfortable image to look at Bumping to 8', '2005-03-13 20:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224972, 153289, 22734, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a tad subdued but with just the right amounts of 1st  zone to make the silhouttes kick in with gusto. Bumping up.</td>', 'Perhaps a tad subdued but with just the right amounts of 1st  zone to make the silhouttes kick in with gusto. Bumping up.', '2005-03-13 20:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224974, 152006, 7291, '<td valign="top">This seems too busy with no real focal point.  This probably looks very nice in color.</td>', 'This seems too busy with no real focal point.  This probably looks very nice in color.', '2005-03-13 20:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224975, 153192, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good capture with satisfying detail and tonal stretch. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very good capture with satisfying detail and tonal stretch. Bumping up.', '2005-03-13 20:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224978, 153222, 22734, '<td valign="top">Nice pleasant scene look. Bumping up to 7</td>', 'Nice pleasant scene look. Bumping up to 7', '2005-03-13 20:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224980, 153491, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well balanced in its tonal representation. A good time for shooting. Bumping up.</td>', 'Very well balanced in its tonal representation. A good time for shooting. Bumping up.', '2005-03-13 20:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1224983, 152623, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice piece of terrain. Apparant at once is evidence of the 1 and 10th zone, however, the image remains trapped between the 1 and 5th zones and then jumps to the 9th. A case where the high contrast has trashed the nobler tones to make the image shine. The place remains beautiful enough for another bump in the score.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-14 00:15:02.</i></td>', 'A very nice piece of terrain. Apparant at once is evidence of the 1 and 10th zone, however, the image remains trapped between the 1 and 5th zones and then jumps to the 9th. A case where the high contrast has trashed the nobler tones to make the image shine. The place remains beautiful enough for another bump in the score.', '2005-03-13 21:03:50.000000', '2005-03-14 00:15:02.000000', 1),
(1224985, 153148, 22734, '<td valign="top">very nice and very charming. Bumping to 7</td>', 'very nice and very charming. Bumping to 7', '2005-03-13 21:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
