(1225493, 152044, 31637, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a top ten finish robert. I liked this composition very much, and would of gave higher than my 7 I gave you if you had bolder light. Your tonal range is great so you almost pulled it off. However, a great finish on an almost perfect photograph.</td>', 'Congrats on a top ten finish robert. I liked this composition very much, and would of gave higher than my 7 I gave you if you had bolder light. Your tonal range is great so you almost pulled it off. However, a great finish on an almost perfect photograph.', '2005-03-14 00:36:34.000000', NULL, 0),
