(1225574, 153219, 9581, '<td valign="top">Yeah thats the spirit!! Just read your comment about this and I must say...impressive! Highly respected too! That means more then just being one of a kind. Good luck with future challenges.</td>', 'Yeah thats the spirit!! Just read your comment about this and I must say...impressive! Highly respected too! That means more then just being one of a kind. Good luck with future challenges.', '2005-03-14 00:54:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1225581, 153404, 27735, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kylie:</b></div><hr/><i> Bryan - gorgeous shot and great score!!! Congrats! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Kylie, where''s your shot? Don''t tell me you haven''t taken any photos lately! :-)<br/> <br/>And thank you, everyone, for your comments. I wasn''t expecting to do this well. I was going to go to Yosemite for the weekend, but friends convinced me to go to the coast with them. And then when I got home, I only had a few minutes to edit the photo and submit it. My plan is to keep submitting to every challenge as long as I can take a photo that is at least remotely related to the challenge topic.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-14 04:04:43.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Kylie: Bryan - gorgeous shot and great score!!! Congrats!   Thanks Kylie, where''s your shot? Don''t tell me you haven''t taken any photos lately! :-) And thank you, everyone, for your comments. I wasn''t expecting to do this well. I was going to go to Yosemite for the weekend, but friends convinced me to go to the coast with them. And then when I got home, I only had a few minutes to edit the photo and submit it. My plan is to keep submitting to every challenge as long as I can take a photo that is at least remotely related to the challenge topic.', '2005-03-14 00:57:30.000000', '2005-03-14 04:04:43.000000', 0),
(1225590, 153329, 16230, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo Steve! Congratulations on a well deserved blue ribbon.</td>', 'Awesome photo Steve! Congratulations on a well deserved blue ribbon.', '2005-03-14 00:59:49.000000', NULL, 0),
