(1225597, 153329, 29797, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Steve! This is an incredible photo! Truly an Ansel masterpiece!</td>', 'Congratulations Steve! This is an incredible photo! Truly an Ansel masterpiece!', '2005-03-14 01:01:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1225602, 153246, 9581, '<td valign="top">I just dont see a need in voting anymore .... I tell ya I didnt but it if I had I wouldnt of gave it anyless then a 5. In fact thinking about Adams work and his history in photography this would of been one of those test images that noone would of seen for the comparison between b&amp;W... I guess not everyone thinks like that. Better luck next time.</td>', 'I just dont see a need in voting anymore .... I tell ya I didnt but it if I had I wouldnt of gave it anyless then a 5. In fact thinking about Adams work and his history in photography this would of been one of those test images that noone would of seen for the comparison between b&W... I guess not everyone thinks like that. Better luck next time.', '2005-03-14 01:02:46.000000', NULL, 0),
