(1225611, 152302, 31637, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!! what a great finish.  I think this photo rocks ! Great perspective and lighting. Your tonal range is excellent, and you contrast is also good. I like how you obtained a good DOF and maintained light and dark contrast on both sides of the dock poles.</td>', 'Congratulations!! what a great finish.  I think this photo rocks ! Great perspective and lighting. Your tonal range is excellent, and you contrast is also good. I like how you obtained a good DOF and maintained light and dark contrast on both sides of the dock poles.', '2005-03-14 01:05:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1225614, 152901, 31440, '<td valign="top">I knew I''d over-lightened the image, and that sepia was a risk.  I''ve since done what I feel is a better edit.  I''d be curious what people think.  It''s the version I have at dpcprints.  Thanks for all the praise and the criticisms...<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.alaskanalpineclub.org" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">www.alaskanalpineclub.org</a> <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/31440/print_preview/152901.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/31440/print_preview/152901.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/31440/print_preview/152901.jpg"/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-14 01:07:55.</i></td>', 'I knew I''d over-lightened the image, and that sepia was a risk.  I''ve since done what I feel is a better edit.  I''d be curious what people think.  It''s the version I have at dpcprints.  Thanks for all the praise and the criticisms... www.alaskanalpineclub.org  ', '2005-03-14 01:06:06.000000', '2005-03-14 01:07:55.000000', 0),
