(1226036, 152330, 3569, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t do this shot justice by doing B&amp;W, thus loosing the great colors of this shot, especially the yellow willows, cottonwoods, and grass.  I thought the shot was in ths style of Adams, but glad to be the only one in color.  :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-14 07:27:12.</i></td>', 'I couldn''t do this shot justice by doing B&W, thus loosing the great colors of this shot, especially the yellow willows, cottonwoods, and grass.  I thought the shot was in ths style of Adams, but glad to be the only one in color.  :)', '2005-03-14 07:11:17.000000', '2005-03-14 07:27:12.000000', 0),
