(1226062, 152984, 17613, '<td valign="top">When I took this picture, it was not intended for the AA challenge. The comment made regarding the background is quite valid but when taken, I used a red background. Only when I decided to change it to B/W did I realise I should really have used a black background, then I would not have needed to burn it as I had to.<br/> <br/>This is only the 3rd challenge I have entered and I am always encouraged by the comments I receive. <br/> <br/>Last entry was 83rd this one 66th....... going in the right direction! Thanks all<br/> <br/>The one thing that does amaze me is that I received 1 from one person and 6 tens? how can views vary so much? I see this happens with many entries. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-14 07:33:08.</i></td>', 'When I took this picture, it was not intended for the AA challenge. The comment made regarding the background is quite valid but when taken, I used a red background. Only when I decided to change it to B/W did I realise I should really have used a black background, then I would not have needed to burn it as I had to. This is only the 3rd challenge I have entered and I am always encouraged by the comments I receive.  Last entry was 83rd this one 66th....... going in the right direction! Thanks all The one thing that does amaze me is that I received 1 from one person and 6 tens? how can views vary so much? I see this happens with many entries. ', '2005-03-14 07:29:53.000000', '2005-03-14 07:33:08.000000', 0),
