(1228781, 152770, 14603, '<td valign="top">Never got round to submitting to this challenge but this is the area I had in mind for visiting should I have found the time.<br/>Wanted to get a shot of "Buachaille Etive Mor".<br/> <br/>I really like the way you composed this and the cloud lying in the valley between the mountains adds to the "wild and remote " feel of the image.<br/>Well done.</td>', 'Never got round to submitting to this challenge but this is the area I had in mind for visiting should I have found the time.Wanted to get a shot of "Buachaille Etive Mor". I really like the way you composed this and the cloud lying in the valley between the mountains adds to the "wild and remote " feel of the image.Well done.', '2005-03-15 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
