(1228802, 153181, 14603, '<td valign="top">I really like this...it has so much to admire.<br/>The little detailed things like the light hitting the edge of the flaking bark are what make it special for me.<br/> <br/>Well done Jon.</td>', 'I really like this...it has so much to admire.The little detailed things like the light hitting the edge of the flaking bark are what make it special for me. Well done Jon.', '2005-03-15 10:22:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1228817, 152472, 14603, '<td valign="top">I agree with the previous commenters that this is a very strong image.<br/>I am especially drawn to it as it is almost an exact replica of a painting I attempted in the early 80`s.<br/> <br/>Perhaps you would have scored higher had there been some cloud to give more detail to the sky and add tonal range to the overall image...although I prefer it the way it is.<br/>Good work.</td>', 'I agree with the previous commenters that this is a very strong image.I am especially drawn to it as it is almost an exact replica of a painting I attempted in the early 80`s. Perhaps you would have scored higher had there been some cloud to give more detail to the sky and add tonal range to the overall image...although I prefer it the way it is.Good work.', '2005-03-15 10:29:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1228825, 153225, 14603, '<td valign="top">You packed a lot of detail into this one Paul.<br/>Hard to see why it didn`t score above mid fives.<br/>Perhaps the foreground and the proportion it occupies might have been a problem for some, although I like the image as is.<br/>Nice Work.</td>', 'You packed a lot of detail into this one Paul.Hard to see why it didn`t score above mid fives.Perhaps the foreground and the proportion it occupies might have been a problem for some, although I like the image as is.Nice Work.', '2005-03-15 10:37:31.000000', NULL, 0),
