(1228893, 152044, 11716, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot!  I really love this one. A small window of time to get the shot and no footprints in the snow.  A bit of luck was on your side but your skill shows through.  Congrats!</td>', 'Terrific shot!  I really love this one. A small window of time to get the shot and no footprints in the snow.  A bit of luck was on your side but your skill shows through.  Congrats!', '2005-03-15 11:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
