(1228978, 152438, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good job not scaring your subjects away when taking the photo.  ;^)  Looks like you had some moisture on the lens?  For the challenge that the photo was submitted I think the subject is a bit shallow and the tonal range is a bit limited.  Something else to consider is the composition; a general rule (not an absolute) is to off-center your subject.  The birds are centered vertically and horizontally in this image.  Your focus goes to the birds and there isn''t anything else to draw your interest into the remainder of the photo.  Keep having fun!</td>', 'Good job not scaring your subjects away when taking the photo.  ;^)  Looks like you had some moisture on the lens?  For the challenge that the photo was submitted I think the subject is a bit shallow and the tonal range is a bit limited.  Something else to consider is the composition; a general rule (not an absolute) is to off-center your subject.  The birds are centered vertically and horizontally in this image.  Your focus goes to the birds and there isn''t anything else to draw your interest into the remainder of the photo.  Keep having fun!', '2005-03-15 12:01:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1228989, 152305, 8367, '<td valign="top">Like it?...I love it! This one was my favorite of the challenge. Great work and congratulations on a top ten finish. I wish it would have finished higher for you.</td>', 'Like it?...I love it! This one was my favorite of the challenge. Great work and congratulations on a top ten finish. I wish it would have finished higher for you.', '2005-03-15 12:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1229544, 152145, 19594, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hyperfocal:</b></div><hr/><i> Is this Fall Creek Falls?  I thought I had seen just about every major water fall in the state, but this doesn''t look familar.  Good Work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I spent significant time trying to figure out where this was also. Beautiful shot, but isn''t Rock City in GA?</td>', 'Originally posted by hyperfocal: Is this Fall Creek Falls?  I thought I had seen just about every major water fall in the state, but this doesn''t look familar.  Good Work.   I spent significant time trying to figure out where this was also. Beautiful shot, but isn''t Rock City in GA?', '2005-03-15 14:34:46.000000', NULL, 0),
