(1231076, 152302, 12750, '<td valign="top">Wow, someone else from Montana! Didn''t even recognize this was flathead, though its been a very long time since I''ve been there.  Very good photo, love the contrast.</td>', 'Wow, someone else from Montana! Didn''t even recognize this was flathead, though its been a very long time since I''ve been there.  Very good photo, love the contrast.', '2005-03-16 01:00:37.000000', NULL, 0),
