(1264808, 153219, 33743, '<td valign="top">This truly makes me chuckle.  Charlie Baker:  you''ve done it again!--bonny in cannon beach</td>', 'This truly makes me chuckle.  Charlie Baker:  you''ve done it again!--bonny in cannon beach', '2005-04-02 01:24:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1271500, 153146, 6306, '<td valign="top">Why was this scored so low?!?!?! This an excellent example of Ansel''s technique.</td>', 'Why was this scored so low?!?!?! This an excellent example of Ansel''s technique.', '2005-04-05 00:09:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1277324, 152866, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by stdavidson:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on this shot. Personally, I thought it was one of the best of the challenge. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks so much! it''s nice to get this from the blue ribbon in the challenge! <br/> <br/>In the hindsight, I probably should''ve dodged and burned it to increase the "punch", but somehow I wanted to preserve a subdued tone of this photo.<br/> <br/>Thanks to all other commenters, too. always appreciated.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-07 13:08:28.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by stdavidson: Congrats on this shot. Personally, I thought it was one of the best of the challenge.   Thanks so much! it''s nice to get this from the blue ribbon in the challenge!  In the hindsight, I probably should''ve dodged and burned it to increase the "punch", but somehow I wanted to preserve a subdued tone of this photo. Thanks to all other commenters, too. always appreciated.', '2005-04-07 14:08:04.000000', '2005-04-07 14:08:28.000000', 0),
(1287846, 151584, 23478, '<td valign="top">I really like this shgot, it has a lot of personal appeal.  I like how the tree was dark and stood out against the background.  Anyhow, it would have been nice to score a bit higher...</td>', 'I really like this shgot, it has a lot of personal appeal.  I like how the tree was dark and stood out against the background.  Anyhow, it would have been nice to score a bit higher...', '2005-04-13 08:00:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1327023, 152044, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''ve obviously been working too much.  I haven''t seen this shot until just now.  This is, sans building, the kind of feel that I was shooting for in my dq''ed cemetary shot.  Cold isolation.  Forgotten.  In a better place?  This is an instant favorite!<br/>TC<br/>ps  I''m gonna make this my wallpaper till the ol'' lady gets depressed and makes me change it...  ;-)</td>', 'I''ve obviously been working too much.  I haven''t seen this shot until just now.  This is, sans building, the kind of feel that I was shooting for in my dq''ed cemetary shot.  Cold isolation.  Forgotten.  In a better place?  This is an instant favorite!TCps  I''m gonna make this my wallpaper till the ol'' lady gets depressed and makes me change it...  ;-)', '2005-04-26 02:20:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1348160, 153330, 8367, '<td valign="top">I love the wind effect on the snow banks. You''ve captured them well. The clouds top it off. Great job!</td>', 'I love the wind effect on the snow banks. You''ve captured them well. The clouds top it off. Great job!', '2005-04-30 23:27:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1403469, 152292, 20324, '<td valign="top">It reminds me my picture. <br/><a href="//artvet.smugmug.com/gallery/295785/2/13846585/Medium" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//artvet.smugmug.com/gallery/295785/2/13846585/Medium</a> <br/>I think it is underscore. Although I would crop it differently (in the square).</td>', 'It reminds me my picture. //artvet.smugmug.com/gallery/295785/2/13846585/Medium I think it is underscore. Although I would crop it differently (in the square).', '2005-05-22 04:09:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1404466, 153146, 23913, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nfessel:</b></div><hr/><i> Why was this scored so low?!?!?! This an excellent example of Ansel''s technique. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>the only reason i could see would be the grayscale isn''t quite to that of ansel''s famous zone system.......no pure black apears in this image and there for voters to for granted the beauty and the simmularities between this image and many of ansel''s.<br/> <br/>i''m also sorry this didn''t place higher great shot very nice leading lines u can really get lost in this.</td>', 'Originally posted by nfessel: Why was this scored so low?!?!?! This an excellent example of Ansel''s technique.   the only reason i could see would be the grayscale isn''t quite to that of ansel''s famous zone system.......no pure black apears in this image and there for voters to for granted the beauty and the simmularities between this image and many of ansel''s. i''m also sorry this didn''t place higher great shot very nice leading lines u can really get lost in this.', '2005-05-22 21:34:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1415455, 153388, 36499, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W adds a dramatic effect here. this photo makes me want to live here</td>', 'B&W adds a dramatic effect here. this photo makes me want to live here', '2005-05-27 08:17:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1442945, 151939, 31214, '<td valign="top">Too bad this one was disqual''d....It would have done very well!  I never saw it during the challenge.  Glad I found it now!</td>', 'Too bad this one was disqual''d....It would have done very well!  I never saw it during the challenge.  Glad I found it now!', '2005-06-09 03:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1462945, 152044, 12611, '<td valign="top">THis is a great shot- very much like the iceland shots; nice burned sky. awesome.</td>', 'THis is a great shot- very much like the iceland shots; nice burned sky. awesome.', '2005-06-17 08:49:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1468702, 153469, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Great contrast. The clouds are well done.</td>', 'Excellent. Great contrast. The clouds are well done.', '2005-06-20 09:55:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1470454, 153258, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh cool. I love rural buildings. This is a great one in black and white.</td>', 'Oh cool. I love rural buildings. This is a great one in black and white.', '2005-06-21 02:11:41.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1471505, 153109, 27373, '<td valign="top">Great photo, didn''t they shoot a Star Trek episode here?  We are headed out there next spring- (cross fingers) to do some shooting.  Love the clouds.  And remember....Imitation is the sincerest form of flattery, creation is the greatest sense of accomplishment.  Or something like that, great job in creating a unique image.</td>', 'Great photo, didn''t they shoot a Star Trek episode here?  We are headed out there next spring- (cross fingers) to do some shooting.  Love the clouds.  And remember....Imitation is the sincerest form of flattery, creation is the greatest sense of accomplishment.  Or something like that, great job in creating a unique image.', '2005-06-21 15:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1474862, 153330, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely shadowing and contrast!!!</td>', 'Lovely shadowing and contrast!!!', '2005-06-22 13:03:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1475764, 152044, 34217, '<td valign="top">I don''t even remeber voting for this when it was the current challenge, but I looks as though I gave it a ten.  I just happened upon it when you left me a comment and I looked up your profile.  It is nice to be able to enjoy it all over.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I don''t even remeber voting for this when it was the current challenge, but I looks as though I gave it a ten.  I just happened upon it when you left me a comment and I looked up your profile.  It is nice to be able to enjoy it all over.  Nicely done!', '2005-06-22 17:05:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1480057, 151792, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very nice work and worth the 80 or so shots.  The clarity is great.  The composition is perfect.  Relative contrast between foreground and background is excellent as well.  Very nice job!</td>', 'Very nice work and worth the 80 or so shots.  The clarity is great.  The composition is perfect.  Relative contrast between foreground and background is excellent as well.  Very nice job!', '2005-06-24 00:24:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1486904, 152614, 27373, '<td valign="top">Nice effort.  Too dark overall.  You have some great stuff in your portfolio.</td>', 'Nice effort.  Too dark overall.  You have some great stuff in your portfolio.', '2005-06-27 18:10:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1508215, 153231, 27514, '<td valign="top">I like your idea</td>', 'I like your idea', '2005-07-05 15:56:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1508671, 153333, 34659, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Fantastic shot!  Really beautiful use of B/W.  Lighting is superb.</td>', 'WOW!  Fantastic shot!  Really beautiful use of B/W.  Lighting is superb.', '2005-07-05 18:24:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1527426, 153345, 14614, '<td valign="top">B/W Mentor Group:<br/> <br/>Full range of tones so I don''t miss the color in the shot.  I''m wanting to get closer to the "deadwood" and somehow I connect this with the B&amp;W treatment.  It''s as if I''m wanting to see more of the tree detail?  Maybe it''s because the light gray sky is blurry and the tree is the main subject according to the title?  I find the dark and light sky a standout - defineatly a powerful element in the shot.</td>', 'B/W Mentor Group: Full range of tones so I don''t miss the color in the shot.  I''m wanting to get closer to the "deadwood" and somehow I connect this with the B&W treatment.  It''s as if I''m wanting to see more of the tree detail?  Maybe it''s because the light gray sky is blurry and the tree is the main subject according to the title?  I find the dark and light sky a standout - defineatly a powerful element in the shot.', '2005-07-11 16:18:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1530635, 153345, 2170, '<td valign="top">B/W Club!<br/> <br/>good range from black to white while limiting the "blown out" areas.  i like the rule of thirds for the composition, but it could even be shifted left or right even more to break up the balance a bit.<br/> <br/>a little more detail in the clouds and the bark would help as well.  i think there are more tones in this that we can improve upon.</td>', 'B/W Club! good range from black to white while limiting the "blown out" areas.  i like the rule of thirds for the composition, but it could even be shifted left or right even more to break up the balance a bit. a little more detail in the clouds and the bark would help as well.  i think there are more tones in this that we can improve upon.', '2005-07-12 18:21:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1530956, 153345, 37444, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Perfect subject for B&amp;W. I am trying to decide if I want more contrast - it seems to be missing something, but something small....</td>', 'I like this a lot. Perfect subject for B&W. I am trying to decide if I want more contrast - it seems to be missing something, but something small....', '2005-07-12 20:51:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1534517, 153345, 38464, '<td valign="top">B/W Group - <br/> <br/>For some reason a Tim Burton film comes to mind when I look at this tree. :)<br/> <br/>Would personally love to see either the full tree or if moved closer, to se more detail, because what I am able to see, I like. <br/> <br/>I agree with Rob, maybe shifted one way or the other would make it pop more for me. As far as colors go, the contrast of light and dark is there, but I would like to see the sky play into the image more, since it is a prominent feature. Would love to see this image processed and made to shine even more than it does. :)<br/>-Christine</td>', 'B/W Group -  For some reason a Tim Burton film comes to mind when I look at this tree. :) Would personally love to see either the full tree or if moved closer, to se more detail, because what I am able to see, I like.  I agree with Rob, maybe shifted one way or the other would make it pop more for me. As far as colors go, the contrast of light and dark is there, but I would like to see the sky play into the image more, since it is a prominent feature. Would love to see this image processed and made to shine even more than it does. :)-Christine', '2005-07-14 01:11:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1623445, 153015, 37544, '<td valign="top">this is great! I can''t figure out which one I like best, the color or bw--I can''t make up my mind!! They are both great!</td>', 'this is great! I can''t figure out which one I like best, the color or bw--I can''t make up my mind!! They are both great!', '2005-08-19 09:35:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1623566, 153015, 39566, '<td valign="top">This is good! Looks really cool with everything you got in it could be a little sharper though</td>', 'This is good! Looks really cool with everything you got in it could be a little sharper though', '2005-08-19 10:33:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1657749, 152061, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is really great!  I think it''s a great use of B/W and I love how the ground is sloping down left and the trees are looming up right.  Very good composition.</td>', 'This is really great!  I think it''s a great use of B/W and I love how the ground is sloping down left and the trees are looming up right.  Very good composition.', '2005-08-30 13:01:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1686511, 153469, 42664, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo! Makes me seriously homesick! (I grew up in the Skagit Valley, Sedro-Woolley to be exact).</td>', 'Gorgeous photo! Makes me seriously homesick! (I grew up in the Skagit Valley, Sedro-Woolley to be exact).', '2005-09-08 11:43:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1689700, 152044, 39399, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful shot.. You did something i am still trying to master. Getting detail in the snow..</td>', 'Very beautiful shot.. You did something i am still trying to master. Getting detail in the snow..', '2005-09-09 08:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1712113, 153392, 14620, '<td valign="top">This has a very apocalyptic feel to it. Very desolate and dark.  I''m sure your processing helped alot in achieving this feeling.  Very Nice.</td>', 'This has a very apocalyptic feel to it. Very desolate and dark.  I''m sure your processing helped alot in achieving this feeling.  Very Nice.', '2005-09-15 17:30:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1714035, 152680, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts and texture here.  I like the composition too.  It does have an AA feel to it.  I agree though that the background starts to lose depth.  Maybe a bit of burning to deepen the tones.  Still, a very good shot.</td>', 'Nice contrasts and texture here.  I like the composition too.  It does have an AA feel to it.  I agree though that the background starts to lose depth.  Maybe a bit of burning to deepen the tones.  Still, a very good shot.', '2005-09-16 12:33:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1714781, 153392, 14986, '<td valign="top">Very cool image.  I would have liked a bit more sky at the top where the branch is just a bit cut off, and I would have liked a bit more variety of tone.  Even just as it is, I like it alot and gave it a 7 in the challenge.</td>', 'Very cool image.  I would have liked a bit more sky at the top where the branch is just a bit cut off, and I would have liked a bit more variety of tone.  Even just as it is, I like it alot and gave it a 7 in the challenge.', '2005-09-16 18:30:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1716460, 152044, 35444, '<td valign="top">I just love this picture.  It feels like another time and place.  The lighting is great with the long shadows coming off the tombstones and the storm about to rage from above.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'I just love this picture.  It feels like another time and place.  The lighting is great with the long shadows coming off the tombstones and the storm about to rage from above.  One of my favorites.', '2005-09-17 15:41:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1747510, 152891, 31637, '<td valign="top">this is by far one of my favorite photos of yours...it fit that theme perfectly and those footprints make this whole pic !</td>', 'this is by far one of my favorite photos of yours...it fit that theme perfectly and those footprints make this whole pic !', '2005-09-29 03:42:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1757403, 153333, 31637, '<td valign="top">ill be perfectly honest with you, I scored a few more photos higher than this one in the AA challenge. But however..this was way above the average in tone depth and person and horse turn this into a magical image.</td>', 'ill be perfectly honest with you, I scored a few more photos higher than this one in the AA challenge. But however..this was way above the average in tone depth and person and horse turn this into a magical image.', '2005-10-04 03:10:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1815904, 153333, 43869, '<td valign="top">That''s beautiful!  <br/>I''m just being nosey and browsing profiles to see what kind of shots people are taking lol.  <br/> <br/>Is that Cannon Beach by any chance?  I grew up going to the OR coast every summer and see in your profile you are from OR.  We spent most of our time in Lincoln City.</td>', 'That''s beautiful!  I''m just being nosey and browsing profiles to see what kind of shots people are taking lol.   Is that Cannon Beach by any chance?  I grew up going to the OR coast every summer and see in your profile you are from OR.  We spent most of our time in Lincoln City.', '2005-10-26 19:20:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1816022, 153333, 16790, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by missinseattle:</b></div><hr/><i>Is that Cannon Beach by any chance?  I grew up going to the OR coast every summer and see in your profile you are from OR.  We spent most of our time in Lincoln City. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s actually further south, in Bandon... that''s a bit south of Coos Bay, so figure around 230 miles from Cannon Beach :)  There''s a lot of pretty, rocky coastline in Oregon, though.</td>', 'Originally posted by missinseattle:Is that Cannon Beach by any chance?  I grew up going to the OR coast every summer and see in your profile you are from OR.  We spent most of our time in Lincoln City.   It''s actually further south, in Bandon... that''s a bit south of Coos Bay, so figure around 230 miles from Cannon Beach :)  There''s a lot of pretty, rocky coastline in Oregon, though.', '2005-10-26 20:03:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1817433, 153504, 16241, '<td valign="top">this is wonderful sher!</td>', 'this is wonderful sher!', '2005-10-27 09:08:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1840185, 153084, 26464, '<td valign="top">love the contrast from top to bottom in this<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-05 11:23:31.</i></td>', 'love the contrast from top to bottom in this', '2005-11-05 11:23:21.000000', '2005-11-05 11:23:31.000000', 0),
(1863191, 153431, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like barron sense of this.  Bare trees, bare landscape.  Black and white is perfect for this image.  The composition balances itself with the two buildings and the centered tree. Really really nice!</td>', 'I really like barron sense of this.  Bare trees, bare landscape.  Black and white is perfect for this image.  The composition balances itself with the two buildings and the centered tree. Really really nice!', '2005-11-13 21:57:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1863323, 153469, 39144, '<td valign="top">Wow! Excellent b/w conversion. How did you get such a clean b/w conversion? I really like that.</td>', 'Wow! Excellent b/w conversion. How did you get such a clean b/w conversion? I really like that.', '2005-11-13 23:04:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1863330, 153469, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent black and white. The clouds in combination with the perfect rows of flowers - WOW what an image.  Think I''m adding to favs RIGHT NOW.</td>', 'Excellent black and white. The clouds in combination with the perfect rows of flowers - WOW what an image.  Think I''m adding to favs RIGHT NOW.', '2005-11-13 23:08:27.000000', NULL, 0),
